#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_BELT_NEUTRONIUM.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_BELT_NEUTRONIUM.DESC"
msgid "The only acceptable atmo belt for exalted space explorers."
msgstr "這是尊貴的太空探險家唯一能接受的太空衣腰帶。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_BELT_NEUTRONIUM.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_BELT_NEUTRONIUM.NAME"
msgid "Regal Neutronium Atmo Belt"
msgstr "帝王零號太空衣腰帶"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_BELT_PACULACANTH.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_BELT_PACULACANTH.DESC"
msgid "An atmo belt inspired by an aquatic behemoth."
msgstr "一款設計靈感源自水生巨獸的太空腰帶。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_BELT_PACULACANTH.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_BELT_PACULACANTH.NAME"
msgid "Jawbo Atmo Belt"
msgstr "顎魚太空腰帶"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_BELT_RAPTOR.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_BELT_RAPTOR.DESC"
msgid "An atmo belt inspired by the mighty apex predator."
msgstr "一款設計靈感源自強大頂級掠食者的太空腰帶。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_BELT_RAPTOR.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_BELT_RAPTOR.NAME"
msgid "Rhex Atmo Belt"
msgstr "霸王鸚太空腰帶"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_BELT_STEGO.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_BELT_STEGO.DESC"
msgid "An atmo belt inspired by the blissfully blank herbivore."
msgstr "一款設計靈感源自心滿意足且呆萌的草食生物的太空腰帶。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_BELT_STEGO.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_BELT_STEGO.NAME"
msgid "Lumb Atmo Belt"
msgstr "劍龍太空腰帶"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_BELT_TURTLE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_BELT_TURTLE.DESC"
msgid "Goes swimmingly with Atmo Suits of any kind."
msgstr "與任何一款太空衣搭配都如魚得水。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_BELT_TURTLE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_BELT_TURTLE.NAME"
msgid "Orehull Atmo Belt"
msgstr "礦甲龜太空腰帶"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_80S.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_80S.DESC"
msgid "A funky fresh pair of hand coverings."
msgstr "一雙時髦清新的護手套。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_80S.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_80S.NAME"
msgid "Radical Atmo Gloves"
msgstr "激進太空手套"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_BIOCIRCUIT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_BIOCIRCUIT.DESC"
msgid "Eye-catching accents ensure that the wearer knows where their hands are at all times."
msgstr "引人注目的裝飾確保佩戴者始終知道自己的手在哪裡。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_BIOCIRCUIT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_BIOCIRCUIT.NAME"
msgid "Bionic Atmo Gloves"
msgstr "仿生太空手套"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_CHAMELEO.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_CHAMELEO.DESC"
msgid "The added fingertip seams are a sensory nightmare for some."
msgstr "額外增加的指尖縫線對某些人來說簡直是感官上的夢魘。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_CHAMELEO.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_CHAMELEO.NAME"
msgid "Dartle Atmo Gloves"
msgstr "逸蜥太空手套"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_DIVING_KHAKI_TAN.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_DIVING_KHAKI_TAN.DESC"
msgid "The wrist rivets have a tendency to get caught on things."
msgstr "手腕上的鉚釘很容易勾到東西。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_DIVING_KHAKI_TAN.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_DIVING_KHAKI_TAN.NAME"
msgid "Antique Atmo Gloves"
msgstr "古典太空手套"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_ELECTRO.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_ELECTRO.DESC"
msgid "Electric blue gloves for hostile environments."
msgstr "適合險惡環境的電光藍手套"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_ELECTRO.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_ELECTRO.NAME"
msgid "Electro Atmo Gloves"
msgstr "電流太空手套"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_NEUTRONIUM.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_NEUTRONIUM.DESC"
msgid "Thick engineered \"leather\" hand protectors and polished Neutronium cuffs keep little Duplicant fingers safe, no matter what they're tempted to touch."
msgstr "厚實的人造「皮革」手部護具，配上拋光的零號元素護腕，能保護複製人小小的手指，無論他們多想碰觸什麼。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_NEUTRONIUM.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_NEUTRONIUM.NAME"
msgid "Regal Neutronium Atmo Gloves"
msgstr "帝王零號太空手套"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_PACULACANTH.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_PACULACANTH.DESC"
msgid "Now with webbed fingers!"
msgstr "現已推出蹼狀指頭款！"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_PACULACANTH.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_PACULACANTH.NAME"
msgid "Jawbo Atmo Gloves"
msgstr "顎魚太空手套"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_PLUM.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_PLUM.DESC"
msgid "Purpley-reddish gloves for hostile environments."
msgstr "適用於惡劣環境的紫紅色手套。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_PLUM.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_PLUM.NAME"
msgid "Plum Atmo Gloves"
msgstr "梅子太空手套"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_RAPTOR.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_RAPTOR.DESC"
msgid "Wiggling the fingers makes the feathers rustle."
msgstr "用手指擺動會讓羽毛沙沙作響。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_RAPTOR.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_RAPTOR.NAME"
msgid "Rhex Atmo Gloves"
msgstr "霸王鸚太空手套"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_STEGO.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_STEGO.DESC"
msgid "These gloves are the epitome of \"heavy-handed\"."
msgstr "這些手套是「笨手笨腳」的最佳寫照。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_STEGO.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_STEGO.NAME"
msgid "Lumb Atmo Gloves"
msgstr "劍龍太空手套"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_TAP_01.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_TAP_01.DESC"
msgid "Thick rubber cuffs keep hostile atmospheres out, and sweaty fingers in."
msgstr "厚實的橡膠袖口能將險惡的敵對環境擋在外面，並把滿是手汗的手指關在裡麵。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_TAP_01.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_TAP_01.NAME"
msgid "Rubberized Atmo Gloves"
msgstr "橡膠太空手套"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_TURTLE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_TURTLE.DESC"
msgid "Perfect for giving carapace scritches to aquatic critters."
msgstr "非常適合用來幫水生小動物抓抓牠們的甲殼。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_TURTLE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_GLOVES_TURTLE.NAME"
msgid "Orehull Atmo Gloves"
msgstr "礦甲龜太空手套"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_80S.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_80S.DESC"
msgid "A choice lid keeps things copacetic out here in the cosmos."
msgstr "一個精選的蓋子可以讓宇宙中的事物保持安靜。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_80S.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_80S.NAME"
msgid "Radical Atmo Helmet"
msgstr "激進太空頭盔"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_BIOCIRCUIT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_BIOCIRCUIT.DESC"
msgid "Featuring 360-degree panoramic views and cool non-functional neck buttons."
msgstr "擁有 360 度全景視野和酷炫的非功能性頸部按鈕。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_BIOCIRCUIT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_BIOCIRCUIT.NAME"
msgid "Bionic Atmo Helmet"
msgstr "仿生太空頭盔"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_CHAMELEO.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_CHAMELEO.DESC"
msgid "Pranksters often spear small items on one of the horns and see how long it takes the wearer to notice."
msgstr "惡作劇者常將小物品插在其中一隻角上，看看佩戴者多久才會發現。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_CHAMELEO.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_CHAMELEO.NAME"
msgid "Dartle Atmo Helmet"
msgstr "逸蜥太空頭盔"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_DIVING_KHAKI_TAN.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_DIVING_KHAKI_TAN.DESC"
msgid "There might still be a mothball or two inside."
msgstr "裡麵可能還殘留著一兩顆樟腦丸。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_DIVING_KHAKI_TAN.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_DIVING_KHAKI_TAN.NAME"
msgid "Antique Atmo Helmet"
msgstr "古典太空頭盔"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_GAUDYSWEATER_PURPLE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_GAUDYSWEATER_PURPLE.DESC"
msgid "Makes facial features appear farther away."
msgstr "使五官看起來更遠。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_GAUDYSWEATER_PURPLE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_GAUDYSWEATER_PURPLE.NAME"
msgid "Deepset Atmo Helmet"
msgstr "深眼太空頭盔"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_NEUTRONIUM.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_NEUTRONIUM.DESC"
msgid "A truly magnificent noggin protector that makes every errand feel like an epic expedition."
msgstr "一個真正壯麗的頭部防護罩，讓每一次跑腿任務都感覺像是一場史詩般的遠征。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_NEUTRONIUM.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_NEUTRONIUM.NAME"
msgid "Regal Neutronium Atmo Helmet"
msgstr "帝王零號太空頭盔"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_PACULACANTH.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_PACULACANTH.DESC"
msgid "The official helmet of the hangry space explorer."
msgstr "飢餓太空探險家的官方指定頭盔。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_PACULACANTH.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_PACULACANTH.NAME"
msgid "Jawbo Atmo Helmet"
msgstr "顎魚太空頭盔"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_RAPTOR.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_RAPTOR.DESC"
msgid "Warning: do not headbutt colleagues while wearing this helmet."
msgstr "警告：佩戴此頭盔時，請勿用頭部撞擊同事。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_RAPTOR.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_RAPTOR.NAME"
msgid "Rhex Atmo Helmet"
msgstr "霸王鸚太空頭盔"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_STEGO.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_STEGO.DESC"
msgid "Listen, it's not about looking smart. Or being smart. Or...what was the question?"
msgstr "聽著，這跟看起來聰明無關。也跟聰不聰明無關。或者說…剛剛問題是什麼來著？"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_STEGO.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_STEGO.NAME"
msgid "Lumb Atmo Helmet"
msgstr "劍龍太空頭盔"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_TAP_01.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_TAP_01.DESC"
msgid "Brightly colored headgear for Duplicants who err on the side of hope."
msgstr "色彩鮮豔的頭部裝備，適合 those 寧可選擇抱持希望的複製人。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_TAP_01.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_TAP_01.NAME"
msgid "Optimist Atmo Helmet"
msgstr "樂觀者太空頭盔"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_TAP_ELECTRO_RUBBLE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_TAP_ELECTRO_RUBBLE.DESC"
msgid "In the right liquid environment, it makes excellent camouflage."
msgstr "在合適的液體環境中，它能提供極佳的偽裝。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_TAP_ELECTRO_RUBBLE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_TAP_ELECTRO_RUBBLE.NAME"
msgid "Electro Atmo Helmet"
msgstr "電流太空頭盔"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_TURTLE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_TURTLE.DESC"
msgid "For aquatic ranchers who really want to get inside the critter's head."
msgstr "專為那些真的很想看透小動物心思——或者該說，很想把頭伸進小動物腦袋裡的的水生畜牧員所設計。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_TURTLE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_HELMET_TURTLE.NAME"
msgid "Orehull Atmo Helmet"
msgstr "礦甲龜太空頭盔"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_80S.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_80S.DESC"
msgid "Can you do the Running Man in space? With these, maybe."
msgstr "你能在太空裡 Running Man 嗎？有了這些，也許吧。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_80S.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_80S.NAME"
msgid "Radical Atmo Boots"
msgstr "激進太空靴"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_BASIC_ELECTRO.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_BASIC_ELECTRO.DESC"
msgid "There's a little tag inside each one, to remind Duplicants which foot it's for."
msgstr "每隻鞋子裡面都有一個小標籤，用來提醒複製人這是哪隻腳穿的。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_BASIC_ELECTRO.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_BASIC_ELECTRO.NAME"
msgid "Electro Atmo Boots"
msgstr "電流太空靴"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_BASIC_GREEN.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_BASIC_GREEN.DESC"
msgid "They leave a trail of moist bootprints for others to follow."
msgstr "它們會留下潮濕的靴子印，供他人循跡而行"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_BASIC_GREEN.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_BASIC_GREEN.NAME"
msgid "Swampy Atmo Boots"
msgstr "泥濘太空靴"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_BIOCIRCUIT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_BIOCIRCUIT.DESC"
msgid "Standard-issue footwear for...augmented...employees."
msgstr "適合...增強...員工的標準鞋。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_BIOCIRCUIT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_BIOCIRCUIT.NAME"
msgid "Bionic Atmo Boots"
msgstr "仿生太空靴"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_CHAMELEO.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_CHAMELEO.DESC"
msgid "For meandering safely through hostile environments."
msgstr "用於在惡劣環境中安全地蜿蜒行進。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_CHAMELEO.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_CHAMELEO.NAME"
msgid "Dartle Atmo Boots"
msgstr "逸蜥太空靴"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_DIVING_TAN.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_DIVING_TAN.DESC"
msgid "Cutting-edge protective footwear with rusting-edge styling."
msgstr "頂尖技術的防護鞋類，配上流露著「生鏽邊緣」的復古造型。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_DIVING_TAN.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_DIVING_TAN.NAME"
msgid "Antique Atmo Boots"
msgstr "古典太空靴"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_NEUTRONIUM.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_NEUTRONIUM.DESC"
msgid "Protective footwear that shines with the promise of safety and new adventures."
msgstr "閃耀著安全與全新冒險希望的防護性鞋具。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_NEUTRONIUM.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_NEUTRONIUM.NAME"
msgid "Regal Atmo Boots"
msgstr "帝王零號太空靴"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_PACULACANTH.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_PACULACANTH.DESC"
msgid "They're always a bit damp. But they work!"
msgstr "它們總是有點潮溼。但它們管用！"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_PACULACANTH.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_PACULACANTH.NAME"
msgid "Jawbo Atmo Boots"
msgstr "顎魚太空靴"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_RAPTOR.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_RAPTOR.DESC"
msgid "The official protective footwear of the apex predator."
msgstr "頂級掠食者的官方指定防護鞋具。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_RAPTOR.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_RAPTOR.NAME"
msgid "Rhex Atmo Boots"
msgstr "霸王鸚太空靴"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_STEGO.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_STEGO.DESC"
msgid "Weighted boots built to clomp through extreme environments."
msgstr "專為在極端環境中笨重跋涉而設計的加重靴。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_STEGO.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_STEGO.NAME"
msgid "Lumb Atmo Boots"
msgstr "劍龍太空靴"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_TAP_01.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_TAP_01.DESC"
msgid "Abstract pops of color turn hostile atmospheres into haute-style atmospheres."
msgstr "抽象的跳脫色彩點綴，將險惡的敵對環境化為頂級的高級時裝秀。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_TAP_01.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_TAP_01.NAME"
msgid "Hotspot Atmo Boots"
msgstr "熱點太空靴"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_TURTLE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_TURTLE.DESC"
msgid "Like a coupla little foot shells."
msgstr "就像是兩片小小的腳部外殼。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_TURTLE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMO_SHOES_TURTLE.NAME"
msgid "Orehull Atmo Boots"
msgstr "礦甲龜太空靴"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_80S.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_80S.DESC"
msgid "It's truly excellent, dude."
msgstr "這真的很棒，夥計。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_80S.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_80S.NAME"
msgid "Radical Atmo Suit"
msgstr "激進太空衣"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_BASIC_ORANGE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_BASIC_ORANGE.DESC"
msgid "Dyed with gorgeously saturated toxic pigments!"
msgstr "用華麗飽和的有毒顏料染色！"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_BASIC_ORANGE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_BASIC_ORANGE.NAME"
msgid "Crisp Cadmium Atmo Suit"
msgstr "鮮鎘太空外觀"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_BASIC_PURPLE_WILDBERRY.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_BASIC_PURPLE_WILDBERRY.DESC"
msgid "The shoulders are as purple as a paleontologist's prose."
msgstr "肩膀像古生物學家的散文一樣紫色。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_BASIC_PURPLE_WILDBERRY.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_BASIC_PURPLE_WILDBERRY.NAME"
msgid "Crisp Violet Atmo Suit"
msgstr "清爽紫羅蘭太空衣"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_BASIC_RUBBLE_ELECTRO.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_BASIC_RUBBLE_ELECTRO.DESC"
msgid "A sleek gray suit with a pop of electro blue."
msgstr "一款時尚的灰色太空服，搭配一抹亮眼的電流藍點綴。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_BASIC_RUBBLE_ELECTRO.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_BASIC_RUBBLE_ELECTRO.NAME"
msgid "Electro Atmo Suit"
msgstr "電流太空衣"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_CHAMELEO.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_CHAMELEO.DESC"
msgid "Slow and steady wins the (space) race, right?"
msgstr "穩紮穩打贏得（太空）競賽，對吧？"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_CHAMELEO.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_CHAMELEO.NAME"
msgid "Dartle Atmo Suit"
msgstr "逸蜥太空衣"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_DIVING_KHAKI_TAN.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_DIVING_KHAKI_TAN.DESC"
msgid "Makes the wearer look like a legitimate atmo suit collector."
msgstr "讓穿戴者看起來就像個貨真價實的太空衣收藏家。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_DIVING_KHAKI_TAN.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_DIVING_KHAKI_TAN.NAME"
msgid "Antique Atmo Suit"
msgstr "古典太空衣"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_NEUTRONIUM.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_NEUTRONIUM.DESC"
msgid "Understated elegance topped with a solid-gold collar that protects against sharp space objects and surprise tickle attacks."
msgstr "低調優雅，頂部配有一圈純金領口，可以防禦鋒利的太空物體和突如其來的搔癢攻擊。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_NEUTRONIUM.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_NEUTRONIUM.NAME"
msgid "Regal Neutronium Atmo Suit"
msgstr "帝王零號太空衣"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_PACULACANTH.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_PACULACANTH.DESC"
msgid "It makes the wearer feel like a <i>very</i> big fish in a small pond."
msgstr "這讓穿戴者感覺自己是小池塘裡一條<b>特</b>大號的魚。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_PACULACANTH.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_PACULACANTH.NAME"
msgid "Jawbo Atmo Suit"
msgstr "顎魚太空衣"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_RAPTOR.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_RAPTOR.DESC"
msgid "Each feather was painstakingly secured to the suit fabric by hand."
msgstr "每根羽毛都經過手工，一絲不苟地固定在太空衣面料上。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_RAPTOR.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_RAPTOR.NAME"
msgid "Rhex Atmo Suit"
msgstr "霸王鸚太空衣"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_STEGO.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_STEGO.DESC"
msgid "The tail attachment has a tendency to knock things over."
msgstr "尾部附件有把東西撞倒的傾向。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_STEGO.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_STEGO.NAME"
msgid "Lumb Atmo Suit"
msgstr "劍龍太空衣"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_TAP_01.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_TAP_01.DESC"
msgid "This suit features colorful fabric reinforcement patches in high-wear areas, including the armpits. Especially the armpits."
msgstr "這款太空衣在易磨損部位採用了彩色的布料補強貼片，包括腋下。特別是腋下。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_TAP_01.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_TAP_01.NAME"
msgid "Hotspot Atmo Suit"
msgstr "熱點太空衣"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_TURTLE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_TURTLE.DESC"
msgid "Looks right at home in a kelp forest."
msgstr "身處海帶森林之中，看起來就像在自己家一樣自在。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_TURTLE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ATMOSUIT_TURTLE.NAME"
msgid "Orehull Atmo Suit"
msgstr "礦甲龜太空衣"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BALLOON_BABYRHEX_EGG.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BALLOON_BABYRHEX_EGG.DESC"
msgid "These balloons are so cute that they often get popped by overenthusiastic critter fans."
msgstr "這些氣球實在是太可愛了，結果常常被過度熱情的小動物粉絲弄破。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BALLOON_BABYRHEX_EGG.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BALLOON_BABYRHEX_EGG.NAME"
msgid "Poppable Lil' Predators"
msgstr "噗噗小掠食者"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BALLOON_BABYSTEGO_EGG.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BALLOON_BABYSTEGO_EGG.DESC"
msgid "A happy little trio of inflatable critters. Now with blep."
msgstr "一份快樂的三合一充氣小動物。現在還會吐舌頭喔。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BALLOON_BABYSTEGO_EGG.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BALLOON_BABYSTEGO_EGG.NAME"
msgid "Bug-Eyed Blep"
msgstr "凸眼吐舌怪"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BALLOON_BLOWFISH_EGG.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BALLOON_BLOWFISH_EGG.DESC"
msgid "These balloons are not a source of oxygen and will not auto-reinflate if emptied."
msgstr "這些氣球並非氧氣來源，且消氣後不會自動重新充氣。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BALLOON_BLOWFISH_EGG.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BALLOON_BLOWFISH_EGG.NAME"
msgid "Blown-Up Blowties"
msgstr "充氣胖嘟嘟"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BEACH_CHAIR_BEAKON.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BEACH_CHAIR_BEAKON.DESC"
msgid "Everything feels lighter and brighter after a little R&R."
msgstr "稍微休息放鬆一下，一切感覺都變得更輕鬆、更明亮了。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BEACH_CHAIR_BEAKON.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BEACH_CHAIR_BEAKON.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BEACHCHAIR\">Beakon Beach Chair</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BEACHCHAIR\">燈喙魚海灘躺椅</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BEACH_CHAIR_KRAKEN.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BEACH_CHAIR_KRAKEN.DESC"
msgid "Some people find the threat of imminent danger quite relaxing, actually."
msgstr "事實上，有些人反而覺得這種迫在眉睫的危險感滿放鬆的。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BEACH_CHAIR_KRAKEN.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BEACH_CHAIR_KRAKEN.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BEACHCHAIR\">Glo Squid Beach Chair</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BEACHCHAIR\">彩斑魷海灘椅</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BEACH_CHAIR_POKESHELL.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BEACH_CHAIR_POKESHELL.DESC"
msgid "Feeling crabby? Come take a load off."
msgstr "覺得渾身帶刺、心情暴躁嗎？來這好好放鬆一下吧。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BEACH_CHAIR_POKESHELL.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BEACH_CHAIR_POKESHELL.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BEACHCHAIR\">Pokeshell Beach Chair</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BEACHCHAIR\">拋殼蟹海灘躺椅</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BED_COTTAGE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BED_COTTAGE.DESC"
msgid "Little scraps of textile waste make a cozy bedcover when they're stapled together by hand."
msgstr "即使是小小的紡織碎片，當手工縫在一起時，也能製成舒適的床罩。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BED_COTTAGE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BED_COTTAGE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BED\">Quilt Cot</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BED\">被子床</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BED_JORGE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BED_JORGE.DESC"
msgid "One person's junk is another person's bespoke bed."
msgstr "一個安全的睡眠場所。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BED_JORGE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BED_JORGE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BED\">DIY Cot</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BED\">DIY 床</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BED_ROCK.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BED_ROCK.DESC"
msgid "Who ordered the extra-extra-extra-firm mattress?"
msgstr "誰訂了特特特硬的床墊？"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BED_ROCK.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BED_ROCK.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"BED\">Stone Cot</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BED\">石頭床</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOILER_NEUTRONIUM.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOILER_NEUTRONIUM.DESC"
msgid "An ostentatious immersion heater that gives cool liquids the royal treatment."
msgstr "一個華麗的浸入式加熱器，給予低溫液體皇家級的加熱待遇。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOILER_NEUTRONIUM.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOILER_NEUTRONIUM.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"LIQUIDHEATER\">Regal Neutronium Liquid Tepidizer</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"LIQUIDHEATER\">帝王零號液體加溫器</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_CHARCOAL_OBELUS.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_CHARCOAL_OBELUS.DESC"
msgid "The dark color makes it less obvious that these are supposed to be worn <i>underneath</i> clothes."
msgstr "深色的設計，讓它看起來比較不像是應該穿在<b>衣服底下</b>的內衣。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_CHARCOAL_OBELUS.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_CHARCOAL_OBELUS.NAME"
msgid "Charcoal Skivvies"
msgstr "木炭內衣"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_ELECTRO_SWEETLE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_ELECTRO_SWEETLE.DESC"
msgid "Electric-blue longjohns with someone's name and password sewn into the tag."
msgstr "電光藍色的長內衣，標籤上還縫著某個人的姓名和密碼。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_ELECTRO_SWEETLE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_ELECTRO_SWEETLE.NAME"
msgid "Electro Skivvies"
msgstr "電光內衣"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_FLINT_ASH.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_FLINT_ASH.DESC"
msgid "Stony gray longjohns with stretchy contrast stitching."
msgstr "石灰色的長內衣，帶有彈性且顏色對比鮮明的縫線。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_FLINT_ASH.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_FLINT_ASH.NAME"
msgid "Flint Skivvies"
msgstr "燧石內衣"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_GRAPE_ALKALI.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_GRAPE_ALKALI.DESC"
msgid "Purple longjohns for the comfy intellectual."
msgstr "適合舒適知識份子的紫色長內衣。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_GRAPE_ALKALI.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_GRAPE_ALKALI.NAME"
msgid "Cerebra Skivvies"
msgstr "思維內衣"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_MUCK_EARWAX.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_MUCK_EARWAX.DESC"
msgid "Cozy brown longjohns infused with moisturizing muck molecules."
msgstr "舒適的棕色長內衣，注入了保濕爛泥分子。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_MUCK_EARWAX.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_MUCK_EARWAX.NAME"
msgid "Muck Skivvies"
msgstr "爛泥內衣"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_PEAGREEN_GLITCH.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_PEAGREEN_GLITCH.DESC"
msgid "Made with bioengineered pea-pod fabric that features sixteen-way stretch and a mild vegetable scent."
msgstr "採用生物工程豌豆莢布料製成，具備十六向伸展機能，並帶有溫和的蔬菜氣味。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_PEAGREEN_GLITCH.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_PEAGREEN_GLITCH.NAME"
msgid "Greenpeas Skivvies"
msgstr "青豆內衣"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_PETAL_NEONPINK.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_PETAL_NEONPINK.DESC"
msgid "Vibrant pink longjohns that fold into their own pocket for convenience."
msgstr "鮮豔粉紅色的長內衣，可折疊收納至自帶的口袋，方便攜帶。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_PETAL_NEONPINK.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_PETAL_NEONPINK.NAME"
msgid "Petal Skivvies"
msgstr "花瓣內衣"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_QUANTUM_RADGLO.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_QUANTUM_RADGLO.DESC"
msgid "In another universe, these are actually considered capri pants."
msgstr "在另一個宇宙中，這套衣服其實是被當作七分褲的。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_QUANTUM_RADGLO.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_QUANTUM_RADGLO.NAME"
msgid "Quantum Skivvies"
msgstr "量子內衣"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_RUSTY_GRUBBY.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_RUSTY_GRUBBY.DESC"
msgid "The vivid hue of these longjohns was achieved using only the finest tetanus-free dyes. Well, mostly."
msgstr "這件長內衣鮮豔的色澤，僅採用最優質、不含破傷風菌的染料製成。呃，大部分是這樣。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_RUSTY_GRUBBY.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_RUSTY_GRUBBY.NAME"
msgid "Rusty Skivvies"
msgstr "鏽蝕內衣"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_SATSUMA_RESIN.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_SATSUMA_RESIN.DESC"
msgid "Safety is paramount, especially for anyone who's doing construction work in their skivvies."
msgstr "安全至上，尤其是對於那些只穿著內衣在施工的複製人來說。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_SATSUMA_RESIN.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_SATSUMA_RESIN.NAME"
msgid "Hi-Vis Skivvies"
msgstr "高能見內衣"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_SYMBIO_OAKMOLT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_SYMBIO_OAKMOLT.DESC"
msgid "Longjohns that form a symbiotic relationship with their wearer after just two wears."
msgstr "只需穿著兩次，這件長內衣就會與穿著者形成共生關係。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_SYMBIO_OAKMOLT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_SYMBIO_OAKMOLT.NAME"
msgid "Symbio Skivvies"
msgstr "共生內衣"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_WORTSEED_CHROMO.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_WORTSEED_CHROMO.DESC"
msgid "Wort're you wearing? Longjohns as workwear!?"
msgstr "你穿冰樹在身上？長內衣當工作服穿！？"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_WORTSEED_CHROMO.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_GOTCH_WORTSEED_CHROMO.NAME"
msgid "Wortseed Skivvies"
msgstr "冰種內衣"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_REGAL_NEUTRONIUM.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_REGAL_NEUTRONIUM.DESC"
msgid "These tailored uniform pants come in a rich, deep neutronium-inspired hue that pairs well with gold."
msgstr "這些量身訂製的制服褲帶有一種濃郁深沉的零號元素色調，與黃金色搭配得很好。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_REGAL_NEUTRONIUM.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_BOTTOM_REGAL_NEUTRONIUM.NAME"
msgid "Regal Neutronium Uniform Pants"
msgstr "帝王零號制服褲"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CO2SCRUBBER_NEUTRONIUM.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CO2SCRUBBER_NEUTRONIUM.DESC"
msgid "Swiftly and discreetly pulls carbon dioxide out of the air, like a butler pulling an uninvited guest out of a gala."
msgstr "迅速且謹慎地將二氧化碳從空氣中抽離，就像管家將不速之客拉出盛大晚宴一樣。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CO2SCRUBBER_NEUTRONIUM.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CO2SCRUBBER_NEUTRONIUM.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CO2SCRUBBER\">Regal Neutronium Carbon Skimmer</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CO2SCRUBBER\">帝王零號除碳機</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_COOKINGSTATION_COTTAGE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_COOKINGSTATION_COTTAGE.DESC"
msgid "The smoky flavor is intentional."
msgstr "煙燻味是故意的。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_COOKINGSTATION_COTTAGE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_COOKINGSTATION_COTTAGE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"COOKINGSTATION\">Backcountry Grill</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"COOKINGSTATION\">野外燒烤架</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_COOKINGSTATION_GOURMET_COTTAGE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_COOKINGSTATION_GOURMET_COTTAGE.DESC"
msgid "It makes quality meal recipes feel more...approachable."
msgstr "它使得高品質食物更加…平易近人。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_COOKINGSTATION_GOURMET_COTTAGE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_COOKINGSTATION_GOURMET_COTTAGE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"GOURMETCOOKINGSTATION\">Rustic Gas Range</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"GOURMETCOOKINGSTATION\">淳樸烤箱</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CORNER_TILE_NEUTRONIUM.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CORNER_TILE_NEUTRONIUM.DESC"
msgid "Someone once suggested that ornate corner trim tiles be called \"cornate\" tiles. Thankfully, they were overruled."
msgstr "有人曾建議將華麗的邊角修飾磚稱為「角飾」磚。幸好，這個提議被否決了。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CORNER_TILE_NEUTRONIUM.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CORNER_TILE_NEUTRONIUM.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CORNERMOULDING\">Regal Neutronium Corner Trim</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CORNERMOULDING\">帝王零號邊角飾件</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CORNER_TILE_RETRO_NAUTICAL.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CORNER_TILE_RETRO_NAUTICAL.DESC"
msgid "A rising tide directs all eyes to the ceiling, where they'll land on this magnificent maritime corner trim."
msgstr "上漲的潮水讓所有目光都投向天花板，進而注意到這款華麗的航海牆角飾條。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CORNER_TILE_RETRO_NAUTICAL.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CORNER_TILE_RETRO_NAUTICAL.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CORNERMOULDING\">Nautical Corner Trim</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CORNERMOULDING\">航海牆角飾條</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CRAFTINGSTATION_CYBERPUNK.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CRAFTINGSTATION_CYBERPUNK.DESC"
msgid "Building a better tomorrow, today."
msgstr "今天，建設更美好的明天。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CRAFTINGSTATION_CYBERPUNK.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CRAFTINGSTATION_CYBERPUNK.NAME"
msgid "Retro LED Crafting Table"
msgstr "復古 LED 工藝台"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CROWN_MOULDING_NEUTRONIUM.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CROWN_MOULDING_NEUTRONIUM.DESC"
msgid "Installing elegant crown moulding is a clever way to distract visitors from unswept tunnel floors."
msgstr "安裝優雅的冠狀飾條是一種高明的方法，可以分散訪客對未清掃通道地面的注意力。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CROWN_MOULDING_NEUTRONIUM.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CROWN_MOULDING_NEUTRONIUM.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CROWNMOULDING\">Regal Neutronium Ceiling Trim</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CROWNMOULDING\">帝王零號天花板飾件</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CROWN_MOULDING_RETRO_NAUTICAL.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CROWN_MOULDING_RETRO_NAUTICAL.DESC"
msgid "Top-notch deckhead decor fit for a captain's quarters."
msgstr "配得上船長室的頂級艙頂裝飾。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CROWN_MOULDING_RETRO_NAUTICAL.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_CROWN_MOULDING_RETRO_NAUTICAL.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"CROWNMOULDING\">Nautical Ceiling Trim</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"CROWNMOULDING\">航海造型飾條</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_DRESS_FUTURESPACE_BLUE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_DRESS_FUTURESPACE_BLUE.DESC"
msgid "Handcrafted from decommissioned rockets."
msgstr "由退役火箭手工製作而成。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_DRESS_FUTURESPACE_BLUE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_DRESS_FUTURESPACE_BLUE.NAME"
msgid "Sculpted Steel Dress"
msgstr "雕刻鋼連身裙"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_DRESS_SAILOR_WHITE_NAUTICAL.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_DRESS_SAILOR_WHITE_NAUTICAL.DESC"
msgid "Expert pleating ensures this skirt maintains its shape no matter what the universe throws at it."
msgstr "專業的打褶工藝，確保這條裙子無論面對宇宙的任何考驗都能維持版型。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_DRESS_SAILOR_WHITE_NAUTICAL.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_DRESS_SAILOR_WHITE_NAUTICAL.NAME"
msgid "Sailor Dress"
msgstr "水手連身裙"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ELECTROLYZER_NEUTRONIUM.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ELECTROLYZER_NEUTRONIUM.DESC"
msgid "The oxygenated air produced by this building smells...superior, somehow."
msgstr "這座建築生產的含氧空氣聞起來...不知怎地，就是更優越。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ELECTROLYZER_NEUTRONIUM.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ELECTROLYZER_NEUTRONIUM.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"ELECTROLYZER\">Regal Neutronium Electrolyzer</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"ELECTROLYZER\">帝王零號電解器</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ELEGANTBED_CLAM.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ELEGANTBED_CLAM.DESC"
msgid "Whoever sleeps here will wake up happy as a clampum."
msgstr "不管誰睡在這裡，醒來時都會像隻快樂的巨鉗貝。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ELEGANTBED_CLAM.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ELEGANTBED_CLAM.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"LUXURYBED\">Pearly Pillowtop Bed</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"LUXURYBED\">珍珠軟墊床</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ELEGANTBED_HATCH.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ELEGANTBED_HATCH.DESC"
msgid "It is extremely unlikely to close while someone is inside."
msgstr "有人在裡面的時候關閉的可能性極低。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ELEGANTBED_HATCH.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ELEGANTBED_HATCH.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"LUXURYBED\">Hatch Bed</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"LUXURYBED\">哈奇床</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ELEGANTBED_PIPSQUEAK.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ELEGANTBED_PIPSQUEAK.DESC"
msgid "Perfect for side sleepers and little spoons."
msgstr "非常適合側睡和蜷睡的人。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ELEGANTBED_PIPSQUEAK.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ELEGANTBED_PIPSQUEAK.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"LUXURYBED\">Pipsqueak Bed</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"LUXURYBED\">樹鼠寶寶床</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ELEGANTBED_SUBMARINE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ELEGANTBED_SUBMARINE.DESC"
msgid "Too bad there's no widely known term for underwater vehicles in this particular color."
msgstr "真可惜，這種特定顏色的水下交通工具，好像還沒有什麼廣為人知的稱呼。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ELEGANTBED_SUBMARINE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_ELEGANTBED_SUBMARINE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"LUXURYBED\">Aquatic Rocket Bed</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"LUXURYBED\">水中火箭床</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FLOORLAMP_COTTAGE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FLOORLAMP_COTTAGE.DESC"
msgid "It makes Duplicants feel like they're about to be read a bedtime story."
msgstr "這能讓複製人感覺就要聽睡前故事了。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FLOORLAMP_COTTAGE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FLOORLAMP_COTTAGE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"FLOORLAMP\">Storytime Lamp</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"FLOORLAMP\">古雅電燈</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FOSSILSCULPTURE_IDLE_JAWBO.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FOSSILSCULPTURE_IDLE_JAWBO.DESC"
msgid "It is safe to say that no critter ever mocked the Jawbo for having four eyes."
msgstr "可以肯定地說，沒有小動物嘲笑過顎魚有四隻眼睛。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FOSSILSCULPTURE_IDLE_JAWBO.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FOSSILSCULPTURE_IDLE_JAWBO.NAME"
msgid "The Dangler"
msgstr "懸掛之魚"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FOSSILSCULPTURE_IDLE_RHEX.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FOSSILSCULPTURE_IDLE_RHEX.DESC"
msgid "This display model's open jaw makes it an unsuitable shape for after-hours bowling."
msgstr "這個展示模型的開放式下巴使其不適合用來在下班後打保齡球。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FOSSILSCULPTURE_IDLE_RHEX.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FOSSILSCULPTURE_IDLE_RHEX.NAME"
msgid "Roar O'Saurus"
msgstr "霸王咆哮"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FOSSILSCULPTURE_IDLE_SHELLONOIDIS.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FOSSILSCULPTURE_IDLE_SHELLONOIDIS.DESC"
msgid "It's unclear whether this sculpture is based on a long-extinct creature, or a very vivid dream."
msgstr "目前還不清楚這座雕塑是基於早已滅絕的生物，還是源自一個非常生動的夢境。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FOSSILSCULPTURE_IDLE_SHELLONOIDIS.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FOSSILSCULPTURE_IDLE_SHELLONOIDIS.NAME"
msgid "Uncanny Carapace"
msgstr "詭奇甲殼"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FOSSILSCULPTURE_IDLE_STEGO.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FOSSILSCULPTURE_IDLE_STEGO.DESC"
msgid "Some Duplicants like to crawl into this Lumb sculpture and run a spoon over the ribs like a musical instrument."
msgstr "一些複製人喜歡爬上這個豐足劍龍的雕塑，然後用勺子像樂器一樣掛肋骨。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FOSSILSCULPTURE_IDLE_STEGO.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FOSSILSCULPTURE_IDLE_STEGO.NAME"
msgid "Pointy Plates"
msgstr "尖板"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FRIDGE_NEUTRONIUM.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FRIDGE_NEUTRONIUM.DESC"
msgid "It's so polished that there's a chance Duplicants might get lost in their own reflection."
msgstr "它被拋光得如此閃亮，以至於複製人可能會迷失在自己的倒影。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FRIDGE_NEUTRONIUM.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FRIDGE_NEUTRONIUM.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"REFRIGERATOR\">Regal Neutronium Refrigerator</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"REFRIGERATOR\">帝王零號冰箱</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FRIDGE_STRIPES_NAUTICAL.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FRIDGE_STRIPES_NAUTICAL.DESC"
msgid "Because Duplicants will keel over if they don't get enough calories."
msgstr "因為複製人如果沒有攝取足夠的熱量，可是會當場翻船的。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FRIDGE_STRIPES_NAUTICAL.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FRIDGE_STRIPES_NAUTICAL.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"REFRIGERATOR\">Nautical Stripe Refrigerator</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"REFRIGERATOR\">航海條紋冰箱</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FRIDGE_WATERBUBBLES.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FRIDGE_WATERBUBBLES.DESC"
msgid "Holds enough food to tide over a small colony."
msgstr "存放的食物足夠讓一個小型殖民地度過難關。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FRIDGE_WATERBUBBLES.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_FRIDGE_WATERBUBBLES.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"REFRIGERATOR\">Ripple Refrigerator</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"REFRIGERATOR\">漣漪冰箱</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GASSTORAGE_DARTLE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GASSTORAGE_DARTLE.DESC"
msgid "The splotchy parts have an unsettlingly leather-like texture."
msgstr "帶斑點的部分有著令人不安的皮革質感。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GASSTORAGE_DARTLE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GASSTORAGE_DARTLE.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"GASRESERVOIR\">Dartle Gas Reservoir</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"GASRESERVOIR\">逸蜥儲氣庫</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GASSTORAGE_LUMB.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GASSTORAGE_LUMB.DESC"
msgid "Does not stomp."
msgstr "不亂踩。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GASSTORAGE_LUMB.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GASSTORAGE_LUMB.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"GASRESERVOIR\">Lumb Gas Reservoir</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"GASRESERVOIR\">劍龍儲氣庫</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GASSTORAGE_STRIPES_NAUTICAL.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GASSTORAGE_STRIPES_NAUTICAL.DESC"
msgid "Classically striped storage is a mainstay of marine colony management."
msgstr "經典條紋設計的儲存槽是海洋殖民地管理的支柱。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GASSTORAGE_STRIPES_NAUTICAL.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GASSTORAGE_STRIPES_NAUTICAL.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"GASRESERVOIR\">Nautical Stripe Gas Reservoir</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"GASRESERVOIR\">航海條紋儲氣庫</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GASSTORAGE_WATERBUBBLES.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GASSTORAGE_WATERBUBBLES.DESC"
msgid "This style has been making waves in colonies across the universe since time began."
msgstr "自開天闢地以來，這種風格就在全宇宙的殖民地中引領風騷。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GASSTORAGE_WATERBUBBLES.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GASSTORAGE_WATERBUBBLES.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"GASRESERVOIR\">Ripple Gas Reservoir</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"GASRESERVOIR\">漣漪儲氣庫</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_A.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_A.DESC"
msgid "Clean lines, clean energy...as long as the operator doesn't sweat all over the wheel."
msgstr "簡潔線條，潔淨能源...只要操作員不會把汗水滴滿整個輪子就好。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_A.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_A.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MANUALGENERATOR\">Sleek Manual Generator</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MANUALGENERATOR\">流線型人力發電機</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_B.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_B.DESC"
msgid "It looks like someone dug this out of an old rocket hangar."
msgstr "這玩意看起來就像是有人從一座老舊的火箭機庫裡挖出來的。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_B.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_B.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MANUALGENERATOR\">Clunky Manual Generator</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MANUALGENERATOR\">笨重人力發電機</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_CYBERPUNK.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_CYBERPUNK.DESC"
msgid "Take a spin on the party wheel! It generates raver vibes as well as power."
msgstr "來轉動派對輪吧！它在發電的同時，還能營造出銳舞派對的氛圍。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_CYBERPUNK.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_CYBERPUNK.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MANUALGENERATOR\">Retro LED Manual Generator</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MANUALGENERATOR\">復古 LED 人力發電機</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_NAUTICAL.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_NAUTICAL.DESC"
msgid "Time spent operating this building does nothing to help Duplicants get their sea legs."
msgstr "在這座建築上踩得再久，也沒辦法幫複製人練出不暈船的水手腿。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_NAUTICAL.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_NAUTICAL.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MANUALGENERATOR\">Nautical Manual Generator</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MANUALGENERATOR\">航海人力發電機</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_NEUTRONIUM.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_NEUTRONIUM.DESC"
msgid "Some folks climb up the corporate ladder, others race on the aristocratic wheel."
msgstr "有人攀爬企業的階梯，有人則在貴族的輪子上奔跑。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_NEUTRONIUM.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_NEUTRONIUM.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MANUALGENERATOR\">Regal Neutronium Manual Generator</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MANUALGENERATOR\">帝王零號人力發電機</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_ROCK.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_ROCK.DESC"
msgid "It gets off to a rocky start, but it works so well that there's no point reinventing it."
msgstr "它起步艱難，但運作得非常好，根本沒必要重新設計。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_ROCK.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_ROCK.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MANUALGENERATOR\">Rustic Manual Generator</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MANUALGENERATOR\">淳樸人力發電機</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_WATERBUBBLES.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_WATERBUBBLES.DESC"
msgid "Out here, \"all hands on deck\" also means \"all feet on generator pedals.\""
msgstr "在這裡，「全員各就各位」 也代表「雙腳踩上發電機踏板」。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_WATERBUBBLES.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORMANUAL_WATERBUBBLES.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"MANUALGENERATOR\">Ripple Manual Generator</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"MANUALGENERATOR\">漣漪人力發電機</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORPHOS_NEUTRONIUM.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORPHOS_NEUTRONIUM.DESC"
msgid "This building's high-gloss finish never loses its shine, no matter how many layers of coal dust it's coated in."
msgstr "這座建築的高光澤飾面永不失色，無論它被多少層煤塵覆蓋。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORPHOS_NEUTRONIUM.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GENERATORPHOS_NEUTRONIUM.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"GENERATOR\">Regal Neutronium Coal Generator</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"GENERATOR\">帝王零號燃煤發電機</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GLASSCEILINGLIGHT_JELLY_BLUE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GLASSCEILINGLIGHT_JELLY_BLUE.DESC"
msgid "Soft blue overhead light uplifts the Duplicant soul."
msgstr "柔和的藍色頂光，能振奮複製人的心靈。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GLASSCEILINGLIGHT_JELLY_BLUE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_GLASSCEILINGLIGHT_JELLY_BLUE.NAME"
