msgstr "一件黑色飛行衣，搭配一件柔和長春花藍色的胸骨護甲。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_JETSUIT_BLACK_HATCHSTONE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_JETSUIT_BLACK_HATCHSTONE.NAME"
