msgstr "一件黑色飛行衣，搭配一件有活力綠色的胸骨護甲。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_JETSUIT_BLACK_KELLY.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_JETSUIT_BLACK_KELLY.NAME"
