msgstr "一件白色飛行衣，搭配一件警示橘色的胸骨護甲。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_JETSUIT_WHITE_ATOMIC.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_JETSUIT_WHITE_ATOMIC.NAME"
