msgstr "其規模意味著這種小動物和它的朋友比大多數生物都要大。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_PAINTING_WIDE_ART_CERES_A.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_PAINTING_WIDE_ART_CERES_A.NAME"
