msgstr "這款單色下著僅帶著一絲極其微妙的人魚風奇幻趣味"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_PANTS_SWIM_BLACK.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_PANTS_SWIM_BLACK.NAME"
