msgstr "它很有趣，儘管它實際上不能<b>被</b>玩。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_PEDESTAL_ARCADE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_PEDESTAL_ARCADE.NAME"
