msgstr "具有溫暖、黃銅色工業美感的展示架。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_PEDESTAL_SCREW_BRASS.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_PEDESTAL_SCREW_BRASS.NAME"
