msgstr "具有酷炫鋼鐵工業美感的展示架。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_PEDESTAL_SCREW_CHROME.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_PEDESTAL_SCREW_CHROME.NAME"
