#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_STEAMTURBINE2_NEUTRONIUM.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_STEAMTURBINE2_NEUTRONIUM.DESC"
