msgstr "它散發出力量，無論是從字面上還是比喻上來說。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_STEAMTURBINE2_NEUTRONIUM.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_STEAMTURBINE2_NEUTRONIUM.NAME"
