msgstr "<link=\"STEAMTURBINE2\">帝王零號蒸汽渦輪機</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_STORAGELOCKER_NEUTRONIUM.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_STORAGELOCKER_NEUTRONIUM.DESC"
msgid "When the outside is this extravagant, who cares what's inside?"
msgstr "當外觀如此奢華時，誰還會在乎裡面裝了什麼？"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_STORAGELOCKER_NEUTRONIUM.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_STORAGELOCKER_NEUTRONIUM.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"STORAGELOCKER\">Regal Neutronium Storage Bin</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"STORAGELOCKER\">帝王零號儲存箱</link>"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_STORAGELOCKER_STRIPES_NAUTICAL.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_STORAGELOCKER_STRIPES_NAUTICAL.DESC"
msgid "Without proper storage, colonies would be chock-a-block with flotsam and jetsam."
msgstr "要是沒有妥善的儲物空間，殖民地早就會被各種漂流雜物與廢棄物堆得動彈不得。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_STORAGELOCKER_STRIPES_NAUTICAL.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_STORAGELOCKER_STRIPES_NAUTICAL.NAME"
