#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_STORAGELOCKER_WATERBUBBLES.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_STORAGELOCKER_WATERBUBBLES.DESC"
