msgstr "上次清洗這件打底衣是幾個周期前的事？根本看不出來。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_TOP_GOTCH_ASH_CHARCOAL.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_TOP_GOTCH_ASH_CHARCOAL.NAME"
