msgstr "一件帶有淡淡酸味的吸濕排汗打底衣，沒人確定那是柑橘味還是汗味。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_TOP_GOTCH_CANKER_SATSUMA.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_TOP_GOTCH_CANKER_SATSUMA.NAME"
