msgstr "一件暮光紫色的吸濕排汗打底衣，專為很久沒見過太陽的殖民者設計。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_TOP_GOTCH_DUSKY_GRAPE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_TOP_GOTCH_DUSKY_GRAPE.NAME"
