msgstr "算是件還能正常吸濕排汗的功能性打底衣吧，阿隨便啦。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_TOP_GOTCH_ENNUI_FLINT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_TOP_GOTCH_ENNUI_FLINT.NAME"
