msgstr "一件毫不起眼的米色打底衣，能讓穿戴者在派對上放屁時避免引人注意。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_TOP_GOTCH_FLATUS_MUCK.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_TOP_GOTCH_FLATUS_MUCK.NAME"
