msgstr "一件柔粉色打底衣，專為喜愛淡彩調的粒子物理學家準備。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_TOP_GOTCH_GLUON_PETAL.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_TOP_GOTCH_GLUON_PETAL.NAME"
