#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_TOP_GOTCH_MUSH_PEAGREEN.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_TOP_GOTCH_MUSH_PEAGREEN.NAME"
