#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_AQUA_KELP_SILT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_AQUA_KELP_SILT.DESC"
msgid "An aquatic wallpaper that shows where the plants meet the sand."
msgstr "一款水生風格的牆紙，展現了植物與沙地交接的樣貌。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_AQUA_KELP_SILT.NAME
