msgstr "讓人很難抗拒想要捏牠臉頰的衝動。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_AQUA_PUFFER.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_AQUA_PUFFER.NAME"
