msgstr "一款溫暖的沙質牆紙，能讓複製人感覺像在度假一樣。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_AQUA_SILT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_AQUA_SILT.NAME"
