msgstr "一款視覺舒適、一帆風順的純藍色牆紙。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_BASIC_BLUE_NAUTICAL.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_BASIC_BLUE_NAUTICAL.NAME"
