msgstr "一個白色的楔形圖案，僅在角落帶有極其微小的藍色。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_CIRCLE_WHITE_BLUE_NAUTICAL.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_CIRCLE_WHITE_BLUE_NAUTICAL.NAME"
