msgstr "一款帶有斜條紋的海洋風牆紙。"

#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_DIAGONAL_BLUE_NAUTICAL_WHITE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_DIAGONAL_BLUE_NAUTICAL_WHITE.NAME"
