#. STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_FOSSIL_PACULACANTH.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BLUEPRINTS.PERMIT_WALLS_FOSSIL_PACULACANTH.DESC"
