#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.ADVANCEDAPOTHECARY.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.ADVANCEDAPOTHECARY.DESC"
msgid "Some medications help prevent diseases, while others aim to alleviate existing illness."
msgstr "一些藥物幫助預防疾病，而其它藥物則用來減輕症狀。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.ADVANCEDAPOTHECARY.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.ADVANCEDAPOTHECARY.EFFECT"
msgid "Produces <link=\"MEDICINE\">Medicine</link> to cure most basic <link=\"DISEASE\">Diseases</link>.\n\nDuplicants must possess the Medicine Compounding <link=\"ROLES\">Skill</link> to fabricate medicines.\n\nDuplicants will not fabricate items unless recipes are queued."
msgstr "生產<link=\"MEDICINE\">藥物</link>以治療大部分基本<link=\"DISEASE\">疾病</link>。\n\n複製人必須有<link=\"ROLES\">配藥</link>技能，才能製作藥物。\n\n佇列中沒有訂單，複製人將不會製作。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.ADVANCEDAPOTHECARY.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.ADVANCEDAPOTHECARY.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"ADVANCEDAPOTHECARY\">Nuclear Apothecary</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"APOTHECARY\">核能製藥桌</link>"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.ADVANCEDCRAFTINGTABLE.BIONIC_COMPONENT_RECIPE_DESC
