msgstr "我的殖民地沒有仿生複製人被分配到這種增效卡匣"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.ADVANCEDCRAFTINGTABLE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.ADVANCEDCRAFTINGTABLE.DESC"
