msgstr "這結合了兩個大家都喜歡的東西：樹鼠和雷射。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CANVAS.FACADES.ART_R.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CANVAS.FACADES.ART_R.NAME"
