msgstr "當未來進行召喚時，複製人會回應。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CANVASTALL.FACADES.ART_TALL_I.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.CANVASTALL.FACADES.ART_TALL_I.NAME"
