#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.FLOWERVASEWALL.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.FLOWERVASEWALL.DESC"
msgid "Placing a plant in a wall pot can add a spot of Decor to otherwise bare walls."
msgstr "壁掛花盆可以為單調的牆壁增加一點裝飾。"

#. STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.FLOWERVASEWALL.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.BUILDINGS.PREFABS.FLOWERVASEWALL.EFFECT"
msgid "Houses a single <link=\"PLANTS\">Plant</link> when sown with a <link=\"PLANTS\">Seed</link>.\n\nIncreases <link=\"DECOR\">Decor</link> when in use, contributing to <link=\"MORALE\">Morale</link>.\n\nMust be hung from a wall."
msgstr "播下<link=\"PLANTS\">種子</link> 後，即可容納單株<link=\"PLANTS\">植物</link>。\n\n使用時會增加<link=\"DECOR\">裝飾度</link>，有助於<link=\"MORALE\">士氣</link>。\n\n必須懸掛在牆上。"

