#. STRINGS.CODEX.A0_PRELIMINARYCALCULATIONS.BODY.CONTAINER2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A0_PRELIMINARYCALCULATIONS.BODY.CONTAINER2"
msgid "<indent=5%>Director,\n\nEven with dramatic optimization, we can't fit the massive volume of resources needed for a colony seed aboard the craft. Not even when calculating for a very small interplanetary travel duration.\n\nSome serious changes are gonna have to be made for this to work.</indent>"
msgstr "<indent=5%>總監：\n\n即使進行了大幅度的優化，我們依然無法將殖民種子所需的龐大資源裝載到太空船上。即使將星際旅行的時間計算得非常短暫，情況也一樣。\n\n為了讓計畫能夠執行，我們必須做出一些重大的改變。</indent>"

