msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A2_THERMODYNAMICLAWS.TITLE"
msgid "The Laws of Thermodynamics"
msgstr "熱力學定律"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A3_B556.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A3_B556.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "I've been so tired lately. I've probably spent the last 3 nights sleeping at my desk, and I've used the lab's safety shower to bathe twice already this month.\n\nWe're technically on schedule, but for some reason Director Stern has been breathing down my neck to get these new products ready for market.\n\nNormally I'd be mad about the added pressure on my work, but something in the Director's voice tells me that time is of the essence.\n------------------\n"
msgstr "最近我真的是累慘了。過去大概三個晚上我都是趴在辦公桌上睡的，這個月我已經用實驗室的安全淋浴間洗了兩次澡。\n\n嚴格來說，我們的進度還算準時。但不知道是出於什麼原因， Stern 總監一直在緊盯著我，催促著要讓這些新產品盡快上市。\n\n一般來說，我會對這種額外的工作壓力感到不滿，但總監語氣中的某種訊號告訴我，現在是刻不容緩的時候。\n------------------\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A3_B556.BODY.CONTAINER2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A3_B556.BODY.CONTAINER2"
msgid "I keep finding myself staring at my computer screen, totally unable to remember what it was I was doing.\n\nI try to force myself to type up some notes or analyze my data but it's like my brain is paralyzed, I can't get anything done.\n\nI'll have to stay late to make up for all this time I've wasted staying late.\n------------------\n"
msgstr "我發現自己不停地盯著電腦螢幕發呆，完全想不起自己到底在做些什麼。\n\n我試著逼自己寫些筆記或是分析數據，但感覺我的大腦像麻痺了一樣，完全沒辦法完成任何事情。\n\n我必須用更多的加班時間，來彌補我浪費掉的那些加班時間。\n------------------\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A3_B556.BODY.CONTAINER3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A3_B556.BODY.CONTAINER3"
msgid "Dr. Broussard told me I looked half dead and sent me home today. I don't think she even has the authority to do that, but I did as I was told. She wasn't messing around if you know what I mean.\n\nI can probably get a head start on my paper from home today, anyway.\n\nI think I have an idea for a circuit configuration that will improve the battery life of all our technologies by a whole 2.3%.\n------------------\n"
msgstr "Broussard 博士說我看起來像半個死人，然後就直接把我送回家了。我不覺得她有權力這麼做，但我還是照做了。她可不是開玩笑的，如果你懂我的意思。\n\n話說回來，我今天可以在家裡先開始著手我的論文了。\n\n我想到了某種電路配置的點子，可以將我們所有科技的電池續航力整體提升整整 2.3%。\n------------------\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A3_B556.BODY.CONTAINER4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A3_B556.BODY.CONTAINER4"
msgid "I got home yesterday fully intending to work on my paper after Broussard sent me home, but the second I walked in the door I hit the pillow and didn't get back up. I slept for <i>12 straight hours</i>.\n\nI had no idea I needed that. When I got into the lab this morning I looked over my work from the past few weeks, and realized it's completely useless.\n\nIt'll take me hours to correct all the mistakes I made these past few months. Is this what I was killing myself for? I'm such a rube, I owe Broussard a huge thanks.\n\nI'll start keeping more regular hours from now on... Also, I was considering maybe getting a dog."
msgstr "昨天 Broussard 叫我回家後，我原本打算在家裡好好寫論文，但一進門就直接倒在枕頭上，然後就再也起不來了。我足足睡了<b>整整 12 個小時</b>。\n\n我完全不知道我這麼需要睡眠。今天早上我回到實驗室後，檢視了過去幾週的工作成果，才發現那些東西根本完全沒用。\n\n我得花好幾個小時來改正過去這幾個月犯下的所有錯誤。這就是我拿命去拼換來的結果嗎？我真是個笨蛋，我欠 Broussard 一聲大大的感謝。\n\n從現在開始，我會保持更規律的工作時間……對了，我還在考慮是不是該養一隻狗。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A3_B556.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A3_B556.SUBTITLE"
msgid "ENCRYPTION LEVEL: NONE"
msgstr "加密等級：無"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A3_B556.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A3_B556.TITLE"
msgid "Personal Journal: B556"
msgstr "個人日誌：B556"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A3_DEVONSBLOG.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A3_DEVONSBLOG.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "<indent=5%>Oh my goddd I found out today that Devon's one of those people who takes pictures of their food and uploads them to some boring blog somewhere.\n\nYou HAVE to come to lunch with us and see, they spend so long taking pictures that the food gets cold and they have to ask the waiter to reheat it. It's SO FUNNY.</indent>"
msgstr "<indent=5%>天阿～我今天發現 Devon 是那種會替食物拍照的人之一，然後將它們上傳到某些無聊的部落格。\n\n你一定要來和我們一起午餐並看看，他們花了很長的時間拍照，食物變冷了且他們又要求服務生重新將它加熱。真有趣。</indent>"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A3_DEVONSBLOG.BODY.CONTAINER2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A3_DEVONSBLOG.BODY.CONTAINER2"
msgid "<indent=5%>Oh cool, Devon's writing a new post for <i>Toast of the Town</i>? I'd love to tag along and \"see how the sausage is made\" so to speak, haha.\n\nI'll see you guys in a bit! :)</indent>"
msgstr "<indent=5%>喔～酷，Devon 寫的新文章<b>土司小鎮</b>？我很喜歡，並標記了「看看香腸是如何製作的」可以這麼說吧，哈哈。\n\n再一會就可以見到你們了！:)</indent>"

