#. STRINGS.CODEX.A6_DISHBOT.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A6_DISHBOT.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "<smallcaps><b>Please Claim Your Bot</b>\nFrom: <b>Admin</b> <alpha=#AA><admin@gravitas.nova></color>\nTo: <b>All</b></smallcaps>\n------------------\n\n<indent=5%>While we appreciate your commitment to office upkeep, we would like to inform whomever installed a dishwashing droid in the cafeteria that your prototype was found grievously misusing dish soap and has been forcefully terminated.\n\nThe remains may be collected at Security Block B.\n\nWe apologize for the inconvenience and thank you for your timely collection of this prototype.\n\n-Admin\nThe Gravitas Facility</indent>"
msgstr "<smallcaps><b>請取回您的機器人</b>\n寄件者：<b>管理部</b> <alpha=#AA><admin@gravitas.nova></color>\n收件者：<b>全體</b></smallcaps>\n------------------\n\n<indent=5%>雖然我們感謝您對保持辦公室清潔的承諾，但我想要通知在咖啡廳安裝洗碗機器人的人，您的原型機被發現嚴重地濫用洗碗精，因此被強制停機拆除。\n\n剩餘的殘骸被集中在安全區 B。\n\n感謝您耗費心力製作了這部原型機。對於給您帶來的不便，我們深表歉意。\n\n－管理部\n引力科技</indent>"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A6_DISHBOT.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A6_DISHBOT.SUBTITLE"
msgid "ENCRYPTION LEVEL: TWO"
msgstr "加密等級：二"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A6_DISHBOT.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A6_DISHBOT.TITLE"
msgid "Dishbot"
msgstr "洗碗機器人"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A6_MEMORYIMPLANTATION.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A6_MEMORYIMPLANTATION.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "[LOG BEGINS]\n\nTraditionally, cloning produces a subject that is genetically identical to the donor but develops independently, producing a being that is, in its own way, unique.\n\nThe pod, conversely, attempts to print an exact atomic copy. Theoretically all neural pathways should be intact and identical to the original subject.\n\nIt's fascinating, given this, that memories are not already inherent in our subjects; however, no cloned subjects as of yet have shown any signs of recognition when introduced to familiar stimuli, such as the donor subject's enclosure.\n\nRefer to Experiment 7D.\n\nRefer to Experiment 7F."
msgstr "[日誌開始]\n\n傳統上，複製會產生一個與捐贈者基因完全相同的個體，但由於獨立發展，會以自己的方式成為一個獨特的生命體。\n\n然而，這個列印元卻是試圖列印一個精確的原子級複製品。從理論上講，所有神經通路都應完整無缺，並且與原個體完全一致。\n\n有鑑於此，最令人著迷的是，我們的個體並未內建任何記憶；至今為止，沒有任何複製個體在接觸熟悉的刺激物時表現出認得的跡象，例如捐贈者個體生活過的環境。\n\n請參閱實驗 7D。\n\n請參閱實驗 7F。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A6_MEMORYIMPLANTATION.BODY.CONTAINER2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A6_MEMORYIMPLANTATION.BODY.CONTAINER2"
msgid "\nMemories <i>must</i> be embedded within the physical brainmaps of our subjects. The only question that remains is how to activate them. Hormones? Chemical supplements? Situational triggers?\n\nThe Director seems eager to move past this problem, and I am concerned at her willingness to bypass essential stages of the research development process.\n\nWe cannot move on to the fine polish of printing systems until the core processes have been perfected - which they have not.\n\nDr. Broussard, signing off.\n\n[LOG ENDS]"
msgstr "\n記憶<b>必須</b>嵌入個體的實體腦圖中。唯一剩下的問題是如何將其啟動。賀爾蒙？化學補充劑？情境觸發機制？\n\n總監似乎急於跳過這個問題，我很擔心她願意繞過研究開發流程中那些必要的階段。\n\n直到核心流程臻於完善之前，我們不能繼續進行列印系統的精細打磨－而這些流程，目前還遠遠沒有。\n\nBroussard 博士，日誌簽退。\n\n[日誌結束]"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A6_MEMORYIMPLANTATION.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A6_MEMORYIMPLANTATION.SUBTITLE"
msgid "ENCRYPTION LEVEL: TWO"
msgstr "加密等級：二"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A6_MEMORYIMPLANTATION.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A6_MEMORYIMPLANTATION.TITLE"
msgid "Memory Dysfunction Log"
msgstr "記憶功能失調日誌"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A6_NEWSECURITY2.BODY.CONTAINER2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A6_NEWSECURITY2.BODY.CONTAINER2"
msgid "<indent=5%>So, the facility is introducing this new security system that scans your hand to unlock the doors. My question is, what exactly are they scanning?\n\nThe folks in engineering say the door device doesn't look like a fingerprint scanner, but the duo working over in bioengineering won't comment at all.\n\nI can't say I like it.</indent>"
msgstr "<indent=5%>所以，設施正在引進這套新的保全系統，掃描你的手就能解鎖大門。我的問題是，他們究竟在掃描什麼？\n\n工程部門的同事說門上的裝置看起來不像指紋掃描器，但生物工程部的兩位老兄完全不願對此發表任何評論。\n\n我可是一點都不喜歡這玩意兒。</indent>"

