#. STRINGS.CODEX.A7_NEUTRONIUM.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A7_NEUTRONIUM.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "[LOG BEGINS]\n\nDirector: I've determined the substance to be metallic in nature. The exact cause of its formation is still unknown, though I believe it to be something of an autoimmune reaction of the natural universe, a quarantining of foreign material to prevent temporal contamination.\n\nDirector: A method has yet to be found that can successfully remove the substance from an affected object, and the larger implication that two molecularly, temporally identical objects cannot coexist at one point in time has dire implications for all time manipulation technology research, not just the Bow.\n\nDirector: For the moment I have dubbed the substance \"Neutronium\", and assigned it a theoretical place on the table of elements. Research continues.\n\n[LOG ENDS]"
msgstr "[日誌開始]\n\n總監：我已經確定該物質本質上屬於金屬。其確切的形成原因仍是未知，不過我認為它類似於自然宇宙的一種自體免疫反應，藉由隔離外來物質來防止時間性汙染。\n\n總監：目前尚未找到能成功從受影響物體上移除此物質的方法，更嚴重的含義在於，兩個分子結構上、時間上完全相同的物體無法共存於同一個時間點，這對所有時間操控技術研究都造成了嚴峻的影響，不只針對「弓」這項研究。\n\n總監：目前我將此物質命名為「零號元素」，並在元素週期表中賦予它一個理論位置。研究仍在持續。\n\n[日誌結束]"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A7_NEUTRONIUM.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A7_NEUTRONIUM.SUBTITLE"
msgid "ENCRYPTION LEVEL: THREE"
msgstr "加密等級：三"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A7_NEUTRONIUM.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A7_NEUTRONIUM.TITLE"
msgid "Byproduct Notes"
msgstr "副產物備註"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A7_NEWEMPLOYEE.BODY.CONTAINER2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A7_NEWEMPLOYEE.BODY.CONTAINER2"
msgid "<indent=5%>Attention Gravitas Facility personnel;\n\nPlease welcome our newest staff member, Olivia Broussard, PhD.\n\nDr. Broussard will be leading our upcoming genetics project and has been installed in our bioengineering department.\n\nBe sure to offer her our warmest welcome.</indent>"
msgstr "<indent=5%>引力科技中心全體人員請注意；\n\n歡迎我們的最新成員，Olivia Broussard 博士。\n\nBroussard 博士將領導我們即將展開的基因學專案，並已進駐我們的生物工程部門。\n\n務必向她表達我們最熱烈的歡迎之意。</indent>"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A7_NEWEMPLOYEE.BODY.EMAILHEADER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A7_NEWEMPLOYEE.BODY.EMAILHEADER1"
msgid "<smallcaps>To: <b>All</b>\nFrom: <b>[REDACTED]</b></smallcaps>\n------------------\n"
msgstr "<smallcaps>收件者：<b>全體</b>\n寄件者：<b>[資料塗銷]</b></color></smallcaps>\n------------------\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A7_NEWEMPLOYEE.BODY.SIGNATURE1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A7_NEWEMPLOYEE.BODY.SIGNATURE1"
msgid "\n[REDACTED]\n<size=11>Personnel Coordinator\nThe Gravitas Facility</indent>\n------------------\n"
msgstr "\n[資料塗銷]\n<size=11>人事專員\n引力科技中心</indent>\n------------------\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A7_NEWEMPLOYEE.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A7_NEWEMPLOYEE.SUBTITLE"
msgid "ENCRYPTION LEVEL: NONE"
msgstr "加密等級：無"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A7_NEWEMPLOYEE.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A7_NEWEMPLOYEE.TITLE"
msgid "Welcome, New Employee"
msgstr "歡迎，新同事"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A8_CLEANUPTHEMESS.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A8_CLEANUPTHEMESS.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "I cleaned up a few messes in my time, but ain't nothing like the mess I seen today in that bio lab. Green goop all over the floor, all over the walls. Murky tubes with what look like human shapes floating in them.\n\nThey think old Mr. Gunderson ain't got smarts enough to put two and two together, but I got eyes, don't I?\n\nAin't nobody ever pay attention to the janitor.\n\nBut the janitor pays attention to everybody.\n\n-Mr. Stinky Gunderson"
msgstr "我這輩子清過不少爛攤子，但沒有一個像我今天在那個生物實驗室看到的這麼誇張。綠色的黏糊物，地板、牆壁到處都是。那些混濁的管子裡，還漂著看起來像人型的東西。\n\n那些人以為老子 Gunderson 不夠聰明，不會自己把事情兜在一起想，但我眼睛沒瞎，你說是不是？\n\n從來就沒人會注意到清潔工啦。\n\n但清潔工可把每個人都看在眼裡。\n\n－Stinky Gunderson 先生"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A8_CLEANUPTHEMESS.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A8_CLEANUPTHEMESS.SUBTITLE"
msgid "ENCRYPTION LEVEL: NONE"
msgstr "加密等級：無"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A8_CLEANUPTHEMESS.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A8_CLEANUPTHEMESS.TITLE"
msgid "Cleaning Up The Mess"
msgstr "清理混亂"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A8_FIRSTSUCCESS.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A8_FIRSTSUCCESS.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "We've successfully compressed and expanded small portions of time under .03 milliseconds. This proves that time is something that can be physically acted upon, suggesting that our vision is attainable.\n\nAn unintentional consequence of both the expansion and contraction of time is the creation of a \"vacuum\" in the space between the affected portion of time and the much more expansive unaffected portions.\n\nSo far, we are seeing that the unaffected time on either side of the manipulated portion will expand or contract to fill the vacuum, although we are unsure how far-reaching this consequence is or what effect it has on the laws of the natural universe. At the end of all compression and expansion experiments, alterations to time are undone and leave no lasting change."
msgstr "我們成功地在 .03 毫秒的範圍內壓縮與擴展了一小段時間。這證明了時間是可以被物理作用的，暗示了我們的願景是可以實現的。\n\n時間的擴展與收縮帶來的意外後果是，在受影響的時間區段與更廣大未受影響的時間區段之間，產生了一個「真空」。\n\n到目前為止，我們觀察到被操縱區段兩側未受影響的時間會擴張或收縮來填補這個真空，儘管我們不確定這個後果的影響範圍有多深遠，以及它會對自然宇宙法則造成什麼衝擊。在所有壓縮與擴展實驗結束後，所有對時間的修改都會被撤銷，不留下任何持久的變化。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A8_FIRSTSUCCESS.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A8_FIRSTSUCCESS.SUBTITLE"
msgid "ENCRYPTION LEVEL: THREE"
msgstr "加密等級：三"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A8_FIRSTSUCCESS.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A8_FIRSTSUCCESS.TITLE"
msgid "Encouraging Results"
msgstr "振奮人心的結果"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A8_NEWSECURITY3.BODY.CONTAINER2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A8_NEWSECURITY3.BODY.CONTAINER2"
msgid "<indent=5%>I'm almost certain now that the Facility's stolen our genetic information.\n\nForty-odd employees would make for mighty convenient lab rats, and even if we discovered what Gravitas did, we wouldn't have a lot of legal options. We can't exactly go to the public given the nature of our work.\n\nI can't stop thinking about what sort of experiments they might be conducting on my DNA, but I have to keep my mouth shut.\n\nI can't risk losing my job.</indent>"
msgstr "<indent=5%>我現在幾乎可以肯定，設施已經竊取了我們的基因資訊。\n\n四十多名員工將會成為極為方便的實驗室白老鼠，而且就算我們發現了引力科技做了什麼，我們也沒有多少法律途徑可以選擇。考慮到我們工作的性質，我們根本無法向公眾公開。\n\n我止不住地猜想他們可能會用我的 DNA 進行什麼樣的實驗，但我必須守口如瓶。\n\n我不能冒險丟掉這份工作。</indent>"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A8_NEWSECURITY3.BODY.EMAILHEADER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A8_NEWSECURITY3.BODY.EMAILHEADER1"
msgid "<smallcaps>To: <b>[REDACTED]</b>\nFrom: <b>[REDACTED]</b></smallcaps>\n------------------\n"
msgstr "<smallcaps>收件者：<b>[資料塗銷]</b>\n寄件者：<b>[資料塗銷]</b></smallcaps>\n------------------\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A8_NEWSECURITY3.BODY.SIGNATURE1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A8_NEWSECURITY3.BODY.SIGNATURE1"
msgid "\n[REDACTED]\n<size=11>The Gravitas Facility</size>\n------------------\n"
msgstr "\n[資料塗銷]\n<size=11>引力科技中心</size>\n------------------\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A8_NEWSECURITY3.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A8_NEWSECURITY3.SUBTITLE"
msgid "ENCRYPTION LEVEL: TWO"
msgstr "加密等級：二"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A8_NEWSECURITY3.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A8_NEWSECURITY3.TITLE"
msgid "They Stole Our DNA"
msgstr "他們竊取了我們的基因"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A9_NEUTRONIUMAPPLICATIONS.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A9_NEUTRONIUMAPPLICATIONS.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "[LOG BEGINS]\n\nDirector: Temporal energy can be reconfigured to vibrate the matter constituting Neutronium at just the right frequency to break it down and disperse it.\n\nDirector: However, it is difficult to stabilize and maintain this reconfigured energy long enough to effectively remove practical amounts of Neutronium in real-life scenarios.\n\nDirector: I am looking into making this technology more reliable and compact - this data could potentially have uses in the development of some sort of all-purpose disintegration ray.\n\n[END LOG]"
msgstr "[日誌開始]\n\n總監：時間能量可以被重新設定，在適當的頻率下震動組成零號元素的物質，可以打破並分散它。\n\n總監：無論如何，在現實生活中，它很難穩定並長時間地維持重新設定的能量以有效的消除實際數量的零號元素。\n\n總監：我正在使這樣技能變的更可靠與嚴謹ー這些資料可能會在某些通用射線的開發中有些用處。\n\n[日誌結束]"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A9_NEUTRONIUMAPPLICATIONS.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A9_NEUTRONIUMAPPLICATIONS.SUBTITLE"
msgid "ENCRYPTION LEVEL: THREE"
msgstr "加密等級：三"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A9_NEUTRONIUMAPPLICATIONS.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A9_NEUTRONIUMAPPLICATIONS.TITLE"
msgid "Possible Applications"
msgstr "可能的應用"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A9_PIPEDREAM.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A9_PIPEDREAM.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "[LOG BEGINS]\n\nThe Director has suggested implanting artificial memories during print, but despite the great strides made in our research under her direction, such a thing can barely be considered more than a pipe dream.\n\nFor the moment we remain focused on eliminating the remaining glitches in the system, as well as developing effective education and training routines for printed subjects.\n\nSuggest: Omega-3 supplements and mentally stimulating enclosure apparatuses to accompany tutelage.\n\nDr. Broussard signing off.\n\n[LOG ENDS]"
msgstr "[日誌開始]\n\n總監建議在列印期間植入人工記憶，儘管我們的研究在她的指導下取得了巨大的進展，但這件事幾乎只能被視為一場白日夢。\n\n目前，我們仍專注於排除系統中殘存的小故障，以及為列印出的個體開發有效的教育與訓練流程。\n\n建議：搭配指導，提供 Omega 3 補充劑與附有保護裝置的精神刺激設備。\n\nBroussard 博士，日誌簽退。\n\n[日誌結束]"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A9_PIPEDREAM.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A9_PIPEDREAM.SUBTITLE"
msgid "ENCRYPTION LEVEL: ZERO"
msgstr "加密等級：零"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.A9_PIPEDREAM.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.A9_PIPEDREAM.TITLE"
msgid "Pipe Dream"
msgstr "白日夢"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.ADVANCEDCURE.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.ADVANCEDCURE.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "An extremely powerful medication created to treat severe <link=\"DISEASE\">Diseases</link>. <link=\"ADVANCEDCURE\">Serum Vial</link> is very effective against <link=\"ZOMBIESPORES\">Zombie Spores</link>.\n\nMust be administered by a Duplicant with the <link=\"MEDICINE3\">Advanced Medical Care</link> Skill."
msgstr "一種極其強效的藥物，用於治療嚴重的<link=\"DISEASE\">疾病</link>。\n\n<link=\"ADVANCEDCURE\">血清瓶</link>用來治療<link=\"ZOMBIESPORES\">殭屍病毒</link>非常有效。\n\n複製人必須有<link=\"MEDICINE3\">進階醫療照顧</link>技能才能製作。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.ADVANCEDCURE.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.ADVANCEDCURE.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Pharmaceutical Care"
msgstr "藥學服務"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.ADVANCEDCURE.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.ADVANCEDCURE.TITLE"
msgid "Serum Vial"
msgstr "血清瓶"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.ANTIHISTAMINE.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.ANTIHISTAMINE.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "A strong antihistamine Duplicants can take to halt an allergic reaction. Each dose will also prevent further reactions from occurring for a short time after ingestion."
msgstr "強效的抗組織胺藥物，複製人服用後能阻止過敏反應。每次劑量服用後，還能在短時間內預防進一步的反應發生。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.ANTIHISTAMINE.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.ANTIHISTAMINE.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Antihistamine"
msgstr "抗組織胺"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.ANTIHISTAMINE.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.ANTIHISTAMINE.TITLE"
msgid "Allergy Medication"
msgstr "抗過敏藥"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.ARBORTREE.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.ARBORTREE.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "Arbor Trees have been cultivated to spread horizontally when they grow so as to produce a high yield of lumber in vertically cramped spaces.\n\nArbor Trees are related to the oak tree, specifically the Japanese Evergreen, though they have been genetically hybridized significantly.\n\nDespite having many hardy, evenly spaced branches, the short stature of the Arbor Tree makes climbing it rather irrelevant."
msgstr "喬木樹生長時呈水平方向發展，以便在垂直狹窄的空間獲得大量的木材。\n\n喬木樹與橡木樹有關，特別是日本長青樹，雖然他們明顯經過基因雜交。\n\n雖然有許多堅固、均勻分佈的樹支，但喬木樹身體矮小使其容易攀爬。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.ARBORTREE.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.ARBORTREE.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Wood Tree"
msgstr "喬木樹"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.ARBORTREE.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.ARBORTREE.TITLE"
msgid "Arbor Tree"
msgstr "喬木樹"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.AUTOMATION.HEADER_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.AUTOMATION.HEADER_1"
msgid "Automation"
msgstr "自動化"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.AUTOMATION.HEADER_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.AUTOMATION.HEADER_2"
msgid "Automation Wires"
msgstr "訊號線"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.AUTOMATION.HEADER_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.AUTOMATION.HEADER_3"
msgid "Signals"
msgstr "訊號"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.AUTOMATION.HEADER_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.AUTOMATION.HEADER_4"
msgid "Gates"
msgstr "邏輯閘"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.AUTOMATION.PARAGRAPH_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.AUTOMATION.PARAGRAPH_1"
msgid "Automation is a tool for controlling the operation of buildings based on what sensors in the colony are detecting.\n\nA <link=\"CEILINGLIGHT\">Ceiling Light</link> could be configured to automatically turn on when a <link=\"LOGICDUPLICANTSENSOR\">Duplicant Motion Sensor</link> detects a Duplicant in the room.\n\nA <link=\"LIQUIDPUMP\">Liquid Pump</link> might activate only when a <link=\"LOGICELEMENTSENSORLIQUID\">Liquid Element Sensor</link> detects water.\n\nA <link=\"AIRCONDITIONER\">Thermo Regulator</link> might activate only when the <link=\"LOGICTEMPERATURESENSOR\">Thermo Sensor</link> detects too much heat.\n\n"
msgstr "自動化是一種工具，用於根據殖民地中的感應器所偵測到的情況，來控制建築物的運作。\n\n<link=\"CEILINGLIGHT\">燈泡</link>可以被設定為，當<link=\"LOGICDUPLICANTSENSOR\">複製人動作感測器</link>偵測到房間內有複製人時，自動開啟。<link=\"LIQUIDPUMP\">液體幫浦</link>可能僅在<link=\"LOGICELEMENTSENSORLIQUID\">液體元素感測器</link>偵測到水時才啟動。\n\n<link=\"AIRCONDITIONER\">冷氣機</link>可能僅在<link=\"LOGICTEMPERATURESENSOR\">溫度感測器</link>偵測到過多的熱量時才啟動。\n\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.AUTOMATION.PARAGRAPH_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.AUTOMATION.PARAGRAPH_2"
msgid "In addition to an <link=\"WIRE\">electrical wire</link>, most powered buildings can also have an <link=\"LOGICWIRE\">Automation Wire</link> connected to them. This wire can signal the building to turn on or off. If the other end of a <link=\"LOGICWIRE\">Automation Wire</link> is connected to a sensor, the building will turn on and off as the sensor outputs signals.\n\n"
msgstr "除了<link=\"WIRE\">電線</link>外，多數的用電設施都可用<link=\"LOGICWIRE\">訊號線</link>連接。訊號線可以發出訊號控制建築的開或關。如果<link=\"LOGICWIRE\">訊號線</link>的另一端已連接到感測器，在感覺器發出訊號時，建築會打開或關閉。\n\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.AUTOMATION.PARAGRAPH_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.AUTOMATION.PARAGRAPH_3"
msgid "There are two signals that an <link=\"LOGICWIRE\">Automation Wire</link> can send: Green and Red. The green signal will usually cause buildings to turn on, and the red signal will usually cause buildings to turn off. Sensors can often be configured to send their green signal only under certain conditions. A <link=\"LOGICTEMPERATURESENSOR\">Thermo Sensor</link> could be configured to only send a green signal if detecting temperatures greater than a chosen value.\n\n"
msgstr "<link=\"LOGICWIRE\">訊號線</link>可以發出：綠色與紅色兩種訊號。綠色訊號通常會將建築物打開，而紅色訊號通常會將建築物關閉。感測器通常可以設定只在某些條件發出綠色訊號。像是<link=\"LOGICTEMPERATURESENSOR\">溫度感測器</link>可設定為只在偵測到溫度高於所設定的值時發出綠色訊號。\n\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.AUTOMATION.PARAGRAPH_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.AUTOMATION.PARAGRAPH_4"
msgid "The signals of sensor wires can be combined using special buildings called \"Gates\" in order to create complex activation conditions.\nThe <link=\"LOGICGATEAND\">AND Gate</link> can have two automation wires connected to its input slots, and one connected to its output slots. It will send a \"Green\" signal to its output slot only if it is receiving a \"Green\" signal from both its input slots. This could be used to activate a building only when multiple sensors are detecting something.\n\n"
msgstr "為了實現某些複雜的啟動條件，感測器的訊號線可以使用稱為「邏輯閘」的特殊建築結合在一起。<link=\"LOGICGATEAND\">及閘</link>可以連接兩條訊號輸入線，然後連接一條訊號輸出線。如果在兩個輸入訊號都是「綠色」的時候，它會輸出「綠色」訊號。這可以用於只有當多個感測器檢查到某些事物時才啟動建築。\n\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.AUTOMATION.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.AUTOMATION.TITLE"
msgid "<link=\"LOGIC\">Automation</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"LOGIC\">自動化</link>"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.B1_HOLLANDSDOG.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.B1_HOLLANDSDOG.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "<indent=5%>OMIGOD, every time I go into the break room now I get ambushed by Dr. Holland and he traps me in a 20 minute conversation about his new dog.\n\nLike, I GET it! Your puppy is cute! Why do you have like 400 different pictures of it on your phone, FROM THE SAME ANGLE?!\n\nSO annoying.</indent>"
msgstr "<indent=5%>天阿，每當我進入休息室，都會被迫與 Holland 博士聊關於他新養的狗的話題長達 20 分鐘。\n\n像是，我懂了！你的小狗很可愛！為什麼你的手機裡有 400 張不同的相片，來自相同的角度？！\n\n很煩人。</indent>"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.B1_HOLLANDSDOG.BODY.CONTAINER2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.B1_HOLLANDSDOG.BODY.CONTAINER2"
msgid "<indent=5%>Haha, I think it's nice, he really loves his dog. Oh! Did I show you the thing my cat did last night? She always falls asleep on my bed but this time she sprawled out on her back and her little tongue was poking out! So cute.\n\n<color=#F44A47>[BROKEN IMAGE]</color>\n<alpha=#AA>[121 MISSING ATTACHMENTS]</color></indent>"
msgstr "<indent=5%>哈哈，我覺得那很好，他真的很喜歡他的狗。喔！我讓你看過我的貓做了什麼嗎？她總是睡在我的床上，但昨晚她睡到翻過來，並將她的小舌頭伸出來！好可愛。\n\n<color=#F44A47>>[損壞的圖片]</color>\n<alpha=#AA>[121 遺失檔案附件]</color></indent>"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.B1_HOLLANDSDOG.BODY.CONTAINER3
