#. STRINGS.CODEX.B7_INSPACE.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.B7_INSPACE.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "<smallcaps>[Voice Recognition Initialized]\n[Subjects Identified: B835, B997]</smallcaps>\n\n[LOG BEGINS]\n\nDr.Ansari: Shhhh...\n\nDr. Bubare: What? What are we doing here?\n\nDr. Ansari: I'll show you, just keep your voice down.\n\nDr. Bubare: Are we even allowed to be here?\n\nDr. Ansari: No. Trust me it'll all be worth it once I can find it.\n\nDr. Bubare: Find what?\n\nDr. Ansari: That!\n\nDr. Bubare: ...Video feed from a rat cage? What's so great about -- Wait. Are they--?\n\nDr. Ansari: Floating!\n\nDr. Bubare: You mean they're in--?\n\nDr. Ansari: Space!\n\nDr. Bubare: Our thermal rats are in space?!?!\n\nDr. Ansari: Yep! There's Applecart and Cherrypie and little Bananabread. Look at them, they're so happy. We made ratstronauts!!\n\nDr. Bubare: HAPPY rat-stronauts.\n\nDr. Ansari: WE MADE HAPPY RATSTRONAUTS!!\n\nDr. Bubare: Shhhhhh...Someone's coming.\n\n[LOG ENDS]"
msgstr "<smallcaps>[語音辨識系統初始化完成]\n[主體已識別：B835, B997]</smallcaps>\n\n[日誌開始]\n\nAnsari 博士：噓…\n\nBubare 博士：什麼？我們在這做什麼？\n\nAnsari 博士：我展示給你看，只要你小聲點。\n\nBubare 博士：這裡允許我們這樣做？\n\nAnsari 博士：不。相信我，一旦我找到它了一切都是值得的。\n\nBubare 博士：找到什麼？\n\nAnsari 博士：那個！\n\nBubare 博士：…老鼠籠的影片？有什麼了不起的…等等。牠們…？\n\nAnsari 博士：漂浮！\n\nBubare 博士：你的意思是牠們在…？\n\nAnsari 博士：太空！\n\nBubare 博士：我們的熱鼠在太空中？！？！\n\nAnsari 博士：是的！這裡有蘋果車，莓果派與小香蕉蛋糕。看看牠們，牠們很開心。我們創造了太空鼠！！\n\nBubare 博士：開心的太空鼠。\n\nAnsari 博士：我們創造了開心的太空鼠！！\n\nBubare 博士：噓…有人來了。\n\n[日誌結束]"

