msgid "Time's Order"
msgstr "時間的順序"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.CARROTPLANT.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.CARROTPLANT.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "Plume Squashes contain over a dozen types of remarkably stable anthocyanins; twice the number found in any other plant. This high concentration of flavonoids contributes to the tuber's vivid pigmentation and tolerance to low temperatures.\n\nThe entire root is safe to eat, including the peel. The upper \"plume\" can be used to brush wayward bits off one's chin after the meal."
msgstr "羽葉果薯含有十幾種極其穩定的花青素；其含量是其他任何植物的兩倍。這種高濃度的類黃酮有助於該塊莖呈現鮮豔的色素沉著，並提升其耐低溫能力。\n\n整個根部連同外皮都可安全食用。其上部的「羽狀物」則可用於飯後拂去下巴上的頑固碎屑。"

