#. STRINGS.CODEX.EXOBASESDLC1.PARAGRAPH_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.EXOBASESDLC1.PARAGRAPH_1"
msgid "Building a rocket first requires constructing a <link=\"LAUNCHPAD\">Rocket Platform</link> and adding modules from the menu. All rockets will require an engine, a nosecone and a Command Module piloted by a Duplicant possessing the <link=\"ROCKETPILOTING1\">Rocket Piloting</link> skill or higher. Note that the <link=\"HABITATMODULESMALL\">Solo Spacefarer Nosecone</link> functions as both a Command Module and a nosecone.\n\n"
msgstr "建造火箭首先需要建造一個<link=\"LAUNCHPAD\">火箭平台</link>，並從選單中新增模組。所有的火箭都需要引擎、鼻錐和由擁有<link=\"ROCKETPILOTING1\">火箭駕駛</link>技能或更高階技能的複製人駕駛的指揮艙。請注意，<link=\"HABITATMODULESMALL\">單座鼻錐</link>同時具備指揮艙和鼻錐的功能。\n\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.EXOBASESDLC1.PARAGRAPH_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.EXOBASESDLC1.PARAGRAPH_2"
msgid "To scan space and see nearby interstellar destinations a <link=\"CLUSTERTELESCOPE\">Telescope</link> must first be built on the surface of a Planetoid. Sending an <link=\"ORBITALRESEARCHCENTER\">Orbital Data Collection Lab</link> into orbit around a Planetoid, and having a <link=\"SCANNERMODULE\">Cartographic Module</link> attached to a rocket can also reveal places on a Starmap.\n\nAlways check engine fuel to determine if your rocket can reach its destination, keeping in mind that rockets can only land on Planetoids with a <link=\"LAUNCHPAD\">Rocket Platform</link> on it. Notably, some modules, like <link=\"SCOUTMODULE\">Rover's Modules</link> and <link=\"PIONEERMODULE\">Trailblazer Modules</link>, can be sent to the surface of a Planetoid from a rocket in orbit.\n\nIf a rocket runs out of fuel before it reaches a viable landing site, it will become stranded."
msgstr "若要掃描太空並查看附近的星際目的地，首先必須在小行星表面建造一座<link=\"CLUSTERTELESCOPE\">望遠鏡</link>。位於小行星軌道上的<link=\"ORBITALRESEARCHCENTER\">軌道資料收集儀</link>，以及附加於火箭上的<link=\"SCANNERMODULE\">製圖模組</link>，也能揭示星圖上的區域。\n\n務必檢查引擎燃料，以確定你的火箭是否能抵達目的地。請牢記，火箭只能在設有<link=\"LAUNCHPAD\">火箭平台</link>的小行星上著陸；然而，某些模組如<link=\"SCOUTMODULE\">漫遊者模組</link>和<link=\"PIONEERMODULE\">開拓者模組</link>，則可從軌道上的火箭發射至小行星表面。\n\n如果火箭在到達可行的降落地點之前耗盡燃料，它將會滯留。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.EXOBASESDLC1.PARAGRAPH_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.EXOBASESDLC1.PARAGRAPH_3"
msgid "Rockets must be stocked with adequate <link=\"BUILDCATEGORYOXYGEN\">Oxygen</link> and <link=\"FOOD\">Food</link> to sustain crew members for the entirety of the journey. Shelf-stable rations that do not require refrigeration should be prioritized as onboard space is limited.\n\nSpending extended periods confined to a rocket interior also takes a toll on <link=\"MORALE\">Morale</link>, which can be mitigated by providing a <link=\"REQUIREMENTCLASSTOILETTYPE\">Toilet</link> to prevent messes, choosing higher-<link=\"DECOR\">Decor</link> furnishings, or dividing up the rocket's interior to benefit from <link=\"ROOMS\">Rooms</link> bonuses."
msgstr "火箭必須儲備足夠的<link=\"BUILDCATEGORYOXYGEN\">氧氣</link>和<link=\"FOOD\">食物</link>，以維持船員在整個旅程中的需求。由於船上空間有限，應優先考慮無需冷藏且保質期長的口糧。\n\n在火箭內部長時間受限也會對<link=\"MORALE\">士氣</link>造成影響。可以透過以下方式來緩解：提供<link=\"REQUIREMENTCLASSTOILETTYPE\">廁所</link>以防止髒亂。選擇更高<link=\"DECOR\">裝飾度</link>的家具。劃分火箭內部空間以獲得<link=\"ROOMS\">房間</link>獎勵。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.EXOBASESDLC1.PARAGRAPH_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.EXOBASESDLC1.PARAGRAPH_4"
msgid "Goods can be teleported between worlds with connected Supply Teleporters through <link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">Gas</link>, <link=\"ELEMENTSLIQUID\">Liquid</link>, and <link=\"ELEMENTSSOLID\">Solid</link> conduits.\n\nPlanetoids not connected through Supply Teleporters can use rockets to transport goods, either by landing on a <link=\"LAUNCHPAD\">Rocket Platform</link> or a <link=\"ORBITALCARGOMODULE\">Orbital Cargo Module</link> deployed from a rocket in orbit. Additionally, the <link=\"RAILGUN\">Interplanetary Launcher</link> can send <link=\"RAILGUNPAYLOAD\">Interplanetary Payloads</link> full of goods through space but must be opened by a <link=\"RAILGUNPAYLOADOPENER\">Payload Opener</link>. A <link=\"LANDINGBEACON\">Targeting Beacon</link> can guide payloads and orbital modules to land at a specific location on a Planetoid surface."
msgstr "貨物可以透過連接補給傳送器上的<link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">氣體</link>、<link=\"ELEMENTSLIQUID\">液體</link>與<link=\"ELEMENTSSOLID\">固體</link>輸送帶軌道在兩個世界中傳送。\n\n未與補給傳送器連接的小行星，可利用火箭運輸貨物，方法是降落在<link=\"LAUNCHPAD\">火箭平台</link>上，或從軌道上的火箭部署<link=\"ORBITALCARGOMODULE\">軌道貨艙模組</link>。此外，<link=\"RAILGUN\">軌道炮</link>能將裝滿貨物的<link=\"RAILGUNPAYLOAD\">星際貨箱</link>送入太空，但需由<link=\"RAILGUNPAYLOADOPENER\">星際貨箱拆箱機</link>打開。<link=\"LANDINGBEACON\">定位信標</link>則可引導貨運艙和軌道模組，降落在小行星表面的特定位置。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.EXOBASESDLC1.PARAGRAPH_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.EXOBASESDLC1.PARAGRAPH_5"
msgid "Retrieving resources from space requires mining a target mass using a rocket equipped with a <link=\"NOSECONEHARVEST\">Drillcone</link>, then gathering the harvestable fragments with a cargo module designed for those materials. Cargo modules include <link=\"SOLIDCARGOBAYSMALL\">Cargo Bay</link>, <link=\"LIQUIDCARGOBAYCLUSTER\">Large Liquid Cargo Tank</link>, <link=\"GASCARGOBAYSMALL\">Gas Cargo Canister</link>, and more.\n\nFree-floating <link=\"SPACEARTIFACT\">Space Artifacts</link> and <link=\"DATABANK\">Data Bank</link>s can be gathered with an <link=\"ARTIFACTCARGOBAY\">Artifact Transport Module</link> or a <link=\"RESEARCHCLUSTERMODULE\">Research Module</link> respectively, no mining required."
msgstr "從太空獲取資源需要使用裝備了<link=\"NOSECONEHARVEST\">鑽頭鼻錐</link>的火箭來開採目標物質塊，然後使用專為該材料設計的貨物模組來收集可收穫的碎片。貨物模組包括<link=\"SOLIDCARGOBAYSMALL\">貨艙</link>、<link=\"LIQUIDCARGOBAYCLUSTER\">大型液體貨艙</link>、<link=\"GASCARGOBAYSMALL\">氣體貨艙</link> 等。\n\n自由漂浮的<link=\"SPACEARTIFACT\">太空文物</link>和<link=\"DATABANK\">資料磁片</link>可以分別透過<link=\"ARTIFACTCARGOBAY\">文物運輸模組</link>或<link=\"RESEARCHCLUSTERMODULE\">研究模組</link>來收集，無需開採。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.EXOBASESDLC1.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.EXOBASESDLC1.TITLE"
msgid "<link=\"EXOBASES\">Space Travel</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"EXOBASES\">太空旅行</link>"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.EXPERIMENT52B.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.EXPERIMENT52B.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "Experiment 52B is an aggressive, yet sessile creature that produces 5 kilograms of sap per 1000 kcal it consumes.\n\nDuplicants would do well to maintain a safe distance when delivering food to Experiment 52B.\n\nWhile this creature may look like a tree, its taxonomy more closely resembles a giant land-based coral with cybernetic implants.\n\nAlthough normally lab-grown creatures would be given a better name than Experiment 52B, in this particular case the experimenting scientists weren't sure that they were done."
msgstr "實驗體 52B 是一種具有攻擊性的定點植物，每消耗 1000 大卡食物會產生 5 公斤原生膠。\n\n複製人在向實驗 52B 運送食物時最好保持安全距離。\n\n雖然這種生物可能看起來像一棵樹，但它的分類更類似於帶有控制植入體的巨型陸基珊瑚。\n\n雖然通常實驗室培育的生物會被賦予比實驗體 52B 更好的名字，但在這種特殊情況下，實驗科學家並不確定它們是否已經完成。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.EXPERIMENT52B.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.EXPERIMENT52B.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Plant?"
msgstr "植物？"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.EXPERIMENT52B.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.EXPERIMENT52B.TITLE"
msgid "Experiment 52B"
msgstr "實驗體 52B"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.FARM_STATION_TOOLS.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.FARM_STATION_TOOLS.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "Micronutrient fertilizer is a specialized <link=\"FERTILIZER\">Fertilizer</link> produced at the <link=\"FARMSTATION\">Farm Station</link>.\n\nIt must be crafted by Duplicants with the <link=\"FARMING2\">Crop Tending</link> Skill, and helps <link=\"PLANTS\">Plants</link> grow faster."
msgstr "肥料包是在<link=\"FARMSTATION\">農業站</link>生產的專用<link=\"FERTILIZER\">肥料</link>。\n\n必須由具有<link=\"FARMING2\">作物照料</link>技能的複製人制作，幫助<link=\"PLANTS\">植物</link>更快生長。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.FARM_STATION_TOOLS.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.FARM_STATION_TOOLS.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Specialized Farming Equipment"
msgstr "專用農業裝置"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.FARM_STATION_TOOLS.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.FARM_STATION_TOOLS.TITLE"
msgid "Micronutrient Fertilizer"
msgstr "肥料包"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.FEATHER_FABRIC.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.FEATHER_FABRIC.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "A stalk of raw keratin used in the production of <link=\"EQUIPMENT\">Clothing</link> and textiles."
msgstr "一種用於生產<link=\"EQUIPMENT\">服裝</link>和紡織品的未加工角蛋白。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.FEATHER_FABRIC.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.FEATHER_FABRIC.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Textile Ingredient"
msgstr "紡織原料"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.FEATHER_FABRIC.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.FEATHER_FABRIC.TITLE"
msgid "Feather Fiber"
msgstr "羽毛纖維"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.FETCHDRONE.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.FETCHDRONE.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "The Flydo is an airborne delivery robot designed to transport solid items across great distances, both horizontal and vertical.\n\nThese wireless robots may deplete their <link=\"ELECTROBANK\">Power Banks</link> in mid-flight and temporarily shut down until a replacement is delivered. Once rebooted, they reawaken feeling as energized as if it was their very first day on the job.\n\nTragically, some powered-down Flydos fall into liquid pools and may never be rebooted at all."
msgstr "飛尋機是飛行運送機器人，旨在遠距離水平與垂直方向運輸固體物品。\n\n這些無線機器人可能在飛行途中因耗盡<link=\"ELECTROBANK\">移動電源</link>而暫時停機，需要運來替代電源。重啟後，它們就像第一天工作一樣充滿活力。\n\n不幸的是，一些斷電的飛尋機直接掉到了液體池裏，再也沒有機會重啟了。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.FETCHDRONE.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.FETCHDRONE.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Delivery Robot"
msgstr "運送機器人"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.FETCHDRONE.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.FETCHDRONE.TITLE"
msgid "Flydo"
msgstr "飛尋機"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.FILAMENTPLANT.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.FILAMENTPLANT.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "The catkins that bloom at the end of each Petta Pouf branch are made up of thousands of silky soft hairs akin to a luxurious fur coat. Many growers find themselves regarding this diminutive member of the willow family as a beloved companion.\n\n"
msgstr "蓬茸柳每一根枝條末端盛開的絨絮，由數千根絲滑柔軟的細毛組成，觸感宛如一件奢華的皮草大衣。許多種植者都將這種小巧的楊柳科植物視為心愛的陪伴。\n\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.FILAMENTPLANT.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.FILAMENTPLANT.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Aquatic Decor Plant"
msgstr "水生裝飾植物"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.FILAMENTPLANT.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.FILAMENTPLANT.TITLE"
msgid "Petta Pouf"
msgstr "蓬茸柳"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.FISHFOOD.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.FISHFOOD.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "<smallcaps>Pictured: Pacu Treat</smallcaps>"
msgstr "<smallcaps>圖：帕庫魚食</smallcaps>"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.FISHFOOD.BODY.CONTAINER2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.FISHFOOD.BODY.CONTAINER2"
msgid "A gourmet loaf of ground seeds and <link=\"WATER\">Water</link>, formulated to delight <link=\"PACUSPECIES\">Pacus</link>."
msgstr "由磨碎的種子與<link=\"WATER\">水</link>製成的精緻飼料塊，旨在滿足<link=\"PACUSPECIES\">帕庫</link>的口腹之慾。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.FISHFOOD.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.FISHFOOD.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Fish Food"
msgstr "魚飼料"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.FISHFOOD.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.FISHFOOD.TITLE"
msgid "Pacu Treat"
msgstr "帕庫魚食"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.FLYTRAPPLANT.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.FLYTRAPPLANT.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "Lura Plants are carnivorous flowers with ribbon-like anthers that detect the presence of airborne critters within trapping range.\n\nThe Lura's petals are covered in fine, hollow hairs that immobilize prey and ensure even distribution of digestive enzymes. The only part of a critter that the plant cannot fully digest is the exoskeleton, which irritate its mucous membrane.\n\nLiquefied exoskeletal remains are flushed from the plant as needed."
msgstr "誘捕花是一種肉食性花卉，其絲帶狀的蕊絲能感知捕獵範圍內飛行小動物的存在。\n\n誘捕花的花瓣覆蓋著細小中空的毛髮，能固定獵物並確保消化酶的均勻分佈。這種植物唯一無法完全消化的部分是生物的外骨骼，這會刺激牠的黏膜。\n\n液化的外骨骼殘骸會視需要從植物中排出。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.FLYTRAPPLANT.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.FLYTRAPPLANT.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Carnivorous Plant"
msgstr "食肉植物"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.FLYTRAPPLANT.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.FLYTRAPPLANT.TITLE"
msgid "Lura Plant"
msgstr "誘捕花"

