msgid "<link=\"HEALTH\">Health</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"HEALTH\">生命值</link>"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.HEAT.HEADER_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.HEAT.HEADER_1"
msgid "Temperature"
msgstr "溫度"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.HEAT.HEADER_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.HEAT.HEADER_2"
msgid "Wilting, Overheating, and Melting"
msgstr "枯萎，過熱和熔化"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.HEAT.HEADER_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.HEAT.HEADER_3"
msgid "Thermal Energy"
msgstr "熱量"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.HEAT.HEADER_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.HEAT.HEADER_4"
msgid "Conduction and Insulation"
msgstr "導熱與隔熱"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.HEAT.HEADER_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.HEAT.HEADER_5"
msgid "State Changes"
msgstr "狀態變化"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.HEAT.HEADER_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.HEAT.HEADER_6"
msgid "Tutorials"
msgstr "教學"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.HEAT.PARAGRAPH_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.HEAT.PARAGRAPH_1"
msgid "Just about everything on the asteroid has a temperature. It's normal for temperature to rise and fall a bit, but extreme temperatures can cause all sorts of problems for a base. Buildings can stop functioning, crops can wilt, and things can even melt, boil, and freeze when they really ought not to.\n\n"
msgstr "小行星上的所有東西都有溫度。溫度小幅的上升或下降是正常的，但極端溫度問題可能會為基地造成許多的問題。建築物可能停止運轉，農作物可能枯萎，事物甚至可能在不應該發生的情況下熔化、沸騰和結冰。\n\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.HEAT.PARAGRAPH_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.HEAT.PARAGRAPH_2"
msgid "Most crops require their body temperatures to be within a certain range in order to grow. Values outside of this range are not fatal, but will pause growth. If a building's temperature exceeds its overheat temperature it will take damage and require repair.\nAt very extreme temperatures buildings may melt or boil away.\n\n"
msgstr "多數的農作物它們的體溫需要在適當的範圍下才能生長。超出範圍不會致死，但會停止生長。如果建築的溫度過熱，它會受損並需要維修。在極高溫度下建築可能會熔化或沸騰。\n\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.HEAT.PARAGRAPH_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.HEAT.PARAGRAPH_3"
msgid "Temperature increases when the thermal energy of a substance increases. The value of temperature is equal to the total Thermal Energy divided by the Specific Heat Capacity of the substance. Because Specific Heat Capacity varies between substances so significantly, it is often the case a substance can have a higher temperature than another despite a lower overall thermal energy. This quality makes Water require nearly four times the amount of thermal energy to increase in temperature compared to Oxygen.\n\n"
msgstr "當物質的熱能增加時，溫度也會隨之增加。溫度的數值等於總熱能除以物質的比熱容。由於比熱容在不同物質間存在顯著差異，因此經常出現一種物質的總熱能較低，但溫度卻比另一種物質高的情況。這種特性使得水在升高溫度時，所需的熱能幾乎是氧氣的四倍。\n\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.HEAT.PARAGRAPH_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.HEAT.PARAGRAPH_4"
msgid "Thermal energy can be transferred between Buildings, Creatures, World tiles, and other world entities through Conduction. Conduction occurs when two things of different Temperatures are touching. The rate of the energy transfer is the product of the averaged Conductivity values and Temperature difference. Thermal energy will flow slowly between substances with low conductivity values (insulators), and quickly between substances with high conductivity (conductors).\n\n"
msgstr "熱能可透過傳導在建築、生物、世界方塊與其它世界實體之間交換。當兩個不同溫度的東西接觸時會發生傳導。\n\n能量交換的速度取決於導熱係數的平均值。熱能在導熱係數低的物質間緩慢傳遞（絕緣體），而在導熱係數高的物質間快速傳遞（導體）。\n\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.HEAT.PARAGRAPH_5
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.HEAT.PARAGRAPH_5"
msgid "Water ice melts into liquid water when its temperature rises above its melting point. Liquid water boils into steam when its temperature rises above its boiling point. Similar transitions in state occur for most elements, but each element has its own threshold temperatures. Sometimes the transitions are not reversible - crude oil boiled into sour gas will not condense back to crude oil when cooled. Instead, the substance might condense into a totally different element with a different utility.\n\n"
msgstr "當溫度超過熔點時，水冰會熔化成液態水。當溫度超過沸點時，液態水會沸騰成蒸汽。類似的狀態轉換發生在大多數元素上，但每個元素都有各自的臨界溫度。有些時候這些變化是不可逆的－原油沸騰後會變成酸氣，冷卻時將不會凝結回原油。相反地，該物質可能會凝結成完全不同的元素，並具有不同的用途。\n\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.HEAT.PARAGRAPH_6
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.HEAT.PARAGRAPH_6"
msgid "To learn more, watch <link=\"VIDEOS17\">Video: Insulation</link> and see the <link=\"MISCELLANEOUSTIPS8\">Duplicant Temperature</link> tutorial.\n\n"
msgstr "若要了解更多，請觀看<link=\"VIDEOS17\">影片：隔熱</link>並參閱<link=\"MISCELLANEOUSTIPS8\">教學：複製人溫度</link>。\n\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.HEAT.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.HEAT.TITLE"
msgid "<link=\"HEAT\">Heat</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"HEAT\">熱</link>"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.HEXALENT.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.HEXALENT.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "While most plants grow new sections and leaves according to the Fibonacci Sequence, the Hexalent forms new sections similar to how atoms form into crystal structures.\n\nThe result is a geometric pattern that resembles a honeycomb."
msgstr "雖然植物大體上按照費波那契數列生長新的部分與葉子，但六方體的新部分較近於以原子形成晶體結構。\n\n結果就是類似於蜂巢的幾何圖案。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.HEXALENT.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.HEXALENT.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Edible Plant"
msgstr "可食用植物"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.HEXALENT.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.HEXALENT.TITLE"
msgid "Hexalent"
msgstr "蜂巢仙人掌"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.HYDROCACTUS.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.HYDROCACTUS.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

#. STRINGS.CODEX.HYDROCACTUS.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.HYDROCACTUS.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Plant"
msgstr "植物"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.HYDROCACTUS.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.HYDROCACTUS.TITLE"
msgid "Hydrocactus"
msgstr "仙水掌"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.ICEBELLY.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.ICEBELLY.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "The Bammoth is one of the oldest species on record, with ancient skeletal remains dating back approximately 10,000 years.\n\nThis placid herbivore is known for its unique body language: an angry young Bammoth expresses displeasure by flopping down dramatically in front of its opponent, while older creatures with limited mobility will sit facing away from the source of their annoyance.\n\nLicking the ground in front of a caregiver can be a sign of either deep affection or mineral deficiency."
msgstr "猛瑪絨兔是有紀錄以來最古老的物種，其古老的遺骸可追溯到大約 10,000 年前。\n\n這種平靜的食草動物因其獨特的肢體語言而出名：一隻憤怒的青年猛瑪絨兔會透過在對手面前戲劇性地摔倒表達不滿，而行動不便的年長猛瑪絨兔會背對著引起它煩惱的來源坐著。\n\n在看護者面前舔舐地面可能是其深厚感情的表現，也可能是缺乏礦物質的表現。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.ICEBELLY.SPECIES_SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.ICEBELLY.SPECIES_SUBTITLE"
msgid "Critter Species"
msgstr "小動物物種"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.ICEBELLY.SPECIES_TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.ICEBELLY.SPECIES_TITLE"
msgid "Bammoths"
msgstr "猛瑪兔類"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.ICEBELLY.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.ICEBELLY.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Domesticable Critter"
msgstr "可馴養的小動物"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.ICEBELLY.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.ICEBELLY.TITLE"
msgid "Bammoth"
msgstr "猛瑪絨兔"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.ICEFLOWER.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.ICEFLOWER.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "Idylla Flowers are a rare species of everblooms that thrive with very little care, making them a perennial favorite among newbie gardeners.\n\nTheir springy blossoms can be 'bopped' gently for sensory entertainment, but hands should be washed immediately as the petal residue can permanently stain most textiles."
msgstr "恬靜花是一種常開花的稀有物種，只需要非常少的照顧就能健康成長，使其常年成為新手園丁的最愛。\n\n其富有活力的花可以輕輕地跳「博普舞」以帶來感官的娛樂，但之後應該立即洗手，因為花瓣殘留物能永久弄髒大多數紡織品。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.ICEFLOWER.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.ICEFLOWER.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Decorative Plant"
msgstr "裝飾植物"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.ICEFLOWER.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.ICEFLOWER.TITLE"
msgid "Idylla Flower"
msgstr "恬靜花"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.INTERMEDIATEBOOSTER.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.INTERMEDIATEBOOSTER.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "A supplement that significantly reduces the chance of contracting a <style=\"KKeyword\">Germ</style>-based <link=\"DISEASE\">Disease</link>.\n\nMust be taken daily."
msgstr "一種能顯著降低感染<style=\"KKeyword\">病菌</style>性<link=\"DISEASE\">疾病</link>機率的補充劑。\n\n必須每日服用。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.INTERMEDIATEBOOSTER.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.INTERMEDIATEBOOSTER.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Health Supplement"
msgstr "保健品"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.INTERMEDIATEBOOSTER.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.INTERMEDIATEBOOSTER.TITLE"
msgid "Immuno Booster"
msgstr "免疫增強劑"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.INTERMEDIATECURE.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.INTERMEDIATECURE.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "A doctor-administered cure for moderate <link=\"DISEASE\">Diseases</link>. <link=\"INTERMEDIATECURE\">Medical Pack</link>s are very effective against <link=\"SLIMESICKNESS\">Slimelung</link>.\n\nMust be administered by a Duplicant with the <link=\"MEDICINE2\">Bedside Manner</link> Skill."
msgstr "一種醫生用來治療中度<link=\"DISEASE\">疾病</link>的治療劑。<link=\"INTERMEDIATECURE\">醫療包</link>對抗<link=\"SLIMESICKNESS\">黏液肺</link>非常有效。\n\n必須由具備<link=\"MEDICINE2\">床邊照護</link>技能的複製人施用。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.INTERMEDIATECURE.SUBTITLE
