#. STRINGS.CODEX.INVESTIGATIONS.DLC2_EARTHQUAKE.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.INVESTIGATIONS.DLC2_EARTHQUAKE.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "This morning's earthquake was an unusual one. The ground itself moved very little, but the air hummed and lapped at the walls as though it were liquid. It was so brief that I almost wondered if I'd imagined it. Then I noticed the Bow.\n\nIt has thus far been unaffected by seismic disruptions, but in the past few hours there has been a marked increase in the audibility of its machinations and a 0.19 percent decrease in output. I've assigned a technician to investigate. We cannot afford to lose even the smallest amount of power at this stage.\n\nNo one else seems to have noticed anything other than Dr. Ali. He says that the remote research access point project was also affected. It seems that the disruption restarted the entire teleportation system. The monitor is now displaying multiple shipping confirmation messages, despite the target building remaining in the departure dock. Reports show that an unknown number of access point blueprints have been disseminated. One shipment does appear to have reached Ceres, luckily, though it's quite far from the landing site.\n\nDr. Ali's entire team is working to determine how many others exist, and pinpoint their geographic and temporal locations.\n\nI am not optimistic.\n\nThe geologists insist that their equipment has recorded no seismic activity at all for several days.\n\nIt begs the question: What <i>was</i> it, if not an earthquake? Where did this event originate?\n\nDr. Ali quipped that maybe a Bow had malfunctioned in another timeline, which is absurd.\n\nIsn't it?"
msgstr "今天早上的地震不同尋常。地面本身移動量很小，但空氣嗡嗡作響，拍打著牆壁，好像液體一樣。因為太短了，以至於我差點懷疑我是不是做夢夢到的。然後我注意到了時間之弓。\n\n到目前為止，它完全沒有受到地震干擾的影響，但就過去的幾個小時內，其機械裝置的聲音顯著提升，產出下降了 0.19%。我已經派一名技術員去調查了。在目前階段，哪怕是失去一丁點電力我們都負擔不起。\n\n除了 Ali 博士外，似乎沒有其他人注意到了。他說遠端研究資訊訪問點專案也受到了影響。看起來這次干擾重啟了整個傳送系統。儘管目標建築現在還在離港碼頭，監視器上卻顯示著多條運輸確認訊息。報告顯示，數量不明的訪問點藍圖已被分發。幸運的是，有一批貨物似乎已經到達穀神星了，儘管離著陸點很遠。\n\nAli 博士的整個團隊都在努力確認還有多少其他存在，並確定其地理和時間位置。\n\n我並不樂觀。\n\n地質學家堅持表明其裝備已經好幾天都沒有記錄到地震活動了。\n\n這就引出了一個問題：如果不是地震的話，那<b>會是</b>什麼？這個事件起源於哪兒？\n\nAli 博士說笑道，可能是時間之弓在另一個時間線出故障了，這很荒謬。\n\n不是嗎？"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.INVESTIGATIONS.DLC2_EARTHQUAKE.SUBTITLE
