#. STRINGS.CODEX.INVESTIGATIONS.DLC2_GEOTHERMALTESTING.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.INVESTIGATIONS.DLC2_GEOTHERMALTESTING.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "<smallcaps>[Voice Recognition Initialized]\n[Subject Identified: B224]</smallcaps>\n\n[LOG BEGINS]\n\n(throat clearing)\n\nHello? Is this thing on?\n\n(sound of tapping on a microphone)\n\nHere we go. Ahem. Tests are progressing as anticipated and results have exceeded our hopes, particularly in regards to thermal threshold.\n\nComing in \"hot,\" as we used to say!\n\n(cough)\n\nAnyway.\n\nFirst we introduced twelve tons of brackish aquifer water cooled to sixty-five degrees.\n\nThis yielded clean steam, as well as soil, salt and trace minerals. As expected.\n\nOkay, so now we flush the system... Ramp up the temperature in the water tank and run it through at two hundred degrees.\n\n(sound of liquid rushing through pipes)\n\nClear the steam so we can-\n\n(sound of a small clang)\n\nHang on, there's some kind of debris...\n\nWe have to be cautious, one small obstruction in this system could be catastrophi-\n\nWait, are those... <i>oxidized iron</i> nuggets?\n\nBut how...\n\nAll I changed was the tempera-\n\nGet me twelve tons of...uh, oil!\n\nStat!\n\nSorry, <i>please.</i>\n\n[LOG ENDS]\n------------------\n[LOG BEGINS]\n\n(long silence)\n\n(sound of machinery powering down)\n\n...unbelievable.\n\n[LOG ENDS]"
msgstr "<smallcaps>[語音辨識系統初始化完成]\n[主體已識別：B224]</smallcaps>\n\n[日誌開始]\n\n（清嗓子）\n\n你好？這東西開了嗎？\n\n（敲擊麥克風的聲音）\n\n開始吧。嗯哼。測試按預期進行，結果超出了我們的預期，尤其是在溫度門檻方面。\n\n正如我們過去所說的那樣，「熱」翻天！\n\n（咳嗽）\n\n無論如何。\n\n首先我們引入了 12 噸冷卻至 65 度的地下層鹽水。\n\n這產生了清潔蒸汽，以及土壤、鹽和微量礦物質。和預期一樣。\n\n好的，那麼現在我們重新整理系統…提高水箱的溫度，在 200 度下執行。\n\n（液體流過管道的聲音）\n\n清空蒸汽，這樣一來我們就可以——\n\n（輕微的叮噹聲）\n\n等等，裡面有某些雜物…\n\n我們得小心點，這個系統中稍有堵塞就是災——\n\n等下，那些是…<b>氧化鐵</b>碎塊？\n\n但怎麼會…\n\n我只是改了溫——\n\n給我 12 噸…噢，是油！\n\n快！\n\n<i>真是</i>，對不起。\n\n[日誌結束]\n------------------\n[日誌開始]\n\n（長時間的沉默）\n\n（機器斷電的聲音）\n\n…難以置信。\n\n[日誌結束]"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.INVESTIGATIONS.DLC2_GEOTHERMALTESTING.SUBTITLE
