#. STRINGS.CODEX.INVESTIGATIONS.DLC2_VOICEMAIL.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.INVESTIGATIONS.DLC2_VOICEMAIL.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "<smallcaps>[File fragmentation detected]\n[Voice Recognition unavailable]</smallcaps>\n\n[LOG BEGINS]\n\n...Grandfather? ...one of your cardigan-wearing interns just dropped off a letter saying you're going to SPACE??\n\nHave you gone mad?\n\nIt's dated a week from now... the young fellow went completely red when he realized he'd delivered it early.\n\nI tried Miranda, and she says she hasn't heard from you since the Sustainable Futures summit.\n\nShe said something about some sort of training session. Only no one at the office knows what she's on about.\n\nHow am I meant to explain your absence tomorrow? GEI's going to be absolutely livid. If they back out of this deal, it won't be just the underlings who get laid off.\n\n...What exactly do you think you'll achieve, trapped in space with four strangers for the rest of your miserable existence?\n\nYou're a business man, not a bloody astronaut!\n\nNot to mention there's a <i>war</i> on! Who's to say your ground control team won't be dead within the year?\n\n[Sound of several phones starting to ring off the hook.]\n\nI've got to go. Call me back or I'm going straight to the Board.\n\n[FILE ENDS]"
msgstr "<smallcaps>[偵測到檔案片段]\n[語音辨識系統無法使用]</smallcaps>\n\n[日誌開始]\n\n…爺爺？…你的一個穿羊毛衫的實習生剛剛給我寄了一封信，說你已經去太空啦？？\n\n你瘋了嗎？\n\n寫信日期上寫的是一週後…那年輕人意識到他搞錯了的時候完全羞紅了臉。\n\n我試著聯絡 Miranda，她說她在「可持續的未來」峰會之後就再也沒聽到過你的訊息了。\n\n她說了一些關於某種培訓課程的事情。只是辦公室裡沒有人知道她在說什麼。\n\n我該如何解釋你明天的缺席？GEI 絕對要發火的。如果他們要退出這場交易，那被解僱的就不僅僅是幾個下屬了。\n\n…在你悲慘的餘生，還要跟四個陌生人一起困在太空度過，你到底能獲得什麼成就呀？\n\n你是個商人，不是該死的太空人！\n\n更不用說還有<b>戰爭</b>呢！誰能說你的地面指揮小組一年裡會不會覆滅啊？\n\n[嬰兒哭泣聲。]\n\n<i>Andrew，這裡不是托兒所！</i>\n\n我得走了。給我回電話，不然我就直接去找董事會。\n\n[檔案結束]"

