#. STRINGS.CODEX.INVESTIGATIONS.DLC4_EXPEDITION.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.INVESTIGATIONS.DLC4_EXPEDITION.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "Assignments came in this morning: I'm officially leading the Gravitas arm of the Clear Skies Coalition.\n\nI requested Higby and Gossmann for my crew. Gossmann might be a little salty about deprioritizing her swarm craft sensor project again, but she'd never let that get in the way.\n\nThe Director said Gossmann's a no-go. Third crew member is some CSC contest winner who pitched the top LEO debris cleanup solution last year. I must have made a face, because the Director arched an eyebrow and asked if I had something to say.\n\nNo, ma'am. I've babysat worse. Just one more eventuality to plan for.\n\nOur space tourism program depends on traveling through LEO and beyond. Plus that's the warmup for resettlement missions.\n\nNot much hope for either of those right now, given that I'm the only one who can dodge all the debris we've left up there. We need an interstellar highway, not cosmic Frogger.\n\n------------------\n\n"
msgstr "今早收到了任務指派：我正式成為「晴空聯盟」引力科技部門的領導者。\n\n我要求 Higby 和 Gossmann 加入我的團隊。Gossmann 可能會對她的蜂群探測器專案再次被降級而有點不滿，但她絕不會讓這件事妨礙工作。\n\n總監說 Gossmann 不行。第三名隊員是某位「晴空聯盟」競賽的優勝者，他去年提出了最佳的近地軌道碎片清理方案。我一定是做了個鬼臉，因為主管挑了挑眉問我有什麼話想說。\n\n不敢，長官。更麻煩的新人我都帶過，無非就是多備幾套備案罷了。\n\n我們的太空旅行專案需要穿越近地軌道甚至更遠，而這還只是星際移民任務的預演。\n\n但眼下這兩項都希望渺茫，畢竟現在只有我能避開軌道上那些太空垃圾。我們需要一條星際高速公路，而不是玩宇宙版「青蛙過河」。\n\n------------------\n\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.INVESTIGATIONS.DLC4_EXPEDITION.BODY.CONTAINER2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.INVESTIGATIONS.DLC4_EXPEDITION.BODY.CONTAINER2"
msgid "The newbie's not a newbie at all. She's a multi-PhD commercial space comms satellite engineer on her third major career change. Dr. Maya Tayeh, with a string of acronyms after her name that's almost as long as Higby's.\n\nWorks for one of the major players as a consultant. Private-sector-sized ego to match. But her short-wavelength laser net debris vaporizer does sound more efficient than sending up a manual retrieval crew.\n\nShe calls it the LASSO. Higby's already got a space cowboys theme song in the works.\n\nMission control has some words for us about the debris shields. Glad Higby stopped singing before the call came through.\n\n------------------\n\n"
msgstr "這位「新人」可一點都不新。Maya Tayeh 博士擁有多個博士學位，在商業太空通訊衛星工程領域經歷了第三次重大職業轉變的專家。她名字後面的一串頭銜縮寫幾乎和 Higby 的一樣長。\n\n目前她擔任某巨頭企業的顧問，帶著私營企業特有的那種傲氣。不過她研發的短波長雷射網碎片汽化裝置，確實比派人工回收小隊更有效率。\n\n她管這裝置叫「太空套索」。Higby 已經在為它譜寫太空牛仔主題曲了。\n\n指揮中心對碎片護盾的事情有些意見。幸好通訊接入前 Higby 已經沒在唱了。\n\n------------------\n\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.INVESTIGATIONS.DLC4_EXPEDITION.BODY.CONTAINER3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.INVESTIGATIONS.DLC4_EXPEDITION.BODY.CONTAINER3"
msgid "Sent Higby and Tayeh out to investigate reported issues with debris shield sensors. Everything's copacetic. Must be something on the Terra side.\n\nGossmann patched in at the end of the call. In a real <i>mood</i>. She's been assigned a solo mission. Somewhere \"colder than the Director's heart.\" I didn't even know anything <i>could</i> upset her. Even when we were stranded on the space station for almost a year, she was cracking jokes.\n\nWhatever it is, it's gotta be a step down from the CSC initiative. This is the first time all three major spacefaring corporations are collaborating. We're making histor-\n\n-stand by, the orbit control system is glitc-\n\n-what in the world is th-\n\n-oh my g-\n\nHIGBY!\n\n------------------\n"
msgstr "已派 Higby 和 Tayeh 出去調查碎片護盾感測器的回報問題。一切正常，問題應該出在地面站那邊。\n\n通話尾聲時 Gossmann 突然接了進來。情緒<b>極度糟糕</b>。她被派了單人任務，去一個「比總監的心還冷」的地方。我甚至不知道有什麼事能<b>真正</b>讓她心煩意亂。當初我們被困在太空站將近一年時，她還有心情開玩笑呢。\n\n無論是什麼任務，都肯定比不上晴空聯盟的倡議。這是三大主要太空飛行公司首次合作，我們正在創造歷——\n\n——等等，軌道控制系統出現故——\n\n——這到底是什麼鬼——\n\n——喔我的天——\n\nHIGBY！\n\n------------------\n"

