#. STRINGS.CODEX.INVESTIGATIONS.DLC5_PRINTANOMALY.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.INVESTIGATIONS.DLC5_PRINTANOMALY.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "<smallcaps>[Log Fragmentation Detected]\n[Voice Recognition Unavailable]</smallcaps>\n\n[LOG BEGINS]\n\nA216: Commencing exploratory reprint of donor number 890, \"Anemone,\" adult female,  103 centimeters, 30 kilgrams.\n\nTech: Copy that.\n\n(sound of a machine powering up)\n\nA216: Printing subject in three... two...\n\n(sound of a machine whining to a halt)\n\nA216: Ugh, can you <i>please</i> clean out the secondary tank? There are still traces from yesterday's reprint.\n\nTech: Sorry, Doctor. I thought I got it all.\n\n(sound of a machine powering up)\n\n(sound of electricity crackling)\n\nA216: Printing subject in three... two... one... Stand back, please.\n\nTech: Reprint complete. Subject number is 2988, \"Anemone-93.\" Adult female, 103 centimeters, 30 kilograms. Subject is conscious and appears fully formed. No observable physical abnormalities noted.\n\nA216: Initiate vitals scan.\n\nTech: Scan complete. Pupil size, skin temperature, limb formation and distribution are all typical, except... huh. The respiration rate... it's... there doesn't really seem to be one.\n\nA216: I swear, this equipment gets less and less reliable by the day. Recalibrate the printing pod and run it again.\n\nTech: But that will take the rest of the night, Doctor.\n\nA216: The sooner you start, the sooner it will be done. Bring me the updated results when they're ready.\n\n[LOG ENDS]\n\n----------------------\n\n[LOG BEGINS]\n\nTech: Doctor Saruhashi? Oh! I'm sorry to interrupt, Doctor Broussard.\n\nOlivia: It's quite all right. I invited myself when I saw last night's anomaly on my feed. \n\nA216: It may be nothing, again. We've had a few inconsistencies since the earthquakes started.\n\nTech: Um... actually...\n\nA216: Well?\n\nTech: I... well, look.\n\nOlivia: My god. It's true.\n\nA216: Hmm. Flood the tank.\n\nTech: Yes, Doctor.\n\nOlivia: What? No! She'll drown!\n\nA216: With all due respect, Dr. Broussard, further testing is crucial. This isn't just another vestigial ear. If this anomaly can be confirmed and replicated-Olivia: -We've just given humanity a whole new category of possible colony sites. I am aware.\n\nA216: Correct. For what it's worth, I am reasonably confident that Anemone-93's oxygen consumption is so low as to make fatality extremely unlikely. But I understand if you would prefer to step out of the room for a moment.\n\nOlivia: No, I-I'll stay.\n\nTech: Tank filling in three...two...\n\n(sound of rushing water)\n\nTech: Tank maximum volume has been reached.\n\nA216: Subject appears unaffected by the change in environment.\n\nOlivia: Incredible.\n\nA216: Indeed.\n\nA216: Maintain liquid levels and monitor subject's response. I want to know exactly how long vitals remain steady.\n\nTech: Yes, Doctor.\n\n[LOG ENDS]\n\n"
msgstr "<smallcaps>[偵測到日誌片段]\n[語音辨識系統無法使用]</smallcaps>\n\n[錄音開始]\n\nA216：開始對捐贈者編號 890 進行探索性重印，受試者「Anemone」，成年雌性，103 公分，30 公斤。\n\n技術員：收到。\n\n（機器啟動聲）\n\nA216：準備列印受試者……三……二……\n\n（機器哀鳴著停機的聲音）\n\nA216：唉，你<i>能不能</i>把二號槽清理乾淨？昨天重印的殘留物還在裡面。\n\n技術員：抱歉，醫師。我以為我清乾淨了。\n\n（機器啟動聲）\n\n（電流劈啪聲）\n\nA216：準備列印受試者……三……二……一……請退後。\n\n技術員：重印完成。物件編號 2988，「Anemone-93」。成年雌性，103 公分，30 公斤。受試者有意識，體態外觀完整。未觀察到明顯生理異常。\n\nA216：啟動生命體徵掃描。\n\n技術員：掃描完畢。瞳孔尺寸、皮膚溫度、肢體結構及分佈均屬正常，除了……呃。呼吸頻率……那個……似乎根本沒有呼吸。\n\nA216：我發誓，這設備真是一天不如一天。重新校準列印艙，再跑一次。\n\n技術員：但那要花掉整整一晚，醫師。\n\nA216：你越早開始就越早結束。結果更新後拿給我。\n\n[錄音結束]\n\n----------------------\n\n[錄音開始]\n\n技術員：Saruhashi 醫師？噢！抱歉打擾了，Broussard 博士。\n\nOlivia：沒關係。我在系統通知裡看到昨晚的異常資料，自己不請自來的。\n\nA216：可能又是虛驚一場。地震開始以後我們這兒出過幾次不一致的情況了。\n\n技術員：呃……其實……\n\nA216：怎麼？\n\n技術員：我……嗯，您看。\n\nOlivia：天哪。是真的。\n\nA216：嗯。把槽裡注滿水。\n\n技術員：是，醫師。\n\nOlivia：什麼？不行！她會淹死的！\n\nA216：恕我直言，Broussard 博士，進一步測試至關重要。這次可不是又一個退化耳那麼簡單。如果這個異常現象能被確認並復現——\n\nOlivia：——我們剛剛為人類開闢了全新類別的可能殖民地選址。我知道。\n\nA216：正是。不過值得一提的是，我有相當把握認為 Anemone-93 的耗氧量極低，致死可能性微乎其微。但如果您想暫時離開房間，我可以理解。\n\nOlivia：不，我——我留下。\n\n技術員：準備開始注水……三……二……\n\n（水流奔湧聲）\n\n技術員：水槽已達最大容量。\n\nA216：受試者似乎未因環境改變而受到影響。\n\nOlivia：不可思議。\n\nA216：確實。\n\nA216：維持當前液位，持續監測受試者反應。我需要確切知道生命體徵能保持穩定多久。\n\n技術員：是，醫師。\n\n[錄音結束]"

