#. STRINGS.CODEX.JUMPINGJOYA.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.JUMPINGJOYA.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "The Jumping Joya is a decorative plant that brings a feeling of calmness and wellbeing to individuals in its vicinity.\n\nTheir rounded appendages and eccentrically shaped polyps are a favorite of interior designers looking to offset the rigid straight walls of an institutional setting.\n\nThe Jumping Joya's capacity to thrive in many environments and the ease in which they propagate make them the go-to house plant for the lazy gardener."
msgstr "雀躍掌是一種裝飾植物，能為身處其附近的人帶來平靜與幸福的感覺。\n\n它們圓潤的附肢和奇形怪狀的叢生體是室內設計師的最愛，旨在緩和機構環境中僵硬筆直的牆壁。\n\n雀躍掌適應多種環境的能力，加上其易於繁殖的特性，使其成為懶人園丁的首選盆栽植物。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.JUMPINGJOYA.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.JUMPINGJOYA.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Decorative Plant"
msgstr "裝飾植物"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.JUMPINGJOYA.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.JUMPINGJOYA.TITLE"
msgid "Jumping Joya"
msgstr "雀躍掌"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.KEEPSAKE.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.KEEPSAKE.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "In the aftermath of a successful mission--be it the completion of a story trait or the survival of some epic event--my Duplicants sometimes form sentimental attachments to an item associated with that chapter of their lives.\n\n"
msgstr "在一次成功任務（無論是完成故事特性還是熬過某個史詩級事件）的餘波中，我的複製人有時會對與他們生命中該篇章相關的物品產生情感依戀。\n\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.KEEPSAKE.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.KEEPSAKE.TITLE"
msgid "Keepsakes"
msgstr "珍藏品"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.KELP.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.KELP.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "The leaf of a <link=\"KELPPLANT\">Seakomb</link>.\n\nIt can be processed into <link=\"PHYTOOIL\">Phyto Oil</link> or used as an ingredient in <link=\"ANTIHISTAMINE \">Allergy Medication</link>."
msgstr "<link=\"KELPPLANT\">海梳蕨</link>的葉片。\n\n可加工成<link=\"PHYTOOIL\">植物油</link>，或用作<link=\"ANTIHISTAMINE\">抗過敏藥</link>的成分。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.KELP.SUBTITLE
