#. STRINGS.CODEX.PARROTFISH.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.PARROTFISH.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "Beakons are highly sought-after by ichthyophiles due to their radiant bioluminescence and unusual habit of surfacing for <link=\"OXYGEN\">Oxygen</link>.\n\nThese brilliant critters enjoy the tickle of air in their gills, and are happiest cohabiting with bubbly <link=\"OXYCORAL\">Flue Coral</link> that provide abundant air pockets for their entertainment.\n\nSome <link=\"PARROTFISHSPECIES\">Beakons</link> have even been known to nap atop their preferred coral formation. Such sightings are extremely rare."
msgstr "燈喙魚因其耀眼的生物發光，以及會浮出水面吸取<link=\"OXYGEN\">氧</link>的奇特習性，深受魚類愛好者追捧。\n\n這些光彩奪目的小動物喜歡空氣在鰓中發癢的感覺，且最喜歡與能提供豐富氣泡供其玩耍的<link=\"OXYCORAL\">煙囪珊瑚</link>同居。\n\n據說有些<link=\"PARROTFISHSPECIES\">燈喙魚</link>甚至會在牠們鍾愛的珊瑚礁頂端小憩。這種景象極為罕見"

