#. STRINGS.CODEX.PLANKTONCORAL.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.PLANKTONCORAL.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "Starnacles share DNA with both arthropods and echinoderms, though they retain elements of the latter's fascinating digestive mechanism.\n\nDuring feeding, a Starnacle's stomach is pushed out through its small mouthpiece to envelop the nutrient source. Digestion is completed outside the body, and the stomach then retracts.\n\nThe process can be disturbing to witness. Fortunately, the organism's mouthpiece is located on its underside."
msgstr "藤壺星與節肢動物及棘皮動物擁有共同的 DNA，並保留了後者那令人著迷的消化機制特徵。\n\n在進食時，藤壺星會將胃部透過細小的口部向外推展，以包裹住營養來源。消化作用在體外完成後，胃部便會縮回體內。\n\n這個過程目擊起來可能會讓人感到不安。幸運的是，這種生物的口器位於身體底部。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.PLANKTONCORAL.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.PLANKTONCORAL.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Aquatic Organism"
msgstr "水生生物"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.PLANKTONCORAL.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.PLANKTONCORAL.TITLE"
msgid "Starnacle"
msgstr "藤壺星"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.PLUGSLUG.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.PLUGSLUG.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "Plug Slugs are fuzzy gastropoda that are able to cling to walls and ceilings thanks to an extreme triboelectric effect caused by friction between their fur and various surfaces.\n\nThis same phenomenon allows the Plug Slug to generate a significant amount of static electricity that can be converted into power.\n\nThe increased amount of static electricity a Plug Slug can generate when domesticated is due to the internal vibration, or contented 'humming', they demonstrate when all their needs are met."
msgstr "電氣蛞蝓是毛茸茸的腹足綱動物，由於毛髮與各種表面摩擦產生的極端摩擦起電效應，使牠們能吸附在牆壁與天花板上。\n\n同樣的現象讓電氣蛞蝓能產生大量的靜電並轉化為電力。\n\n被馴化的電氣蛞蝓能產生更多靜電，是因為牠們在需求得到滿足時，會發出內部的震動或滿足的「嗡嗡聲」。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.PLUGSLUG.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.PLUGSLUG.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Domesticable Critter"
msgstr "可馴養的小動物"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.PLUGSLUG.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.PLUGSLUG.TITLE"
msgid "Plug Slug"
msgstr "電氣蛞蝓"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.POKESHELL.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.POKESHELL.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "Pokeshells are bottom-feeding invertebrates that consume the waste and discarded food left behind by other creatures."
msgstr "拋殼蟹是底棲的無脊椎動物，會吃其它生物的廢棄物與報廢的食物。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.POKESHELL.BODY.CONTAINER2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.POKESHELL.BODY.CONTAINER2"
msgid "They have formidably sized claws that fold safely into their shells for protection when not in use."
msgstr "牠們擁有大尺寸的爪隻，在不使用時會安全的縮進蟹殼內保護起來。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.POKESHELL.BODY.CONTAINER3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.POKESHELL.BODY.CONTAINER3"
msgid "As Pokeshells mature they must periodically shed portions of their exoskeletons to make room for new growth."
msgstr "拋殼蟹成年時會定期的脫下外殼，以獲得更多成長空間。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.POKESHELL.BODY.CONTAINER4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.POKESHELL.BODY.CONTAINER4"
msgid "Although the most dramatic sheds occur early in a Pokeshell's adolescence, they will continue growing and shedding throughout their adult lives, until the day they eventually die."
msgstr "雖然幼生期的變化最戲劇性，但在成年期會持續的脫殼，直到最終死亡的那天。"

