#. STRINGS.CODEX.PREHISTORICPACU.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.PREHISTORICPACU.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "While the Jawbo may be terrifying to behold, in truth it is quite harmless for trained handlers.\n\nA disproportionately sized mandible makes it impossible for this critter to properly chew its food, necessitating a preference for prey that are small enough to be swallowed whole.\n\nThough much of its DNA suggests that the Jawbo evolved in isolation, it does share a small number of genetic markers with serrasalmids such as the <link=\"PACU\">Pacu</link>. Familial connection, however, does not preclude consideration as a food source."
msgstr "顎魚或許看起來令人生畏，但對於受過訓練的馴養師而言，牠其實相當無害。\n\n其不成比例大的下顎使其無法正確咀嚼食物，因此偏好能夠被完整吞嚥的小型獵物。\n\n儘管基因分析顯示牠是在隔離狀態下演化而來，但仍與<link=\"PACU\">帕庫魚</link>等鋸脂鯉科魚類存在部分相似基因。然而，血緣關係並不妨礙將其視為食物來源。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.PREHISTORICPACU.SPECIES_SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.PREHISTORICPACU.SPECIES_SUBTITLE"
