#. STRINGS.CODEX.PRIORITY.HEADER_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.PRIORITY.HEADER_4"
msgid "Tutorial: Errand Priorities"
msgstr "教學：任務優先級"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.PRIORITY.PARAGRAPH_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.PRIORITY.PARAGRAPH_1"
msgid "Duplicants prioritize their errands based on several factors. Some of these can be adjusted to affect errand choice, but some errands (such as seeking breathable <link=\"OXYGEN\">Oxygen</link>) are so important that they cannot be delayed. Errand priority can primarily be controlled by Errand Type prioritization, and then can be further fine-tuned by the <b>Priority Tool</b> {Hotkey/Prioritize}.\n\n"
msgstr "複製人的任務優先度基於幾項因素。\n\n一些可調整的任務會影響執行順序，而另一些任務（像是尋找可呼吸的<link=\"OXYGEN\">氧氣</link>）是很重要的就不能延後。\n\n任務優先度主要由任務類型的優先度所控制，而它們可以在<b>優先度工具</b> {Hotkey/Prioritize} 中調整。\n\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.PRIORITY.PARAGRAPH_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.PRIORITY.PARAGRAPH_2"
msgid "Each errand a Duplicant can perform falls into an Errand Category. These categories can be prioritized on a per-Duplicant basis in the <b>Priorities Screen</b>. Entire errand categories can also be prohibited to a Duplicant if they are meant to never perform errands of that variety. A common configuration is to assign errand type priority based on Duplicant attributes.\n\nFor example, Duplicants who are good at Research could be made to prioritize the Researching errand type. Duplicants with poor Athletics could be made to deprioritize the Supplying and Storing errand types.\n\n"
msgstr "複製人執行的每項任務都歸屬於一個任務類型。在<b>優先度畫面</b>可以排定每位複製人任務類型的優先順序。\n\n如果某類任務不希望由特定複製人執行，也可以完全禁止該複製人執行該類型的所有任務。常見的設定方式是根據複製人的屬性來分配任務類型的優先順序。\n\n舉例來說，擅長研究的複製人可以設定為優先執行研究類任務。體能差的複製人則可以降低供應和儲存類任務的優先順序。\n\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.PRIORITY.PARAGRAPH_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.PRIORITY.PARAGRAPH_3"
msgid "The priority of errands can often be modified using the <b>Priority tool</b> {Hotkey/Prioritize}. The values applied by this tool are always less influential than the Errand Type priorities described above. If two errands with equal Errand Type Priority are available to a Duplicant, they will choose the errand with a higher priority setting as applied by the tool.\n\n"
msgstr "使用<b>優先度</b> {Hotkey/Prioritize} 來經常調整任務的優先順序。此工具所設定的值會永遠低於任務類的優先度。\n\n如果複製人有兩件任務，而它們的任務類型優先度相同，他們會依此工具所設定的優先順序執行。\n\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.PRIORITY.PARAGRAPH_4
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.PRIORITY.PARAGRAPH_4"
msgid "To learn more, see <link=\"MISCELLANEOUSTIPS6\">Tutorial: Errand Priorities</link>."
msgstr "若要了解更多，請參閱 <link=\"MISCELLANEOUSTIPS6\">教學：任務優先級</link>。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.PRIORITY.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.PRIORITY.TITLE"
msgid "<link=\"PRIORITY\">Priorities</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"PRIORITY\">優先度</link>"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.PUFFERFISH.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.PUFFERFISH.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "Blowters are docile fish with a poorly developed gastrointestinal tract.\n\nThis species eats only <link=\"SEALETTUCE\">Waterweed</link> but lacks the digestive enzymes required to process the plant efficiently. Large amounts of excess <link=\"OXYGEN\">Oxygen</link> build up in the critter's gut during digestion, resulting in chronic and extreme bloating.\n\nMarine explorers have learned to siphon <link=\"OXYGEN\">Oxygen</link> from Blowters in an emergency. It's not clear who was the first to attempt this."
msgstr "鼓氣魚是一種溫順的魚類，但其胃腸道發育不良。\n\n該物種僅以<link=\"SEALETTUCE\">水草</link>為食，卻缺乏能有效處理該植物的消化酶。在其消化過程中，腸道內會堆積大量多餘的<link=\"OXYGEN\">氧氣</link>，導致其長期處於極度膨脹的狀態。\n\n海洋探險家們已學會了在緊急情況下從鼓氣魚體內抽取<link=\"OXYGEN\">氧氣</link>的方法。至於最初是誰嘗試了這種做法，目前尚不可知。"

