msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.SQUID.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Aquatic Critter"
msgstr "水生小動物"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.SQUID.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.SQUID.TITLE"
msgid "Glo Squid"
msgstr "彩斑魷"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STANDARD.HEADER_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STANDARD.HEADER_1"
msgid "Basic Needs"
msgstr "基本需求"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STANDARD.HEADER_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STANDARD.HEADER_2"
msgid "Worker Optimization"
msgstr "工作最佳化"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STANDARD.PARAGRAPH_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STANDARD.PARAGRAPH_1"
msgid "<link=\"REQUIREMENTCLASSTOILETTYPE\">Toilets</link>: Duplicants will empty their bladders every {time}. A lack of accessible facilities will result in <link=\"STRESS\">Stress</link> and wet colony floors.\n\n<link=\"BUILDCATEGORYOXYGEN\">Oxygen</link>: Duplicants inhale <link=\"OXYGEN\">Oxygen</link> at a rate of {O2gperSec} and exhale <link=\"CARBONDIOXIDE\">Carbon Dioxide</link> at a rate of {CO2gperSec}. They can hold their breath for short periods. Long-term lack of breathable gases will result in suffocation.\n\n<link=\"FOOD\">Food</link>: Daily caloric intake is {caloriesrequired}. <link=\"BUILDCATEGORYFOOD\">Food</link> can be produced via <link=\"GROUPFARMBUILDING\">Farming</link> and <link=\"REQUIREMENTCLASSRANCHSTATIONTYPE\">Ranching</link> buildings, and further enhanced at <link=\"REQUIREMENTCLASSCOOKTOP\">Cooking Stations</link>.\n\n<link=\"HEALTH\">Sleep</link>: Duplicants require a <link=\"REQUIREMENTCLASSBEDTYPE\">Bed</link> and a <link=\"MISCELLANEOUSTIPS14\">Schedule</link> that includes adequate Bedtime in order to avoid the <link=\"STRESS\">Stress</link> and Stamina-depleting effects of overwork.\n\n"
msgstr "<link=\"REQUIREMENTCLASSTOILETTYPE\">廁所</link>：複製人每 {time}會想噓噓。缺乏可用的設施會導致<link=\"STRESS\">壓力</link>和潮溼的殖民地地板。\n\n<link=\"BUILDCATEGORYOXYGEN\">氧氣</link>：複製人以 {O2gperSec}的速度吸入<link=\"OXYGEN\">氧氣</link>並呼出 {CO2gperSec}的<link=\"CARBONDIOXIDE\">二氧化碳</link>。他們可以短暫憋氣。長期缺乏可呼吸的氣體會導致窒息。\n\n<link=\"FOOD\">食物</link>：每日卡路里攝取量為 {caloriesrequired}。<link=\"BUILDCATEGORYFOOD\">食物</link>可以透過<link=\"REQUIREMENTCLASSFARMBUILDING\">耕種</link>和<link=\"REQUIREMENTCLASSRANCHSTATIONTYPE\">畜牧</link>建築生產，並在<link=\"REQUIREMENTCLASSCOOKTOP\">烹飪站</link>進一步強化。\n\n<link=\"HEALTH\">睡眠</link>：複製人需要一張<link=\"REQUIREMENTCLASSBEDTYPE\">床</link>和一份包含足夠睡眠時間的<link=\"MISCELLANEOUSTIPS14\">排程</link>，以避免過度勞累導致的<link=\"STRESS\">壓力</link>和體力耗盡。\n\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STANDARD.PARAGRAPH_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STANDARD.PARAGRAPH_2"
msgid "<link=\"ROLES\">Skills</link>: Performing colony duties helps Duplicants earn Skill Points that can be exchanged for useful Skills. Duplicants' individual traits may predispose them to prefer some careers over others, or bar them from a particular career path entirely.\n\n<link=\"MORALE\">Morale</link>: Morale in excess of a Duplicant's expectations will trigger Overjoyed responses that positively affect a variety of colony functions. <link=\"REQUIREMENTCLASSRECBUILDING\">Recreational</link> building usage, <link=\"REQUIREMENTCLASSDECORATION\">attractive buildings </link> that increase <link=\"DECOR\">Decor</link>, and improved <link=\"FOOD\">Foods</link> contribute to higher morale.\n\n<link=\"STRESS\">Stress</link>: When Stress levels reach 100%, Duplicants will exhibit negative Stress responses that can disrupt work and damage buildings.\n\n<link=\"TECH\">Research</link>: Using <link=\"REQUIREMENTCLASSSCIENCEBUILDING\">science buildings</link> unlocks advanced technologies that increase work efficiency and improve the colony's standard of living.\n\n<link=\"HEALTH\">Health</link>: Workplace hazards, including exposure to extreme <link=\"HEAT\">Heat</link> or <link=\"DISEASE\">Germs</link>, can severely impact Duplicants' health. Specialized <link=\"REQUIREMENTCLASSCLINIC\">Medical</link> buildings accelerate recovery.\n\n<i>More information about sustaining Duplicants' well-being is covered in <link=\"MISCELLANEOUSTIPS\">Tips</link> and <link=\"LESSONS\">Tutorials</link>.</i>\n\n"
msgstr "<link=\"ROLES\">技能</link>：執行殖民地職責可幫助複製人獲得技能點，這些技能點可以兌換有用的技能。複製人的個人特質可能會使他們偏好某些職業而非其他職業，或者完全阻止他們從事特定的職涯道路。\n\n<link=\"MORALE\">士氣</link>：超過複製人期望的士氣會觸發樂歪反應，從而對各種殖民地功能產生正面影響。使用<link=\"REQUIREMENTCLASSRECBUILDING\">娛樂</link>建築、增加<link=\"DECOR\">裝飾</link>的<link=\"REQUIREMENTCLASSDECORATION\">美觀建築</link>，以及改良的<link=\"FOOD\">食物</link>都有助於提高士氣。\n\n<link=\"STRESS\">壓力</link>：當壓力達到 100% 時，複製人會表現出負面的壓力反應，這些反應可能會擾亂工作並損壞建築物。\n\n<link=\"TECH\">研究</link>：使用<link=\"REQUIREMENTCLASSSCIENCEBUILDING\">科學建築</link>可以解鎖先進技術，從而提高工作效率並改善殖民地的生活水準。\n\n<link=\"HEALTH\">健康</link>：工作場所的危害，包括暴露於極端<link=\"HEAT\">高溫</link>或<link=\"DISEASE\">病菌</link>，可能會嚴重影響複製人的健康。專業的<link=\"BUILDCATEGORYMEDICAL\">醫療</link>建築可以加速恢復。\n\n<i>有關維持複製人福祉的更多資訊，請參閱<link=\"MISCELLANEOUSTIPS\">提示</link>和<link=\"LESSONS\">教學課程</link>。</i>\n\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STANDARD.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STANDARD.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Colony Worker"
msgstr "殖民地工人"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STANDARD.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STANDARD.TITLE"
msgid "Standard Duplicant"
msgstr "標準複製人"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STEGO.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STEGO.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "While other creatures with the Lumb's low forebrain neuron count rapidly become extinct, these docile creatures are uniquely positioned for survival.\n\nTheir large size and spiny protrusions make them unappealing to most predators. Anecdotal evidence also suggests that smaller species will sometimes adopt orphaned Lumbs.\n\nSome experts theorize that this may be motivated by a desire to benefit from the Lumb's genetic muscular condition (akin to restless leg syndrome), which causes them to regularly pound the earth in such a way as to cause nearby plants to drop desirable foods."
msgstr "儘管其他前腦神經元數量稀少的生物會迅速滅絕，但豐足劍龍這種溫馴的生物卻具有獨特的生存優勢。\n\n牠們龐大的體型和帶刺的突起，使其對大多數掠食者而言毫無吸引力。軼事證據也表明，較小的物種有時會收養孤兒豐足劍龍。\n\n一些專家推測，這可能是為了從豐足劍龍的遺傳性肌肉病症（類似不寧腿症候群）中獲益，這種病症導致牠們規律地敲擊地面，從而使附近的植物掉落可口的食物。"

