#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.BEGIN_POPUP.CODEX_NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.BEGIN_POPUP.CODEX_NAME"
msgid "First Encounter"
msgstr "初遇"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.BEGIN_POPUP.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.BEGIN_POPUP.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "My Duplicants have uncovered a fascinating machine. Its construction suggests that it was designed as an energy field disruptor, and retrofitted with printing capabilities.\n\nIt is locked behind a 13-digit passcode. One failed attempt could permanently disable the entire building.\n\nI can only hope that the code is also buried somewhere on this world."
msgstr "我的複製人發現了一台引人入勝的機器。構造表明，它最初被設計為能量場干擾器，隨後被改裝為具備印製能力。\n\n它被一組13位數的密碼鎖定。一次嘗試失敗就可能永久禁用整個建築物。\n\n我只能希望這個密碼也埋藏在這個世界的某處。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.BEGIN_POPUP.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.BEGIN_POPUP.NAME"
msgid "Story Trait: Printerceptor"
msgstr "故事特質：列印截能儀"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "Reboot an unsanctioned biogenetic facility.\n\nOnce activated, Duplicants can use it to siphon energy from the Printing Pod to power on-demand printing of...something.\n\nIt smells a bit like an old ranch."
msgstr "重新啟動一座未經授權的生物基因設施。\n\n一旦啟動，複製人即可使用它，從列印元汲取能量，為按需印製……某個東西提供動力。\n\n它聞起來有點像一座舊牧場。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.DESCRIPTION_SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.DESCRIPTION_SHORT"
msgid "Reboot an unsanctioned biogenetic facility that siphons energy from the Printing Pod."
msgstr "重新啟動一座未經授權的生物基因設施，該設施正在從列印元虹吸能量。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.END_POPUP.BUTTON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.END_POPUP.BUTTON"
msgid "Power On"
msgstr "啟動"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.END_POPUP.CODEX_NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.END_POPUP.CODEX_NAME"
msgid "Challenge Completed"
msgstr "挑戰完成"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.END_POPUP.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.END_POPUP.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "Success! This building has printed its first viable organism. It contains zero detectable genetic defects.\n\nWe can now confidently reroute the Printing Pod's power to print the critters and seeds best suited for my colony's purposes. No species need ever be extinct again.\n\nA small personal item shook loose from the frame during use. Perhaps it belonged to the previous operator."
msgstr "成功！這座建築已印製出第一個可存活的有機體。它不含任何可偵測到的基因缺陷。\n\n我們現在可以自信地重新導向列印元的電力，印製最適合我殖民地目的的生物與種子。沒有任何物種需要再次滅絕了。\n\n使用期間，一個小的個人物品從框架上震落下來。或許它屬於前一個操作員。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.END_POPUP.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.END_POPUP.NAME"
msgid "Story Trait Complete: Printerceptor"
msgstr "故事特質完成：列印截能儀"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.HANDOFF.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.HIJACK_HEADQUARTERS.HANDOFF.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "<smallcaps>[Log Fragmentation Detected]\n[Voice Recognition Unavailable]</smallcaps>\n\n[LOG BEGINS]\n\n(sound of running water)\n\nTech: Dr. Reed?\n\n(sound of a door opening)\n\nRuby: You came! I thought something happened.\n\nTech: Sorry I'm late. Real snafu in the cafeteria this morning. The new hazmat labels peel right off if they come into contact with mayonnaise.\n\nRuby: Why are there hazmat labels in the caf-\n\nTech: Did you bring the access codes for Techna's siphon?\n\nRuby: They're on this drive.\n\nRuby: Look, I need to know exactly who you're working with before I hand this over.\n\nTech: We're the good guys, Dr. Reed.\n\nRuby: That's who I thought we were. Try again.\n\nTech: I work with the people who made your Director who she is. In a way, we're sort of...family.\n\nRuby: The Director has no family.\n\nTech: Maybe not in this lifetime. The drive, please.\n\nRuby: What about Nikola? Do your people know where he is?\n\nTech: We're on it. You'll be the first to know.\n\n(sound of a firm knock on the door)\n\nVoice: Hello? Who's in there?\n\nRuby: (whispering) Those security guys must have followed you!\n\n(sound of banging on the door)\n\nVoice: Open up!\n\nRuby: If they get a hold of the data on that server...\n\nTech: Wait, what are you-\n\n(sound of a toilet flushing)\n\nTech: What have you done!?\n\nRuby: I'm sorry. It's gone. If they got their hands on it...I would never forgive myself.\n\n(sound of the door creaking open)\n\nRuby: Catalina! I thought you were-\n\nCatalina: Finally! What are you... you know what, I don't even care. Whatever you two are doing, can you do it in the hallway? I gotta go <i>bad.</i>\n\nRuby: Of course. Sorry.\n\nTech: Actually, we-\n\nCatalina: Dude. Don't make it weird. Get outta the way.\n\n(sound of a door slamming)\n\nRuby: What are you doing?\n\nTech: Pulling up the blueprints of the facility's plumbing system. You didn't think you could just flush unpatented trillion-dollar technology down the toilet, did you?\n\nRuby: Wait, you can't mean...you don't mean to <i>SELL</i> this technology! You don't understand the consequ-\n\nTech: We understand perfectly. You've been a great help, Dr. Reed. I trust you know better than to mention this to anyone.\n\n<smallcaps>[LOG ENDS]\n------------------\n"
msgstr "<smallcaps>[偵測到日誌片段]\n[語音辨識系統無法使用]</smallcaps>\n\n[日誌開始]\n\n(流水聲)\n\nTech: Reed 博士？\n\n(開門聲)\n\nRuby: 你來了！我還以為出了什麼事。\n\nTech: 抱歉，我遲到了。早上自助餐廳出了一點小亂子。新的危險品標籤只要接觸到美乃滋就會脫落。\n\nRuby: 自助餐廳怎麼會有危險品標籤——\n\nTech: 你帶來 Techna 虹吸裝置的存取碼了嗎？\n\nRuby: 它們在這磁碟上。\n\nRuby: 聽著，在我交出這些之前，我需要確切知道你在為誰工作。\n\nTech: 我們是好人，Reed 博士。\n\nRuby: 我以為我們就是好人。再說一次。\n\nTech: 我在為那些成就了你們總監的人工作。在某種程度上，我們算是...一家人。\n\nRuby: 總監沒有家人。\n\nTech: 或許不是在這個生命週期。請把磁碟給我。\n\nRuby: 那 Nikola 呢？你的人知道他在哪裡嗎？\n\nTech: 我們正在處理。妳會是第一個知道的人。\n\n(有人用力敲門的聲音)\n\n聲音：你好？誰在裡面？\n\nRuby: （耳語）那些保安肯定跟著你來了！\n\n(敲門的撞擊聲)\n\n聲音：開門！\n\nRuby: 如果他們拿到伺服器上的資料...\n\nTech: 等等，你要做什麼——\n\n(沖馬桶的聲音)\n\nTech: 你做了什麼！？\n\nRuby: 對不起。它已經沒了。如果讓他們拿到手...我永遠無法原諒自己。\n\n(門吱呀一聲打開的聲音)\n\nRuby: Catalina！我以為你——\n\nCatalina: 終於！你們在搞什麼... 算了，我根本不在乎。無論你們兩個在做什麼，能不能去走廊上做？我<b>急</b>著要用。\n\nRuby: 當然。對不起。\n\nTech: 事實上，我們——\n\nCatalina: 老兄。別搞得這麼怪。讓開啦。\n\n(關門的巨響)\n\nRuby: 你在做什麼？\n\nTech: 正在調出設施的管道系統藍圖。你該不會以為把未經專利、價值數萬億的技術沖進馬桶就沒事了吧？\n\nRuby: 等等，你的意思是... 你該不會想<b>出售</b>這項技術吧！你不明白後果——\n\nTech: 我們完全明白。你幫了大忙了，Reed 博士。我相信你知道最好不要向任何人提起這件事。\n\n<smallcaps>[日誌結束]</smallcaps>\n------------------\n"

