msgid "My Duplicants have recovered the access code to unlock the Printerceptor!\n\nThe data storage medium was damaged during retrieval, but it has already served its purpose: the Printerceptor's targeted printing technology is now at my colony's fingertips."
msgstr "我的複製人已經回收了存取密碼，得以解鎖列印截能儀！\n\n該資料儲存媒介在回收過程中損毀，但它已經達到其目的：列印截能儀的目標印製技術現已在我的殖民地的掌握之中。"

