#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "Discover a reclusive character living in a Gravitas relic, and persuade them to join this colony.\n\nRevelations from their past could have far-reaching implications for Duplicants everywhere.\n\nEven their makeshift shelter might be of some use..."
msgstr "找到一個在引力科技遺跡中隱居的複製人，並說服他加入殖民地。\n\n他過去的祕聞可能會對我的複製人產生深遠的影響。\n\n甚至他的臨時庇護所也可能有一些用處…"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.DESCRIPTION_BUILDINGMENU
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.DESCRIPTION_BUILDINGMENU"
msgid "The process of recruiting this building's lone occupant involves the completion of key tasks."
msgstr "需要完成一系列關鍵任務才能招募這個建築中的孤獨居住者。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.DESCRIPTION_SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.DESCRIPTION_SHORT"
msgid "Discover a reclusive character living in a Gravitas relic, and persuade them to join this colony."
msgstr "找到一個在引力科技遺跡中隱居的複製人，並說服他加入殖民地。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.END_POPUP.BUTTON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.END_POPUP.BUTTON"
msgid "Welcome New Duplicant!"
msgstr "歡迎新複製人！"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.END_POPUP.CODEX_NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.END_POPUP.CODEX_NAME"
msgid "Challenge Completed"
msgstr "挑戰完成"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.END_POPUP.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.END_POPUP.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "My sweet Duplicants' efforts paid off! Our reclusive neighbor has agreed to join the colony.\n\nThe only keepsake he insists on bringing with him is a toolbox which, while rusty, seems to hold great sentimental value.\n\nNow that he'll be living among us, his former home can be deconstructed or repurposed as storage."
msgstr "我親愛的複製人們的努力終於有了成果！我們那位隱居的鄰居同意加入我們的殖民地了。\n\n他堅持要帶一個工具箱作為紀念品，雖然這個工具箱已經鏽跡斑斑，但對他來說似乎有著很深的感情。\n\n既然他已經決定要和我們住在一起了，那麼他之前的房子就可以拆解或改建為儲藏室。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.END_POPUP.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.END_POPUP.NAME"
msgid "Story Trait Complete: Mysterious Hermit"
msgstr "故事特質完成：神祕隱士"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.GIFTRESPONSE_POPUP.CRAPPYFOOD.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.GIFTRESPONSE_POPUP.CRAPPYFOOD.NAME"
msgid "The hermit hated this food"
msgstr "隱士討厭這種食物"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.GIFTRESPONSE_POPUP.CRAPPYFOOD.TOOLTIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.GIFTRESPONSE_POPUP.CRAPPYFOOD.TOOLTIP"
msgid "The hermit would rather be launched straight into the sun than eat this slop.\n\nThe mailbox is ready for another delivery"
msgstr "隱士寧願直接被發送到太陽上也不願吃這種剩菜剩飯。\n\n郵箱已經準備好下一次運送了"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.GIFTRESPONSE_POPUP.REPEATEDFOOD.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.GIFTRESPONSE_POPUP.REPEATEDFOOD.NAME"
msgid "The hermit is unimpressed"
msgstr "隱士不為所動"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.GIFTRESPONSE_POPUP.REPEATEDFOOD.TOOLTIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.GIFTRESPONSE_POPUP.REPEATEDFOOD.TOOLTIP"
msgid "This meal has been offered before.\n\nThe mailbox is ready for another delivery"
msgstr "這種食物之前已經送過一次了。\n\n郵箱已經準備好下一次運送了"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.GIFTRESPONSE_POPUP.TASTYFOOD.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.GIFTRESPONSE_POPUP.TASTYFOOD.NAME"
msgid "The hermit loved this food"
msgstr "隱士喜歡這種食物"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.GIFTRESPONSE_POPUP.TASTYFOOD.TOOLTIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.GIFTRESPONSE_POPUP.TASTYFOOD.TOOLTIP"
msgid "Tastier than the still-warm pretzel that once fell off an unsupervised desk.\n\nThe mailbox is ready for another delivery"
msgstr "甚至比從無人管理的桌子上掉下來的，仍然溫熱的椒鹽捲餅還要好吃。\n\n郵箱已經準備好下一次運送了"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.HOLIDAYCARD.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.HOLIDAYCARD.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "Hey kiddo,\n\nWe missed you at your cousin's wedding last weekend. The gift was nice, but the dance floor felt empty without you.\n\nDariush sends his love. He's really turned a corner since he started eating those gooey pudding things you sent over. Any chance you have a version that doesn't smell like feet?\n\nCome home sometime when you're not so busy.\n\n- Baba\n------------------\n"
msgstr "嘿小伙子，\n\n在上周末你沒來參加你表兄的婚禮，我們真是太想念你了。禮物都很好，但舞池裡沒有你總感覺空蕩蕩的。\n\nDariush 也送出了他的祝福。自從他開始吃你送他的那些黏呼呼的布丁一類的東西之後，他的情況真的好多了。但你有沒有機會發一些聞起來不像腳的布丁啊？\n\n等你不忙的時候就回家看看吧。\n\n- Baba\n------------------\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.HOLIDAYCARD.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.LONELYMINION.HOLIDAYCARD.SUBTITLE"
msgid ""
msgstr ""

