msgid "View File"
msgstr "查看文件"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MEGA_BRAIN_TANK.BEGIN_POPUP.CODEX_NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MEGA_BRAIN_TANK.BEGIN_POPUP.CODEX_NAME"
msgid "First Encounter"
msgstr "初次相遇"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MEGA_BRAIN_TANK.BEGIN_POPUP.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MEGA_BRAIN_TANK.BEGIN_POPUP.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "I've discovered a new dream-analyzing building buried deep inside our asteroid.\n\nIt seems to contain new sleep-specific suits...could these be the key to unlocking my Duplicants' ability to dream?\n\nI've often wondered what they might be capable of, once their imaginations were awakened."
msgstr "我在我們的小行星中發現了深埋地下的夢境分析儀器。\n\n這裡似乎有一些專門用於睡眠的新衣服…這可能是解鎖我的複製人作夢能力的關鍵？\n\n我經常在想，要是他們的想像力被喚醒，他們能做些什麼呢。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MEGA_BRAIN_TANK.BEGIN_POPUP.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MEGA_BRAIN_TANK.BEGIN_POPUP.NAME"
msgid "Story Trait: Somnium Synthesizer"
msgstr "故事特質：夢境合成器"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MEGA_BRAIN_TANK.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MEGA_BRAIN_TANK.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "Power up a colossal relic from Gravitas's underground sleep lab.\n\nWhen Duplicants sleep, their minds are blissfully blank and dream-free. But under the right conditions, things could be...different."
msgstr "為引力科技地下睡眠實驗室內的巨大遺跡供能。\n\n當複製人睡覺時，他們的頭腦裡是幸福的空白，並沒有作夢。但在適當的條件下，可能會…不一樣。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MEGA_BRAIN_TANK.DESCRIPTION_SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MEGA_BRAIN_TANK.DESCRIPTION_SHORT"
msgid "Power up a colossal relic from Gravitas's underground sleep lab."
msgstr "為引力科技地下睡眠實驗室內的巨大遺跡供能。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MEGA_BRAIN_TANK.END_POPUP.BUTTON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MEGA_BRAIN_TANK.END_POPUP.BUTTON"
msgid "Unlock Maximum Aptitude Mode"
msgstr "解鎖最大能力模式"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MEGA_BRAIN_TANK.END_POPUP.CODEX_NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MEGA_BRAIN_TANK.END_POPUP.CODEX_NAME"
msgid "Challenge Completed"
msgstr "挑戰完成"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MEGA_BRAIN_TANK.END_POPUP.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MEGA_BRAIN_TANK.END_POPUP.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "Meeting the initial quota of dream content analysis has triggered a surge of electromagnetic activity that appears to be enhancing performance for Duplicants everywhere.\n\nIf my Duplicants can keep this building fuelled with Dream Journals, perhaps we will continue to reap this benefit.\n\nA small side compartment has also popped open, revealing an unfamiliar object.\n\nA keepsake, perhaps?"
msgstr "完成初始預定容量的夢境內容分析引發了電磁活動的激增，這似乎提高了各地複製人的表現。\n\n如果我的複製人能保持用夢境日誌為這個建築供能，可能我們就可以持續獲得這種好處。\n\n側面的一個不起眼的小隔層也突然打開了，裡面有一件陌生的物件。\n\n是一件紀念品，大概？"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MEGA_BRAIN_TANK.END_POPUP.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MEGA_BRAIN_TANK.END_POPUP.NAME"
msgid "Story Trait Complete: Somnium Synthesizer"
msgstr "故事特質完成：夢境合成器"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MEGA_BRAIN_TANK.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MEGA_BRAIN_TANK.NAME"
msgid "Somnium Synthesizer"
msgstr "夢境合成器"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MEGA_BRAIN_TANK.SEEDSOFEVOLUTION.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MEGA_BRAIN_TANK.SEEDSOFEVOLUTION.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "<smallcaps>[Voice Recognition Initialized]\n[Subject Identified: B040]</smallcaps>\n\n[LOG BEGINS]\n\nThree days ago, we completed our first non-fatal Duplicant trial of Nikola's comprehensive synapse microanalysis and mirroring process. Five hours from now, Subject #901 will make history as our first human test subject.\n\nEven at the Vertex Institute, which is twice Gravitas's size, I could've spent half my career waiting for approval to advance to human trials for such an invasive process! But Director Stern is too invested in this work to let it stagnate.\n\nMy darling Bruce always said that when you're on the right path, the universe conspires to help you. He'd be so proud of the work we do here.\n\n[LOG ENDS]\n\n[LOG BEGINS]\n\nMy bio-printed multi-cerebral storage chambers (or \"mega minds\" as I've been calling them) are working! Just in time to save my job.\n\nThe Director's been getting increasingly impatient about our struggle to maintain the integrity of our growing datasets during extraction and processing. The other day, she held my report over a Bunsen burner until the flames reached her fingertips.\n\nI can only imagine how much stress she's under.\n\nThe whole world is counting on us.\n\n[LOG ENDS]\n\n[LOG BEGINS]\n\nOn a hunch, I added dream content analysis to the data and...wow. Oneirology may be scientifically \"fluffy\", but integrating subconscious narratives has produced a new type of brainmap - one with more latent potential for complex processing.\n\nIf these results are replicable, we might be on the verge of unlocking the secret to creating synthetic life forms with the capacity to evolve beyond blindly following commands.\n\nNikola says that's irrelevant for our purposes. Surely Director Stern would disagree.\n\n[LOG ENDS]\n\n[LOG BEGINS]\n\nNikola gave me a dataset to plug into the mega minds. He wouldn't say where it came from, but even if he had...nothing could have prepared me for what it contained.\n\nWhen he saw my face, he muttered something about how people should call me \"Tremors,\" not \"Nails\" and sent me on my lunch break.\n\nAll I could think about was those poor souls.\n\nDid they have souls?\n\n...do we?\n\n[LOG ENDS]\n\n[LOG BEGINS]\n\nIt's done. My adjustments to the memory transfer protocol are hardcoded into the machine.\n\nI finished just as Nikola stormed in.\n\nI may be too much of a coward to stand up for those unfortunate creatures, but with these new parameters in place...someday, they might be able to stand up for themselves.\n\n[LOG ENDS]\n------------------\n"
msgstr "<smallcaps>[語音辨識系統初始化完成]\n[主體已識別：B040]</smallcaps>\n\n[日誌開始]\n\n三天前，我們完成了我們的第一次非致命性複製人試驗，即 Nikola 主持的綜合突觸微觀分析和反射過程。從現在起五小時後，受測體 #901 將會成為我們的歷史上第一次人體測試項目。\n\n即使是在頂點研究所，那是一個比引力科技規模大一倍的地方，我也可以用我半個職業生涯等待批准，以推進類似這種手術過程的人體試驗！但 Stern 總監在此投入太多了，以至於項目進展始終沒停過。\n\n我親愛的 Bruce 總會說，當你走在正確的路上時，宇宙會幫助你的。他一定會為我們在此的工作感到自豪的。\n\n[日誌結束]\n\n[日誌開始]\n\n我的生物打印多腦儲存室（或者我一直將其稱為「超級大腦」）可以動了！剛好及時地拯救了我的工作。\n\n資料集在提取和處理過程中不斷擴大，對於我們艱難地維持其完整性的努力，總監感到越來越不耐煩了。前幾天，她把我的報告放在本生燈上，直到火焰燒到她的指尖。\n\n我只能想像她承受了多大的壓力。\n\n全世界都指望我們了。\n\n[日誌結束]\n\n[日誌開始]\n\n我憑直覺將夢境內容分析加入到了資料中，然後…哇。解夢學可能在科學上是「空洞」的，但整合潛意識敘事已經產生了一種新型的腦圖——一種更具有複雜處理潛力的腦圖\n\n如果這些結果是可複製的，我們可能即將揭開創造合成生命形式的祕密，這種生命形式具有超越盲目服從命令的進化能力。\n\nNikola 說這與我們的目的無關。當然 Stern 總監肯定不會同意。\n\n[日誌結束]\n\n[日誌開始]\n\nNikola 給了我一個資料集用來插入超級大腦。他沒有透露它是從哪裡來的，但即使他有…也沒有什麼能讓我對它所包含的內容做好準備。\n\n當他看到我的臉時，他嘀咕著，說人們都在叫我「Tremors」而不是「Nails」，然後送我去午休了。\n\n但我所想的只有那些可憐的靈魂。\n\n他們有靈魂嗎？\n\n…我們呢？\n\n[日誌結束]\n\n[日誌開始]\n\n完成了。我對記憶傳遞協議的調整已整合到機器中了。\n\n我剛完成 Nikola 就衝了進來。\n\n我可能太膽小了，無法為那些不幸的生物挺身而出，但有了這些新的參數…有一天，他們也許能夠為自己挺身而出。\n\n[日誌結束]\n------------------\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MEGA_BRAIN_TANK.SEEDSOFEVOLUTION.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MEGA_BRAIN_TANK.SEEDSOFEVOLUTION.SUBTITLE"
msgid "ENCRYPTION LEVEL: THREE"
msgstr "加密級別：三"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MEGA_BRAIN_TANK.SEEDSOFEVOLUTION.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MEGA_BRAIN_TANK.SEEDSOFEVOLUTION.TITLE"
msgid "A Seed is Planted"
msgstr "已種植種子"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "Reboot an ambitious collaborative project spearheaded by Gravitas's bioengineering and robotics departments.\n\nIf correctly rebuilt, it could save Duplicant lives."
msgstr "重新啟動由引力科技生物工程部和機器人部領頭的雄心勃勃的合作專案。\n\n如果重建得當，它就能拯救複製人的生命。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.DESCRIPTION_SHORT
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.DESCRIPTION_SHORT"
msgid "Reboot an ambitious collaborative project spearheaded by Gravitas's bioengineering and robotics departments."
msgstr "重啟由引力科技的生物工程和機器人部門所領導的雄心勃勃的合作項目。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.ENVELOPE.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.ENVELOPE.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "Dr. Seyed Ali,\n\nYou were right to be angry with me. I <i>am</i> the reason that the driverless workbot project was reassigned. Director Stern called me in to discuss your concerns regarding the Sporb mucin cross-contamination, and I...\n\nShe said the supplemental testing on model X posed a threat to the Ceres mission.\n\nAfter what happened to that poor lab tech, I should have said more, but...\n\nIt was already too late for him.\n\nIt may be too late for all of us.\n\nYou should know that the Director received a video call from someone at the Vertex Institute as I left... I lingered outside her door and heard her address them as the head of transnational security! The way they were talking about the biobot...\n\nIt's not safe to write more here. I'll wait for you at the rocket hangar after your shift tonight.\n\nI hope you'll come. I understand if you don't.\n\nI am so, so sorry.\n\n - Dr. Saruhashi"
msgstr "Seyed Ali 博士，\n\n你生我的氣是對的。我<b>就是</b>無人駕駛機器人專案被重新分配的原因。Stern 總監把我叫了過去，討論了你關於孢體黏蛋白交叉汙染的擔憂，然後我…\n\n她說，X 型的補充測試對穀神星任務產生了威脅。\n\n在什麼發生在那個可憐的實驗室技術員身上之後，我應該再說點什麼的，但是…\n\n對他來說已經太晚了。\n\n可能對我們所有人來說都太晚了。\n\n你應該知道，我前腳剛離開，總監就收到了來自頂點研究所的某人發來的視訊電話…我徘徊在她門外，聽到她稱呼他們為跨國安全負責人！當談論到生物機器人，他們的說話方式就像…\n\n在這裡再寫下去就不安全了。今晚下班後我在火箭機庫等你。\n\n我希望你能來。你不來我也能理解。\n\n我非常非常抱歉。\n\n- Saruhashi 博士"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.ENVELOPE.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.ENVELOPE.TITLE"
msgid "With Regrets"
msgstr "帶著遺憾"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.NAME"
msgid "Biobot Builder"
msgstr "生機組構儀"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.POPUPS.BEGIN.BUTTON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.POPUPS.BEGIN.BUTTON"
msgid "Close"
msgstr "關閉"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.POPUPS.BEGIN.CODEX_NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.POPUPS.BEGIN.CODEX_NAME"
msgid "First Encounter"
msgstr "初遇"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.POPUPS.BEGIN.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.POPUPS.BEGIN.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "My Duplicants have discovered a laboratory full of dusty machinery. The vestiges of another colony's experiments, perhaps?\n\nIt is unclear whether the apparatus is intended for biological experimentation or advanced mechatronics...or both."
msgstr "我的複製人發現了滿是蒙塵機械的實驗室。也許是另一個殖民地實驗的遺蹟？\n\n目前還不清楚這些儀器是用於生物實驗，還是用於高階機電一體化技術…亦或者都是。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.POPUPS.BEGIN.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.POPUPS.BEGIN.NAME"
msgid "Story Trait: Biobot Builder"
msgstr "故事特質：生機組構儀"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.POPUPS.END.BUTTON
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.POPUPS.END.BUTTON"
msgid "Close"
msgstr "關閉"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.POPUPS.END.BUTTON_READLORE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.POPUPS.END.BUTTON_READLORE"
msgid "Inspect Toy"
msgstr "檢查玩具"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.POPUPS.END.CODEX_NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.POPUPS.END.CODEX_NAME"
msgid "Challenge Completed"
msgstr "挑戰完成"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.POPUPS.END.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.POPUPS.END.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "Success! My Duplicants' efforts to get the Biobot Builder up and running have finally paid off!\n\nOur first fully assembled P.E.G.G.Y. biobot is ready to perform tasks in hazardous environments, which means less exposure to danger for my Duplicants. There seems to be no limit to the number of biobots that we could produce.\n\nA small toy bot was found discarded behind the Sporb tank. It occasionally plays a deteriorated laugh track."
msgstr "成功了！我的複製人讓生機組構儀啟動並執行的努力終於獲得了回報！\n\n我們第一台完全組裝的 P.E.G.G.Y. 生物機器人已經準備好前往危險環境執行任務了，這意味著我能減少複製人暴露在危險中的情況。我們能生產的生物機器人數量似乎沒有限制。\n\n在孢體缸後面發現了一個小型玩具機器人。它偶爾會播放音質不良的笑聲。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.POPUPS.END.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.POPUPS.END.NAME"
msgid "Story Trait Complete: Biobot Builder"
msgstr "故事特質完成：生機組構儀"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.POPUPS.LOCKER.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.POPUPS.LOCKER.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "A hermetically sealed glass cabinet.\n\nIt contains two <link=\"EVILFLOWER\">Sporechid</link> seeds and a carefully penned note."
msgstr "一個密封的玻璃櫃。\n\n裡面含有兩份<link=\"EVILFLOWER\">惡魔花</link>種子和精心書寫的便條。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.POPUPS.REVEAL.BUTTON_CLOSE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.POPUPS.REVEAL.BUTTON_CLOSE"
msgid "Close"
msgstr "關閉"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.POPUPS.REVEAL.BUTTON_READLORE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.POPUPS.REVEAL.BUTTON_READLORE"
msgid "Read Transcript"
msgstr "閱讀文字紀錄"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.POPUPS.REVEAL.CODEX_NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.POPUPS.REVEAL.CODEX_NAME"
msgid "Meet P.E.G.G.Y."
msgstr "遇見 P.E.G.G.Y."

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.POPUPS.REVEAL.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.POPUPS.REVEAL.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "Our restoration work is complete!\n\nA small plaque on this building's mechanical assembly tank reads: \"Pathogen-Fueled Extravehicular Geo-Exploratory Guidebot (Y).\"\n\nThe adjacent tank contains the floating shape of a half-formed organism. Its vivid coloring reminds me of the poisonous amphibians that were eradicated from our home planet's jungles.\n\nA tattered transcript print-out was recovered from the mess."
msgstr "我們的修復工作已經完成！\n\n這棟建築的機械裝配罐上有一塊小牌匾，上面寫著：「病原體驅動的艙外地理探索引導機器人（Y）。」\n\n相鄰的罐子裡有一個漂浮著的半-形成的有機體。它鮮豔的色彩讓我想起了從我們星球的叢林中被消滅的有毒兩棲動物。\n\n從混亂中找到了一份破爛的紙本文字紀錄。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.POPUPS.REVEAL.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.POPUPS.REVEAL.NAME"
msgid "Story Trait: Biobot Builder"
msgstr "故事特質：生機組構儀"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.STATUSITEMS.BUILDING_BEING_REVEALED.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.STATUSITEMS.BUILDING_BEING_REVEALED.NAME"
msgid "Being Restored"
msgstr "正在修復"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.STATUSITEMS.BUILDING_BEING_REVEALED.TOOLTIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.STATUSITEMS.BUILDING_BEING_REVEALED.TOOLTIP"
msgid "This building is being restored to its former glory"
msgstr "正在修復這個建築以恢復昔日的輝煌"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.STATUSITEMS.BUILDING_BEING_WORKED_BY_DOCTOR.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.STATUSITEMS.BUILDING_BEING_WORKED_BY_DOCTOR.NAME"
msgid "Preparing Biobot"
