#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.UNSAFETRANSFER.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.UNSAFETRANSFER.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "<smallcaps>[Log Fragmentation Detected]\n[Voice Recognition Unavailable]</smallcaps>\n\n[LOG BEGINS]\n\n...and then the Printing Pod says \"Knock knock, goo's there!\"\n\nUgh. They'll never laugh at <i>that</i> stinker.\n\nWhat if-\n\n(sound of a ding)\n\nHey hey, squishy little buddy! Look who's all grown up. You ready for a big robot ride? Dr. Seyed Ali should be back from his meeting any minute. He'll be so happy to see you.\n\n(sound of a wet slap on glass)\n\nAww yeah, I'd be impatient too.\n\nYou know what, why don't I go ahead and get you into your new home? I've helped him do this more than a dozen times.\n\n\"See one, do one, teach one,\" right?\n\n[LOG ENDS]"
msgstr "<smallcaps>[偵測到日誌片段]\n[語音辨識系統無法使用]</smallcaps>\n\n[日誌開始]\n\n…然後列印元說「敲敲門，糊在家！」\n\n呃。他們不會嘲笑<b>那</b>傢伙的。\n\n如果——\n\n（叮噹聲）\n\n嘿，嘿，黏糊糊的小傢伙！看看你都長多大了。你準備好乘坐大機器人了嗎？Seyed Ali 博士開完會隨時都會回來。他看到你會很高興的。\n\n（潮溼地拍打玻璃聲）\n\n啊是的，我也會不耐煩的。\n\n你知道嗎，我為什麼不直接帶你搬進新家呢？我已經幫他做過十幾次了。\n\n「看一次，做一次，教一次」，對吧？\n\n[日誌結束]"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.UNSAFETRANSFER.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.UNSAFETRANSFER.TITLE"
msgid "ENCRYPTION LEVEL: THREE"
msgstr "加密級別：三"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.VALENTINESDAY.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.VALENTINESDAY.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "I am\n   a subatomic particle\nsmaller than a speck of dust\n  flushed from your gaze\n\n     at the eyewash station  \n\n   My love is like plutonium\n gray and dull and\nunbearably heavy\n  until    I am near you\n\n with every breath \n      I burn, with\n    yearning\n              unseen\n\nPS: I made Steve let me in so I could leave you this, hope that's okay."
msgstr "我是\n   一粒亞原子\n比一顆灰塵還要小\n  在洗眼站從你的注視中\n\n     被沖走了  \n\n   我的愛就像鈽\n 灰色又暗淡\n難以承受的重\n  直到    我在你身邊\n\n 每一次呼吸 \n      我都燃燒著\n    看不見的\n              渴望\n\n附註：我逼迫 Steve 讓我進去了，這樣我才能把這個留給你，希望一切安好。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.VALENTINESDAY.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STORY_TRAITS.MORB_ROVER_MAKER.VALENTINESDAY.TITLE"
msgid "Anonymous Admirer"
msgstr "匿名愛慕者"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STRESS.HEADER_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STRESS.HEADER_1"
msgid "Stress"
msgstr "壓力"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STRESS.HEADER_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STRESS.HEADER_2"
msgid "Stress Responses"
msgstr "壓力反應"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STRESS.HEADER_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STRESS.HEADER_3"
msgid "Tutorials"
msgstr "教學"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STRESS.PARAGRAPH_1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STRESS.PARAGRAPH_1"
msgid "A Duplicant's experiences in the colony affect their stress level. Stress increases when they have negative experiences or unmet expectations. Stress decreases with time if <link=\"MORALE\">Morale</link> is satisfied. Duplicant behavior starts to change for the worse when stress levels get too high.\n\n"
msgstr "複製人在殖民地的經歷會影響他們的壓力等級。當他們有負面的經歷或未滿足期望時壓力會增加。\n\n<link=\"MORALE\">士氣</link>滿足時，壓力會隨著時間減少。當複製人的壓力太高時，行為會開始改變。\n\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STRESS.PARAGRAPH_2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STRESS.PARAGRAPH_2"
msgid "If a Duplicant has very high stress values they will experience a Stress Response episode. Each Duplicant has a different Stress Behavior - but all stress responses are bad. After the stress behavior episode is done, the Duplicants stress will reset to a lower value. Though, if the factors causing the Duplicant's high stress are not corrected they are bound to have another stress response episode.\n\n"
msgstr "如果複製人的壓力值非常高，他們會開始表現出壓力反應。\n\n每位複製人都有不同的壓力行為 - 但全部的壓力反應都是不好的。\n\n在壓力反應行為結束後，複製人的壓力會回到低點，如果導致壓力過高的因素仍未被解決，那麼將會經歷另一次的壓力反應。\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STRESS.PARAGRAPH_3
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STRESS.PARAGRAPH_3"
msgid "To learn more about managing Duplicants' moods, watch <link=\"VIDEOS13\">Video: Duplicant Morale</link> and see <link=\"MISCELLANEOUSTIPS2\">Tutorial: Stress Management</link>.\n\n"
msgstr "若要了解更多關於管理複製人情緒的資訊，請觀看<link=\"VIDEOS13\">影片：複製人士氣</link>並參閱 <link=\"MISCELLANEOUSTIPS2\">教學：壓力管理</link>。\n\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.STRESS.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.STRESS.TITLE"
msgid "<link=\"STRESS\">Stress</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"STRESS\">壓力</link>"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.SUNNY.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.SUNNY.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "<smallcaps>Pictured: \"Sun\" Shine Bug variant</smallcaps>"
msgstr "<smallcaps>圖為：「陽光」發光蟲變種</smallcaps>"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.SUNNY.BODY.CONTAINER2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.SUNNY.BODY.CONTAINER2"
msgid "It is not uncommon for Shine Bugs to mistakenly approach inanimate sources of light in search of a friend."
msgstr "為了尋找同伴，發光蟲接近無生命光源的錯誤行為並不罕見。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.SUNNY.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.SUNNY.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Critter Morph"
msgstr "小動物變種"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.SUNNY.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.SUNNY.TITLE"
msgid "Sun Bug"
msgstr "陽光發光蟲"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.SWAMPCHARD.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.SWAMPCHARD.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "Swamp Chard is a unique member of the Amaranthaceae family that has adapted to grow in humid environments, in or near pools of standing water.\n\nWhile the leaves are technically edible, the most nutritious and palatable part of the plant is the heart, which is rich in a number of essential vitamins."
msgstr "沼澤甜菜是一種獨特的莧科成員，適應在潮溼的環境中生長，在水池中或是附近。\n\n雖然葉子在技術上來說是可食用的，但植物中最營養美味的部分是菜心，富含多種必要維生素。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.SWAMPCHARD.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.SWAMPCHARD.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Edible Plant"
msgstr "可食用植物"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.SWAMPCHARD.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.SWAMPCHARD.TITLE"
msgid "Swamp Chard"
msgstr "沼澤甜菜"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.SWAMPLILYFLOWER.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.SWAMPLILYFLOWER.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "Balm Lily Flowers bloom on <link=\"SWAMPLILY\">Balm Lily</link> plants.\n\nThey have a wide range of medicinal applications, and have been shown to be a particularly effective antidote for respiratory illnesses.\n\nThe intense perfume emitted by their vivid petals is best described as \"dizzying.\""
msgstr "<link=\"SWAMPLILY\">香水百合</link>植物上綻放著香水百合花。\n\n它們具有廣泛的藥用用途，並且已被證明是一種特別有效的呼吸道疾病治療特效藥。\n\n它們鮮豔的花瓣散發出濃郁的香味，最好用「濃烈」來形容。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.SWAMPLILYFLOWER.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.SWAMPLILYFLOWER.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Medicinal Herb"
msgstr "草藥"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.SWAMPLILYFLOWER.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.SWAMPLILYFLOWER.TITLE"
msgid "Balm Lily Flower"
msgstr "香水百合"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.SWEEPY.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.SWEEPY.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "The Sweepy is a domesticated sweeping robot programmed to clean solid and liquid debris. The <link=\"SWEEPBOTSTATION\">Sweepy's Dock</link> will automatically launch the Sweepy, store the debris the robot picks up, and recharge the Sweepy's battery, provided it has been plugged into a power source.\n\nThough the Sweepy can not travel over gaps or uneven ground, it is programmed to feel really bad about this."
msgstr "清潔機器人是一個被設計為打掃室內固體與液體雜物的機器人。<link=\"SWEEPBOTSTATION\">清潔櫃</link>會自動啟動清潔機器人、儲存機器人拾起的雜物與為機器人充電，前提是機器人的插座接上電源。\n\n雖然清潔機器人不能穿過缺口和不平的地面，但它的程式會為此感到難過。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.SWEEPY.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.SWEEPY.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Cleaning Robot"
msgstr "負責清潔的機器人"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.SWEEPY.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.SWEEPY.TITLE"
msgid "Sweepy"
msgstr "清潔機器人"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.THIMBLEREED.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.THIMBLEREED.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "The Thimble Reed is a wetlands plant used in the production of high quality fabrics prized for their softness and breathability.\n\nCloth made from the Thimble Reed owes its exceptional softness to the fineness of its fibers and the unusual length to which they grow."
msgstr "頂針蘆葦是一種沼澤植物，用於生產高品質的布料，其柔軟性和透氣性而受到關注。\n\n頂針蘆葦製作的衣服，其特殊的柔軟性來自於它細小纖維的以及它們不尋長的長度。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.THIMBLEREED.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.THIMBLEREED.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Textile Plant"
msgstr "紡織植物"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.THIMBLEREED.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.THIMBLEREED.TITLE"
msgid "Thimble Reed"
msgstr "頂針蘆葦"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.TIMEOFFAPPROVED.BODY.CONTAINER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.TIMEOFFAPPROVED.BODY.CONTAINER"
msgid "<indent=5%><b>Vacation Request Granted</b>\nGood luck, Devon!\n\n<alpha=#AA><smallcaps><indent=10%> Vacation Request [May 18th-20th]\nReason: Time off request for attendance of the Blogjam Awards (\"Toast of the Town\" nominated in the Freshest Food Blog category).</indent></smallcaps></color></indent>"
msgstr "<indent=5%><b>收到假期申請</b>\n祝好運，Devon!\n\n<alpha=#AA><smallcaps><indent=10%> 申請休假[五月18日－20日]\n理由：休假參加部落格頒獎典禮（「土司小鎮」最新鮮的食物部落格分類提名）。</indent></smallcaps></color></indent>"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.TIMEOFFAPPROVED.BODY.EMAILHEADER
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.TIMEOFFAPPROVED.BODY.EMAILHEADER"
msgid "<smallcaps>To: <b>Dr. Ross</b><size=12><alpha=#AA> <dross@gravitas.nova></size></color>\nFrom: <b>Admin</b><size=12><alpha=#AA> <admin@gravitas.nova></color></size></smallcaps>\n------------------\n"
msgstr "<smallcaps>收件者：<b>Ross 博士</b><size=12><alpha=#AA> <dross@gravitas.nova></size></color>\n寄件者：<b>管理部</b><size=12><alpha=#AA> <admin@gravitas.nova></color></size></smallcaps>\n------------------\n"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.TIMEOFFAPPROVED.BODY.SIGNATURE
