#. STRINGS.CODEX.TRANQUILTOES.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.TRANQUILTOES.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "Tranquil Toes are a decorative succulent that flourish in a radioactive environment.\n\nThough most of the flora and fauna that thrive a harsh radioactive biome tends to be aggressive, Tranquil Toes provide a rare exception to this rule.\n\nIt is a generally believed that the morale boosting abilities of this plant come from its resemblence to a funny hat one might wear at a party."
msgstr "安寧芷是一種裝飾性多肉植物，可在放射性環境中生長。\n\n雖然在輻射生態系生存的動植物往往具有攻擊性，安寧芷為此規則提供了一個特殊的例外。\n\n人們普遍認為這株植物提振士氣的作用，來自於它與派對上可能會穿戴的一種有趣帽子有相似之處。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.TRANQUILTOES.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.TRANQUILTOES.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Decorative Plant"
msgstr "裝飾植物"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.TRANQUILTOES.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.TRANQUILTOES.TITLE"
msgid "Tranquil Toes"
msgstr "安寧芷"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.TROPICAL.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.TROPICAL.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "<smallcaps>Pictured: \"Tropical\" Pacu variant</smallcaps>"
msgstr "<smallcaps>圖為：「熱帶」帕庫變種</smallcaps>"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.TROPICAL.BODY.CONTAINER2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.TROPICAL.BODY.CONTAINER2"
msgid "It is said that the average Pacu intelligence is comparable to that of a dog, and that they are capable of learning and distinguishing from over twenty human faces."
msgstr "據說帕庫平均智力與一隻狗相當，並且牠們能從二十多張人臉中學習和區分。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.TROPICAL.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.TROPICAL.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Critter Morph"
msgstr "小動物變種"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.TROPICAL.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.TROPICAL.TITLE"
msgid "Tropical Pacu"
msgstr "熱帶帕庫"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.TUBEWORM.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.TUBEWORM.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "Little is known about the internal workings of Tublias, as their potent \"rotten egg\" stench makes them an unpopular specimen for closer study.\n\nWhile this odor dissipates during processing, it can linger on skin and clothing for an unpleasantly long time."
msgstr "關於暖管蟲的內部運作機制所知甚少，因為其強烈的「臭雞蛋」氣味，使它們成為不受歡迎的近距離研究對象。\n\n雖然這種氣味在處理過程中會消散，但它卻會令人不快地殘留在皮膚與衣物上，久久不散。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.TUBEWORM.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.TUBEWORM.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Cultivable Plant"
msgstr "可耕種植物"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.TUBEWORM.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.TUBEWORM.TITLE"
msgid "Tublia"
msgstr "暖管蟲"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.URCHIN.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.URCHIN.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "Pinpoki are aquatic organisms grown in <link=\"URCHINPLANT\">Pinpokets</link>. They can be crushed to separate the <link=\"DIAMOND\">Diamond</link> spines from the edible <link=\"URCHINMEAT\">Uni</link> inside.\n\nThey can also be displayed whole as <link=\"DECOR\">Decor</link>."
msgstr "針膽是生長在<link=\"URCHINPLANT\">針膽團</link>中的水生生物。可以將其粉碎，分離出<link=\"DIAMOND\">鑽石</link>刺與內部可食用的<link=\"URCHINMEAT\">針膽黃</link>。\n\n也可以將整顆針膽作為<link=\"DECOR\">裝飾物</link>進行展示。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.URCHIN.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.URCHIN.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Aquatic Organism"
msgstr "水生生物"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.URCHIN.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.URCHIN.TITLE"
msgid "Pinpoki"
msgstr "針膽"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.URCHINPLANT.BODY.CONTAINER1
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.URCHINPLANT.BODY.CONTAINER1"
msgid "The individual <link=\"URCHIN\">Pinpoki</link> that grow inside Pinpoket clusters are prized by marine cuisine gourmands for their delicate buttery flesh, with an aftertaste that some describe as \"transcendant.\"\n\nThe flavor is so legendary that even just gazing upon a displayed Pinpoki is enough to inspire a high level of emotional satisfaction."
msgstr "生長在針膽團內部的<link=\"URCHIN\">針膽</link>個體，因其細緻如奶油般的肉質，以及被部分食客形容為「超越凡俗」的餘韻，而備受海洋美食家們的推崇。\n\n其風味堪稱傳奇，甚至僅僅是凝視著一顆展示中的針膽，便足以為人帶來高度的情緒滿足感。"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.URCHINPLANT.SUBTITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.URCHINPLANT.SUBTITLE"
msgid "Aquatic Plant"
msgstr "水生植物"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.URCHINPLANT.TITLE
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.URCHINPLANT.TITLE"
msgid "Pinpoket"
msgstr "針膽團"

