msgid "<smallcaps>Pictured: \"Coral\" Shine Bug variant</smallcaps>"
msgstr "<smallcaps>圖為：「活力」發光蟲變種</smallcaps>"

#. STRINGS.CODEX.VITAL.BODY.CONTAINER2
msgctxt "STRINGS.CODEX.VITAL.BODY.CONTAINER2"
msgid "It is unwise to touch a Shine Bug's wing blades directly due to the extremely fragile nature of their membranes."
msgstr "發光蟲的羽翼非常脆弱，直接觸摸是不明智的行為。"

