#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODEL.BIONIC.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODEL.BIONIC.DESC"
msgid "Bionic Duplicants run on <link=\"ELECTROBANK\">Power Banks</link>, <link=\"LUBRICATINGOIL\">Gear Oil</link> and unbridled enthusiasm.\n\nThey should not be permitted to use standard <link=\"MISCELLANEOUSTIPS\">Toilets</link>."
msgstr "仿生複製人依賴<link=\"ELECTROBANK\">移動電源</link>、<link=\"LUBRICATINGOIL\">齒輪油</link>和洋溢的熱情執行。\n\n他們不應該允許使用標準<link=\"MISCELLANEOUSTIPS\">廁所</link>。"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODEL.BIONIC.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODEL.BIONIC.NAME"
