msgstr "這名複製人是有機與無機的奇怪組合"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODEL.REMOTEWORKER.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.MODEL.REMOTEWORKER.DESC"
msgid "A remotely operated work robot.\n\nIt performs chores as instructed by a <link=\"REMOTEWORKTERMINAL\">Remote Controller</link> on the same planetoid."
msgstr "遠端操作的作業機器人。\n\n它將執行從同一小行星上<link=\"REMOTEWORKTERMINAL\">遠距工作站</link>指示的任務。"

