msgstr "這名複製人只是不信任那些美麗的小眼睛"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.TRAITS.RANCHINGDOWN.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.TRAITS.RANCHINGDOWN.NAME"
