msgstr "這名複製人渾身肌肉，力量感爆棚！"

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.TRAITS.ROCKCRUSHER.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.TRAITS.ROCKCRUSHER.NAME"
