msgstr "仿生複製人使用增效卡匣來提高他們的技能和屬性\n\n增效卡匣可以在<link=\"CRAFTINGTABLE\">工藝台</link>和<link=\"ADVANCEDCRAFTINGTABLE\">焊接站</link>製作\n\n預先安裝的增效卡匣效果："

#. STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.TRAITS.STARTWITHBOOSTER_ART1.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.DUPLICANTS.TRAITS.STARTWITHBOOSTER_ART1.DESC"
msgid "Grants a Bionic Duplicant flawless decorating skills."
