#. STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.EQUIPPABLEBALLOON.RECIPE_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.EQUIPPABLEBALLOON.RECIPE_DESC"
msgid "Gives Duplicants a boost in brain function.\n\nSupplied by Duplicants with the Balloon Artist <link=\"MORALE\">Overjoyed</link> response"
msgstr "提升複製人的大腦功能\n\n由具備氣球藝術家特性的複製人，在發動<link=\"MORALE\">樂歪了</link>反應時提供"

#. STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.FUNKY_VEST.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.FUNKY_VEST.DESC"
msgid "This transforms my Duplicant into a walking beacon of charm and style."
msgstr "把複製人變成迷人的移動燈塔。"

#. STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.FUNKY_VEST.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.FUNKY_VEST.EFFECT"
msgid "Increases Decor in a small area effect around the wearer. Can be upgraded to <link=\"CUSTOMCLOTHING\">Primo Garb</link> at the <link=\"CLOTHINGALTERATIONSTATION\">Clothing Refashionator</link>."
msgstr "增加穿戴者周圍小範圍內的裝飾度。可以在<link=\"CLOTHINGALTERATIONSTATION\">服裝改造機</link>升級為<link=\"CUSTOMCLOTHING\">卓越服裝</link>。"

#. STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.FUNKY_VEST.GENERICNAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.FUNKY_VEST.GENERICNAME"
msgid "Clothing"
msgstr "服裝"

#. STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.FUNKY_VEST.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.FUNKY_VEST.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"FUNKYVEST\">Snazzy Suit</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"FUNKYVEST\">時髦服裝</link>"

#. STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.FUNKY_VEST.RECIPE_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.FUNKY_VEST.RECIPE_DESC"
msgid "Increases Decor in a small area effect around the wearer. Can be upgraded to <link=\"CUSTOMCLOTHING\">Primo Garb</link> at the <link=\"CLOTHINGALTERATIONSTATION\">Clothing Refashionator</link>"
msgstr "增加穿戴者周圍小範圍內的裝飾度。可以在<link=\"CLOTHINGALTERATIONSTATION\">服裝改造機</link>升級到<link=\"CUSTOMCLOTHING\">卓越服裝</link>"

#. STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.HOLIDAY_2023_CRATE.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.HOLIDAY_2023_CRATE.DESC"
msgid "An unaddressed package has been discovered near the Printing Pod. It exudes seasonal cheer, and trace amounts of Neutronium have been detected."
msgstr "在列印元附近發現了一個未註明地址的包裹。它散發著季節性的歡樂氣息，並偵測到了微量的零號元素。"

#. STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.HOLIDAY_2023_CRATE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.HOLIDAY_2023_CRATE.NAME"
msgid "Holiday Gift Crate"
msgstr "假日禮包"

#. STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.JET_SUIT.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.JET_SUIT.DESC"
msgid "Allows my Duplicants to take to the skies, for a time."
msgstr "允許我的複製人們飛行一段時間。"

#. STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.JET_SUIT.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.JET_SUIT.EFFECT"
msgid "Supplies Duplicants with <link=\"OXYGEN\">Oxygen</link> in toxic and low breathability environments.\n\nMust be refilled with <link=\"OXYGEN\">Oxygen</link> and <link=\"COMBUSTIBLELIQUID\">Combustible Liquid</link> at a <link=\"JETSUITLOCKER\">Jet Suit Dock</link> when depleted."
msgstr "在有毒或低透氣性的環境中，為複製人提供<link=\"OXYGEN\">氧氣</link>。\n\n當耗盡時，必須在<link=\"JETSUITLOCKER\">飛行衣存放櫃</link>使用<link=\"OXYGEN\">氧氣</link>和<link=\"COMBUSTIBLELIQUID\">可燃液體</link>進行補充。"

#. STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.JET_SUIT.GENERICNAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.JET_SUIT.GENERICNAME"
msgid "Jet Suit"
msgstr "飛行衣"

#. STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.JET_SUIT.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.JET_SUIT.NAME"
msgid "<link=\"JETSUIT\">Jet Suit</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"JETSUIT\">飛行衣</link>"

#. STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.JET_SUIT.RECIPE_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.JET_SUIT.RECIPE_DESC"
msgid "Supplies Duplicants with <link=\"OXYGEN\">Oxygen</link> in toxic and low breathability environments.\n\nAllows Duplicant flight."
msgstr "在低氧的環境下供應複製人<link=\"OXYGEN\">氧氣</link>。\n\n讓複製人可以跟鋼鐵人一樣飛行。"

#. STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.JET_SUIT.REPAIR_WORN_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.JET_SUIT.REPAIR_WORN_DESC"
msgid "Restore a <link=\"JETSUIT\">Worn Jet Suit</link> to working order."
msgstr "將<link=\"JETSUIT\">磨損的飛行衣</link>恢復至工作狀態。"

#. STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.JET_SUIT.REPAIR_WORN_RECIPE_NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.JET_SUIT.REPAIR_WORN_RECIPE_NAME"
msgid "Repair <link=\"JETSUIT\">Jet Suit</link>"
msgstr "維修<link=\"JETSUIT\">飛行衣</link>"

