#. STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.RUBBERBOOTS.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.RUBBERBOOTS.DESC"
msgid "Grippy waterproof boots make chores much more manageable."
msgstr "具備防滑防水功能的靴子，讓工作處理起來更加輕鬆。"

#. STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.RUBBERBOOTS.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.RUBBERBOOTS.EFFECT"
msgid "Protects the wearer from <style=\"KKeyword\">Soggy Feet</style> and <style=\"KKeyword\">Slippery</style> floors."
msgstr "使穿戴者免受<style=\"KKeyword\">腳溼了</style>與<style=\"KKeyword\">咕溜</style>地面的影響。"

#. STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.RUBBERBOOTS.EFFECT_DLC3
msgctxt "STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.RUBBERBOOTS.EFFECT_DLC3"
msgid "Protects the wearer from <style=\"KKeyword\">Soggy Feet</style> and <style=\"KKeyword\">Slippery</style> floors.\n\nEnables Bionic Duplicants to cross small puddles without <style=\"KKeyword\">Liquid Exposure</style> damage."
msgstr "保護穿戴者免受<style=\"KKeyword\">腳溼了</style>與<style=\"KKeyword\">咕溜</style>地板影響。\n\n使仿生複製人能穿越小水灘，而不會受到<style=\"KKeyword\">暴露在液體中</style>的傷害。"

#. STRINGS.EQUIPMENT.PREFABS.RUBBERBOOTS.GENERICNAME
