#. STRINGS.ITEMS.INDUSTRIAL_PRODUCTS.ORBITAL_RESEARCH_DATABANK.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.ITEMS.INDUSTRIAL_PRODUCTS.ORBITAL_RESEARCH_DATABANK.DESC"
