#. STRINGS.MISC.NOTIFICATIONS.LOCOMOTIONMESSAGE.MESSAGEBODY
msgctxt "STRINGS.MISC.NOTIFICATIONS.LOCOMOTIONMESSAGE.MESSAGEBODY"
msgid "Duplicants have limited jumping and climbing abilities. They can only climb two tiles high and cannot fit into spaces shorter than two tiles, or cross gaps wider than one tile. I should keep this in mind while placing errands.\n\nTo check if an errand I've placed is accessible, I can select a Duplicant and (ClickType/click) <b>Show Navigation</b> to view all areas within their reach."
msgstr "請牢記在心中，當要安排工作時，複製人只能爬兩格高或跨一格寬，而且活動空間不得少於兩格。\n\n如果要確認一項工作是否可以執行，請選擇一位複製人並(ClickType/click)<b>顯示路徑</b>來觀看他們能達到的所有區域。"

#. STRINGS.MISC.NOTIFICATIONS.LOCOMOTIONMESSAGE.NAME
