msgstr "礦物材料是未精煉的有機固體。幾乎所有的礦物原料都能透過<link=\"ROCKCRUSHER\">碎石機</link>處理，而少數礦物需要用到<link=\"SUPERMATERIALREFINERY\">分子冶煉廠</link>，"

#. STRINGS.MISC.TAGS.BUILDING
msgctxt "STRINGS.MISC.TAGS.BUILDING"
msgid "Build Dig-Delivery"
msgstr "建造挖掘運送"

#. STRINGS.MISC.TAGS.BUILDINGFIBER
msgctxt "STRINGS.MISC.TAGS.BUILDINGFIBER"
msgid "<link=\"BUILDINGFIBER\">Fibers</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BUILDINGFIBER\">纖維</link>"

#. STRINGS.MISC.TAGS.BUILDINGFIBER_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.MISC.TAGS.BUILDINGFIBER_DESC"
msgid "Fibers are organically sourced polymers which are both sturdy and sensorially pleasant, making them suitable in the construction of <link=\"MORALE\">Morale</link>-boosting buildings."
msgstr "纖維是有機聚合物，既結實又舒適，使其適合建造提高<link=\"MORALE\">士氣</link>的建築。"

#. STRINGS.MISC.TAGS.BUILDINGGASKET
msgctxt "STRINGS.MISC.TAGS.BUILDINGGASKET"
msgid "Gasket"
msgstr "密封墊"

#. STRINGS.MISC.TAGS.BUILDINGGASKET_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.MISC.TAGS.BUILDINGGASKET_DESC"
msgid "Gaskets are mechanical seals made from <link=\"RUBBER\">Rubber</link> or <link=\"PLASTIC\">Plastic</link> at the <link=\"CRAFTINGTABLE\">Crafting Station</link>.\n\nThey are essential components for certain buildings and objects that require a strong <link=\"ELEMENTSLIQUID\">Liquid</link> seal."
msgstr "密封墊是一種機械密封組件，可於<link=\"CRAFTINGTABLE\">工作臺</link>使用<link=\"RUBBER\">橡膠</link>或<link=\"PLASTIC\">塑膠</link>製作。\n\n它是某些需要強力<link=\"ELEMENTSLIQUID\">液體</link>密封之建築與物體的關鍵組件。"

#. STRINGS.MISC.TAGS.BUILDINGWOOD
msgctxt "STRINGS.MISC.TAGS.BUILDINGWOOD"
msgid "<link=\"BUILDINGWOOD\">Wood</link>"
msgstr "<link=\"BUILDINGWOOD\">木材</link>"

#. STRINGS.MISC.TAGS.BUILDINGWOOD_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.MISC.TAGS.BUILDINGWOOD_DESC"
msgid "Wood is a renewable building material which can also be used as a valuable source of fuel and electricity when refined at the <link=\"WOODGASGENERATOR\">Wood Burner</link> or the <link=\"ETHANOLDISTILLERY\">Ethanol Distiller</link>."
msgstr "木材是可再生的建造材料，也可作為有價值的燃料來源在<link=\"WOODGASGENERATOR\">木材發電機</link>產生電力，或在<link=\"ETHANOLDISTILLERY\">乙醇蒸餾器</link>中精煉。"

#. STRINGS.MISC.TAGS.BURNS
