#. STRINGS.MISC.TAGS.CRITTERDRINKABLE_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.MISC.TAGS.CRITTERDRINKABLE_DESC"
msgid "These <link=\"ELEMENTSLIQUID\">liquids</link> can be safely consumed by <link=\"CREATURES\">Critters</link> at the <link=\"MILKFEEDER\">Critter Fountain</link>. Giving critters access to proper hydration improves their mood and helps them better tolerate crowded living conditions."
msgstr "這些<link=\"ELEMENTSLIQUID\">液體</link>可供小動物在<link=\"MILKFEEDER\">小動物飲水機</link>處安全飲用。為小動物提供充足的水分，能有效改善牠們的情緒，並提升牠們對擁擠生活環境的適應力。"

