#. STRINGS.MISC.TAGS.REMOTEOPERABLE_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.MISC.TAGS.REMOTEOPERABLE_DESC"
msgid "These buildings can be operated from a distance by a <link=\"REMOTEWORKTERMINAL\">Remote Controller</link> so long as they are built within range of a <link=\"REMOTEWORKERDOCK\">Remote Worker Dock</link>."
msgstr "只要這些建築物建在<link=\"REMOTEWORKERDOCK\">遙控機器人基站</link>的範圍內，就可以透過<link=\"REMOTEWORKTERMINAL\">遠距工作站</link>進行遠距離操作。"

