msgstr "<link=\"SUBLIMATES\">昇華物</link>"

#. STRINGS.MISC.TAGS.SUBLIMATING_DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.MISC.TAGS.SUBLIMATING_DESC"
msgid "Sublimators are a class of <link=\"ELEMENTSSOLID\">Solid</link> elements that passively convert to a <link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">Gaseous</link> state. When off-gassing is complete, no trace of the original solid remains.\n\nThis passive conversion persists when the element is left in storage."
msgstr "昇華物是一類<link=\"ELEMENTSSOLID\">固體</link>元素會被動地轉化為<link=\"ELEMENTSGAS\">氣體</link>狀態。當完全揮發後，不會留下任何原始固體的痕跡。\n\n當元素放在儲存容器中時，這種被動轉化仍然持續。"

