#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.CREATUREPEN.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.CREATUREPEN.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "Critters don't mind it here, as long as things don't get too crowded.\n\nStabled critters can be tended to in order to improve their happiness, hasten their domestication and increase their production.\n\nEnables the use of Grooming Stations, Shearing Stations, Critter Condos, Critter Fountains and Milking Stations."
msgstr "小動物不介意待在這裡，只要這裡不會太過擁擠。\n\n圈養的小動物可以接受照料，以提升牠們的快樂度、加速馴化並增加產量。\n\n允許使用梳理站、修剪站、小動物公寓、小動物飲水機與擠奶站。"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.CREATUREPEN.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.CREATUREPEN.EFFECT"
msgid "- Critter taming and mood bonus"
msgstr "- 小動物馴化與心情加成"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.CREATUREPEN.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.CREATUREPEN.NAME"
msgid "Stable"
msgstr "牧場"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.CREATUREPEN.TOOLTIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.CREATUREPEN.TOOLTIP"
msgid "A stable enables both land-based and aquatic Grooming Station, Critter Condo, Critter Fountain, Shearing Station and Milking Station use"
msgstr "牧場可供陸生與水生梳理站、小動物公寓、小動物飲水機、修剪站及擠奶站使用"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.FARM.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.FARM.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "An enclosed agricultural space best utilized by Duplicants with Crop Tending skills.\n\nCrops grown within a Greenhouse can be tended with Farm Station fertilizer to increase their growth speed."
msgstr "一個封閉的農業空間，最適合有作物照料技能的複製人來使用。\n\n溫室內種植的農作物可以用農場站生產的肥料來照料，以提高它們的生長速度。。"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.FARM.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.FARM.EFFECT"
msgid "- Enables Farm Station use"
msgstr "- 可使用農場站"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.FARM.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.FARM.NAME"
msgid "Greenhouse"
msgstr "溫室"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.FARM.TOOLTIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.FARM.TOOLTIP"
msgid "Crops grown within a Greenhouse can be tended with Farm Station fertilizer to increase their growth speed"
msgstr "種在溫室的農作物可以使用農場站生產的肥料來加快生長速度"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.GREATHALL.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.GREATHALL.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "A great place to eat, with great decor. Great!\n\nEating in a Great Hall will improve Duplicants' Morale."
msgstr "用餐環境絕佳，裝飾亦極好。太棒了！\n\n在高級餐廳用餐將提升複製人的士氣。"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.GREATHALL.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.GREATHALL.EFFECT"
msgid "- Morale bonus"
msgstr "- 士氣加成"

