msgid "Great Hall"
msgstr "高級餐廳"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.GREATHALL.TOOLTIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.GREATHALL.TOOLTIP"
msgid "Eating in a Great Hall will significantly improve Duplicants' Morale"
msgstr "在一間高級餐廳內用餐，會明顯的提升複製人的士氣"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.HOSPITAL.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.HOSPITAL.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "A dedicated medical facility that helps minimize recovery time.\n\nSick Duplicants assigned to medical buildings located within a Hospital are also less likely to spread Disease."
msgstr "一個專用的醫療設施，能最大程度的縮短康復時間。\n\n將生病的複製人分配到醫院的醫療建築，不容易讓疾病擴散。"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.HOSPITAL.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.HOSPITAL.EFFECT"
msgid "- Quarantine sick Duplicants"
msgstr "- 隔離生病的複製人"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.HOSPITAL.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.HOSPITAL.NAME"
msgid "Hospital"
msgstr "醫院"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.HOSPITAL.TOOLTIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.HOSPITAL.TOOLTIP"
msgid "Sick Duplicants assigned to medical buildings located within a Hospital are less likely to spread Disease"
msgstr "被分配到醫療設備的病人待在醫院內，不太有機會傳染疾病"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.KITCHEN.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.KITCHEN.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "A cooking area equipped to take meals to the next level.\n\nAdding ingredients from a Spice Grinder to foods cooked on an Electric Grill or Gas Range provides a variety of positive benefits."
msgstr "一個裝備齊全的烹飪區域，能夠將菜餚提升到新的水平。\n\n為電烤爐與瓦斯爐烹調的料理增添香料研磨器研製的香料，可提供多種積極的好處。"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.KITCHEN.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.KITCHEN.EFFECT"
msgid "- Enables Spice Grinder use"
msgstr "- 允許香料研磨器的使用"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.KITCHEN.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.KITCHEN.NAME"
msgid "Kitchen"
msgstr "廚房"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.KITCHEN.TOOLTIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.KITCHEN.TOOLTIP"
msgid "Using a Spice Grinder in a Kitchen adds benefits to foods cooked on Electric Grill or Gas Range"
msgstr "在廚房內使用香料研磨器，能在電烤爐與瓦斯爐烹調的食物上增添風味"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.LABORATORY.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.LABORATORY.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "Where wild hypotheses meet rigorous scientific experimentation.\n\nScience stations built in a Laboratory function more efficiently.\n\nA Laboratory enables the use of the Geotuner and the Mission Control Station."
msgstr "這是瘋狂的假設與嚴謹的科學實驗相碰撞的地方。\n\n在實驗室中的科學建築的使用效率更高。\n\n在實驗室內能使用地理調諧儀和任務控制站。"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.LABORATORY.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.LABORATORY.EFFECT"
msgid "- Efficiency bonus"
msgstr "- 效率加成"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.LABORATORY.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.LABORATORY.NAME"
msgid "Laboratory"
msgstr "實驗室"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.LABORATORY.TOOLTIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.LABORATORY.TOOLTIP"
msgid "Science buildings built in a Laboratory function more efficiently\n\nA Laboratory enables Geotuner and Mission Control Station use"
msgstr "在實驗室內使用科學建築的使用效率更高\n\n在實驗室內可以使用地理調諧儀和任務控制站"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.LATRINE.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.LATRINE.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "It's a step up from doing one's business in full view of the rest of the colony.\n\nUsing a toilet in an enclosed room will improve Duplicants' Morale."
msgstr "比起在整個殖民地前面如廁，這是一大進步。\n\n在封閉房間內上廁所會提升複製人的士氣。"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.LATRINE.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.LATRINE.EFFECT"
msgid "- Morale bonus"
msgstr "- 士氣加成"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.LATRINE.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.LATRINE.NAME"
msgid "Latrine"
msgstr "廁間"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.LATRINE.TOOLTIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.LATRINE.TOOLTIP"
msgid "Using a toilet in an enclosed room will improve Duplicants' Morale"
msgstr "在一個完整的房間內使用廁間會提升複製人的士氣"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.MACHINE_SHOP.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.MACHINE_SHOP.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "It smells like elbow grease.\n\nDuplicants working in a Machine Shop can maintain buildings and increase their production speed."
msgstr "聞起來像手肘的油漬。\n\n複製人在工作坊工作可以保持建築，加快他們的生產速度。"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.MACHINE_SHOP.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.MACHINE_SHOP.EFFECT"
msgid "- Increased fabrication efficiency"
msgstr "- 增加生產效率"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.MACHINE_SHOP.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.MACHINE_SHOP.NAME"
msgid "Machine Shop"
msgstr "機械工廠"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.MACHINE_SHOP.TOOLTIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.MACHINE_SHOP.TOOLTIP"
msgid "Duplicants working in a Machine Shop can maintain buildings and increase their production speed"
msgstr "在機械工廠工作的複製人，可以維護建築物並增加它們的生產速度"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.MASSAGE_CLINIC.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.MASSAGE_CLINIC.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "A soothing space with a very relaxing ambience, especially when well-decorated.\n\nReceiving massages at a Massage Clinic will significantly improve Stress reduction."
msgstr "一個有著十分放鬆分為的舒適空間，特別是裝飾精美的時候。\n\n在按摩中心接受按摩會大大緩解複製人的壓力。"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.MASSAGE_CLINIC.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.MASSAGE_CLINIC.EFFECT"
msgid "- Massage stress relief bonus"
msgstr "- 按摩壓力釋放加成"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.MASSAGE_CLINIC.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.MASSAGE_CLINIC.NAME"
msgid "Massage Clinic"
msgstr "按摩中心"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.MASSAGE_CLINIC.TOOLTIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.MASSAGE_CLINIC.TOOLTIP"
msgid "Receiving massages at a Massage Clinic will significantly improve Stress reduction"
msgstr "在按摩中心按摩會快速的減少壓力"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.MESSHALL.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.MESSHALL.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "A simple dining room setup that's easy to improve upon.\n\nEating at a mess table in a Mess Hall will increase Duplicants' Morale."
msgstr "一個簡單的用餐空間，很容易改進。\n\n在餐廳的單人餐桌前用餐會提升複製人的士氣。"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.MESSHALL.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.MESSHALL.EFFECT"
msgid "- Morale bonus"
msgstr "- 士氣加成"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.MESSHALL.NAME
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.MESSHALL.NAME"
msgid "Mess Hall"
msgstr "餐廳"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.MESSHALL.TOOLTIP
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.MESSHALL.TOOLTIP"
msgid "Eating at a Mess Table in a Mess Hall will improve Duplicants' Morale"
msgstr "在一間高級的餐廳內用餐與放鬆，會明顯的提升複製人的士氣"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.NATURERESERVE.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.NATURERESERVE.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "A lot of greenery goes an even longer way.\n\nPassing through a Nature Reserve will grant higher Morale bonuses to Duplicants than a Park."
msgstr "更多的植物可以讓人走得更遠。\n\n自然保護區要比公園更能提高複製人的士氣。"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.NATURERESERVE.EFFECT
msgctxt "STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.NATURERESERVE.EFFECT"
msgid "- Morale bonus"
msgstr "- 士氣加成"

#. STRINGS.ROOMS.TYPES.NATURERESERVE.NAME
