#. STRINGS.UI.CODEX.GEYSERS.DESC
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.CODEX.GEYSERS.DESC"
msgid "Geysers and Fumaroles emit elements at variable intervals. They provide a sustainable source of material or kinetic energy, albeit typically in low volumes.\n\nThe variable factors of a geyser are:\n\n    • Emission element \n    • Emission temperature \n    • Emission mass \n    • Cycle length \n    • Dormancy duration \n    • Disease emitted"
msgstr "間歇泉和噴氣孔以不同的時間間隔噴發元素。它們提供了可持續的物質或動能來源，儘管通常產量較低。\n\n間歇泉的可變因素為：\n\n    • 噴發元素 \n    • 噴發溫度 \n    • 噴發質量 \n    • 週期長度 \n    • 休眠持續時間 \n    • 噴發疾病"

