#. STRINGS.UI.FRONTEND.SUPPORTWARNINGS.DUPLICATE_KEY_BINDINGS
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.FRONTEND.SUPPORTWARNINGS.DUPLICATE_KEY_BINDINGS"
msgid "<b>Duplicate key bindings were detected.\nThis may be because your custom key bindings conflicted with a new feature's default key.\nPlease visit the controls screen to ensure your key bindings are set how you like them.</b>\n{0}"
msgstr "<b>偵測到重複的按鍵連結。\n這可能是因為您的自訂按鍵連結與新功能的預設按鍵衝突。\n請檢查控制項目，確保您的快捷鍵是您希望的方式。</b>\n{0}"

#. STRINGS.UI.FRONTEND.SUPPORTWARNINGS.IO_SUFFICIENT_SPACE
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.FRONTEND.SUPPORTWARNINGS.IO_SUFFICIENT_SPACE"
msgid "An Insufficient Space Error occurred when trying to write to disk. \n\nPlease free up some space.\n{0}"
msgstr "硬碟空間不足，寫入資料時發生錯誤。\n\n請清出一些空間。\n{0}"

#. STRINGS.UI.FRONTEND.SUPPORTWARNINGS.IO_UNAUTHORIZED
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.FRONTEND.SUPPORTWARNINGS.IO_UNAUTHORIZED"
msgid "An Unauthorized Access Error occurred when trying to write to disk.\n\nPlease check that you have permissions to write to:\n{0}\n\nThis may prevent the game from saving."
msgstr "嘗試寫入磁碟時發生了「未經授權的訪問」錯誤。\n\n請檢查你是否擁有向以下磁碟寫入的許可權：\n{0}\n\n這可能會阻止遊戲儲存。"

#. STRINGS.UI.FRONTEND.SUPPORTWARNINGS.IO_UNAUTHORIZED_ONEDRIVE
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.FRONTEND.SUPPORTWARNINGS.IO_UNAUTHORIZED_ONEDRIVE"
msgid "An Unauthorized Access Error occurred when trying to write to disk.\n\nOneDrive may be interfering with the game.\n\nPlease check that you have permissions to write to:\n{0}\n\nThis may prevent the game from saving."
msgstr "嘗試寫入磁碟時發生了「未經授權的訪問」錯誤。\n\nOneDrive可能會干擾遊戲。\n\n請檢查你是否擁有向以下磁碟寫入的許可權：\n{0}\n\n這可能會阻止遊戲儲存。"

#. STRINGS.UI.FRONTEND.SUPPORTWARNINGS.IO_UNKNOWN
