msgid "<b>Reset Priorities</b>\n\nReturns all priorities to their default values.\n\nProximity Enabled: Priorities will be adjusted high-to-low.\n\nProximity Disabled: All priorities will be reset to neutral."
msgstr "<b>重設優先度</b>\n\n重設所有優先度為預設值\n\n臨近任務啟用：優先度被調整為由高到低。\n\n臨近任務停用：所有的優先度將被重設為中間值。"

