#. STRINGS.UI.KEEPSAKES.CRITTER_MANIPULATOR.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.KEEPSAKES.CRITTER_MANIPULATOR.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "A pottery project produced in an HR-mandated art therapy class.\n\nIt's glazed with a substance that once landed a curious lab technician in the ER."
msgstr "在人資規定的藝術治療課程中製作的陶器項目。\n\n它塗有一種物質，曾經讓一名好奇的實驗室技術人員進入急診室。"

