#. STRINGS.UI.SPACEARTIFACTS.AMELIASWATCH.ARTIFACT
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.SPACEARTIFACTS.AMELIASWATCH.ARTIFACT"
msgid "This watch once belonged to pioneering aviator Amelia Earhart and travelled to space via astronaut Dr. Shannon Walker.\n\nHow it came to be floating in space is a matter of speculation, but perhaps the adventurous spirit of its original stewards became infused within the fabric of this timepiece and compelled the universe to launch it into the great unknown."
msgstr "這款手錶曾經屬於先驅飛行員 Amelia Earhart，並和太空人 Shannon Walker 博士一起前往太空。\n\n它為何漂浮在太空中的，我們只能猜測，但也許它最初的設計者的冒險精神融入了這款手表的結構中，並迫使宇宙將它發射到偉大的未知領域。"

#. STRINGS.UI.SPACEARTIFACTS.AMELIASWATCH.DESCRIPTION
msgctxt "STRINGS.UI.SPACEARTIFACTS.AMELIASWATCH.DESCRIPTION"
msgid "It was discovered in a package labeled \"To be entrusted to Dr. Walker\"."
msgstr "它是在一個標有「寄給 Walker 博士」的包裡中發現的。"

